context#查看状态","content":"输入、输出和总 Token 用量，以及数据来自 Provider 报告还是估算。","locale":"zh-CN"},"42":{"id":"/docs/agent-commands-context-40","page_id":"/docs/agent-commands-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-commands-context#查看状态","content":"当前轮次和累计工作时长。","locale":"zh-CN"},"43":{"id":"/docs/agent-commands-context-41","page_id":"/docs/agent-commands-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-commands-context#查看状态","content":"长会话已经经过的上下文窗口与压缩信息。","locale":"zh-CN"},"44":{"id":"/docs/agent-commands-context-42","page_id":"/docs/agent-commands-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-commands-context#查看状态","content":"这些数据用于判断是否需要拆分任务或压缩上下文，不代表账单金额；实际计费仍以模型服务商为准。","locale":"zh-CN"},"45":{"id":"/docs/agent-commands-context-43","page_id":"/docs/agent-commands-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-commands-context#自动和手动压缩","content":"启用自动压缩后，应用会在接近配置阈值或触发运行预算时整理发送给模型的历史。也可以在会话允许时执行 `/compress` 主动压缩。","locale":"zh-CN"},"46":{"id":"/docs/agent-commands-context-44","page_id":"/docs/agent-commands-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-commands-context#自动和手动压缩","content":"压缩可能使用本地摘要或 Provider 声明支持的 Responses 远程压缩。实现方式由会话的模型协议和冻结能力决定，不会在运行中猜测服务端接口。","locale":"zh-CN"},"47":{"id":"/docs/agent-commands-context-45","page_id":"/docs/agent-commands-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-commands-context#自动和手动压缩","content":"消息和工具记录仍保留在界面中；压缩改变的是下一次模型请求使用的上下文。多次压缩会逐渐概括较早内容，重要约束应在新消息中重新明确。","locale":"zh-CN"},"48":{"id":"/docs/agent-commands-context-46","page_id":"/docs/agent-commands-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-commands-context#自动和手动压缩","content":"如果模型在输出任何内容前明确返回上下文不足，应用可以先压缩再重试；一旦已经产生输出，不会自动重放整轮请求，以免重复工具调用或外部操作。","locale":"zh-CN"},"49":{"id":"/docs/agent-commands-context-47","page_id":"/docs/agent-commands-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-commands-context#命令使用限制","content":"`/model`、`/effort` 和 `/fork` 需要当前会话空闲。","locale":"zh-CN"},"50":{"id":"/docs/agent-commands-context-48","page_id":"/docs/agent-commands-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-commands-context#命令使用限制","content":"`/compress` 只在会话存在可压缩内容且没有冲突操作时可用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"51":{"id":"/docs/agent-commands-context-49","page_id":"/docs/agent-commands-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-commands-context#命令使用限制","content":"`/memory` 的“污染”状态不可切回启用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"52":{"id":"/docs/agent-commands-context-50","page_id":"/docs/agent-commands-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-commands-context#命令使用限制","content":"`/ps` 和 `/stop` 只处理当前 Agent 会话的后台终端。","locale":"zh-CN"},"53":{"id":"/docs/agent-commands-context-51","page_id":"/docs/agent-commands-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-commands-context#命令使用限制","content":"`/mcp` 展示运行态；完整服务器配置仍在“设置 → Agent → MCP”中完成。","locale":"zh-CN"},"54":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","type":"page","content":"会话管理","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","Agent"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-conversations","locale":"zh-CN"},"55":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-0","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations","content":"新建、切换、归档、恢复、删除和分叉 Agent 会话。","locale":"zh-CN"},"56":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-1","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-conversations#新建和切换","content":"新建和切换","locale":"zh-CN"},"57":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-2","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-conversations#对话标题","content":"对话标题","locale":"zh-CN"},"58":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-3","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-conversations#归档和恢复","content":"归档和恢复","locale":"zh-CN"},"59":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-4","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-conversations#永久删除","content":"永久删除","locale":"zh-CN"},"60":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-5","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-conversations#分叉会话","content":"分叉会话","locale":"zh-CN"},"61":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-6","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-conversations#会话配置的生效范围","content":"会话配置的生效范围","locale":"zh-CN"},"62":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-7","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations","content":"一个 Agent 会话保存消息、工具调用、审批、模型选择和上下文状态。切换页面或重新打开应用后，可以继续查看已经持久化的记录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"63":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-8","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#新建和切换","content":"点击左侧会话列表顶部的“新建”，或执行 `/new` 创建会话。应用会根据当前界面附加相关上下文，并使用当时的默认模型策略和可用能力。","locale":"zh-CN"},"64":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-9","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#新建和切换","content":"会话列表会标记正在运行的会话和 Plan 模式会话。选择另一个会话不会自动停止当前任务；切换前应先确认是否仍有回答、压缩或后台终端在运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"65":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-10","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#新建和切换","content":"列表使用分页加载。会话较多时使用“加载更多”；进入长会话后，也可以在记录顶部继续加载更早的消息。","locale":"zh-CN"},"66":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-11","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#对话标题","content":"首条消息提交成功后，应用会立即根据消息显示一个短标题，并在后台请当前会话模型进一步精炼。标题生成不会向对话中添加消息或工具调用；如果生成失败，最初的短标题会继续保留。","locale":"zh-CN"},"67":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-12","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#对话标题","content":"点击标题旁的铅笔按钮可以手动重命名。按 Enter 或点击勾选按钮保存，按 Escape 或点击取消按钮放弃修改。手动保存的标题具有最终优先级，不会被延迟返回的自动生成结果覆盖。标题随会话持久化，重启应用后仍会保留。","locale":"zh-CN"},"68":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-13","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#归档和恢复","content":"归档用于隐藏暂时不用、但仍需要保留的会话：","locale":"zh-CN"},"69":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-14","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#归档和恢复","content":"归档不会删除消息、工具历史或记忆来源关系，也不会把仍在运行的后台进程视为已停止。","locale":"zh-CN"},"70":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-15","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#永久删除","content":"永久删除不可恢复。删除按钮需要再次确认，避免误触。","locale":"zh-CN"},"71":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-16","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#永久删除","content":"删除前先检查：","locale":"zh-CN"},"72":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-17","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#永久删除","content":"当前回答和压缩已经结束。","locale":"zh-CN"},"73":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-18","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#永久删除","content":"`/ps` 不再显示该会话的后台终端。","locale":"zh-CN"},"74":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-19","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#永久删除","content":"不再需要其中的消息、工具输出或记忆来源。","locale":"zh-CN"},"75":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-20","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#永久删除","content":"没有依赖该会话历史的分叉关系或待清理资源。","locale":"zh-CN"},"76":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-21","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#永久删除","content":"如果进程清理或会话关系尚未满足要求，后端会拒绝删除并保留数据。应先处理提示中的清理义务，再重试；不要把删除失败理解为记录已经部分移除。","locale":"zh-CN"},"77":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-22","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#分叉会话","content":"分叉适合保留现有路线，同时从某个历史位置尝试另一种方案。","locale":"zh-CN"},"78":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-23","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#分叉会话","content":"操作","locale":"zh-CN"},"79":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-24","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#分叉会话","content":"结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"80":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-25","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#分叉会话","content":"`/fork`","locale":"zh-CN"},"81":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-26","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#分叉会话","content":"从当前已经提交的会话末端创建分叉","locale":"zh-CN"},"82":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-27","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#分叉会话","content":"编辑历史用户消息","locale":"zh-CN"},"83":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-28","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#分叉会话","content":"在该消息之前创建分叉，并把原消息恢复到输入框供修改","locale":"zh-CN"},"84":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-29","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#分叉会话","content":"分叉不会覆盖或改写原会话。编辑历史消息也不会立即提交新请求：先检查恢复到输入框的内容，再发送修改后的任务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"85":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-30","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#分叉会话","content":"子会话可以复用分叉点之前的历史，但之后的消息分别保存。记忆贡献也按各自会话处理，子会话不会把父会话后续内容复制为自己的来源。","locale":"zh-CN"},"86":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-31","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#会话配置的生效范围","content":"当前会话记录自己的模型和推理强度；修改全局默认值不会自动替换它们。","locale":"zh-CN"},"87":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-32","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#会话配置的生效范围","content":"每个 user turn 都会捕获最新的已启用、可用 Skill catalog；所选会话的待处理变更按界面提示从下一 turn 生效。","locale":"zh-CN"},"88":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-33","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#会话配置的生效范围","content":"MCP 连接和工具目录会变化，但每个模型采样步骤使用开始时冻结的工具计划。","locale":"zh-CN"},"89":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-34","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#会话配置的生效范围","content":"记忆是否允许从该会话生成，在创建或分叉时按当时设置确定，也可以通过 `/memory` 查看。","locale":"zh-CN"},"90":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-35","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#会话配置的生效范围","content":"只是想整理列表时使用归档；只有在确定不再需要历史、输出和记忆来源时才永久删除。","locale":"zh-CN"},"91":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","type":"page","content":"MCP","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","Agent"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-mcp","locale":"zh-CN"},"92":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-0","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp","content":"配置 MCP 服务器、连接运行时并控制工具暴露和审批策略。","locale":"zh-CN"},"93":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-1","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-mcp#选择传输方式","content":"选择传输方式","locale":"zh-CN"},"94":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-2","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-mcp#添加并连接服务器","content":"添加并连接服务器","locale":"zh-CN"},"95":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-3","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-mcp#工具策略","content":"工具策略","locale":"zh-CN"},"96":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-4","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-mcp#在会话中检查-mcp","content":"在会话中检查 MCP","locale":"zh-CN"},"97":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-5","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-mcp#常见问题","content":"常见问题","locale":"zh-CN"},"98":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-6","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp","content":"MCP 可以把本地程序或远程服务的工具提供给 Agent。服务器可能访问文件、网络、数据库和第三方账号，因此配置连接和授予工具权限是两个都需要检查的步骤。","locale":"zh-CN"},"99":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-7","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp#选择传输方式","content":"适合由应用启动的本地 MCP 程序。配置可执行程序、参数、工作目录、公开环境变量和凭据环境变量引用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"100":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-8","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp#选择传输方式","content":"程序必须能在当前系统找到并正常启动。相对命令、缺少运行时或错误工作目录通常会在启动阶段失败。","locale":"zh-CN"},"101":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-9","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp#选择传输方式","content":"适合已经运行的远程或本地 HTTP 服务。配置 `http`/`https` URL、公开请求头、凭据请求头引用和 OAuth 策略。","locale":"zh-CN"},"102":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-10","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp#选择传输方式","content":"OAuth 可以设为禁用、可选或必需；需要登录时按界面打开浏览器并完成回调。","locale":"zh-CN"},"103":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-11","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp#选择传输方式","content":"MCP 凭据值会按原文保存在设置中。运行状态、诊断和 `/mcp verbose` 只应显示凭据是否存在，不应显示实际内容；仍不要公开分享 MCP 设置文件或包含凭据输入框的截图。","locale":"zh-CN"},"104":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-12","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp#添加并连接服务器","content":"“启用”是持久配置，“连接”是当前运行状态。服务器可能处于已禁用、启动中、就绪、刷新中、停止中或失败。修改配置后应查看运行态是否已经使用新的连接和目录版本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"105":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-13","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp#工具策略","content":"策略","locale":"zh-CN"},"106":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-14","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp#工具策略","content":"可选值","locale":"zh-CN"},"107":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-15","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp#工具策略","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"108":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-16","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp#工具策略","content":"审批","locale":"zh-CN"},"109":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-17","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp#工具策略","content":"允许、询问、拒绝","locale":"zh-CN"},"110":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-18","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp#工具策略","content":"决定工具调用是否直接允许、进入审批或完全禁止","locale":"zh-CN"},"111":{"id":"/d