,"url":"/docs/agent-skills#skill-来自哪里","content":"归属","locale":"zh-CN"},"385":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-11","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#skill-来自哪里","content":"位置","locale":"zh-CN"},"386":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-12","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#skill-来自哪里","content":"可编辑","locale":"zh-CN"},"387":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-13","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#skill-来自哪里","content":"Repo","locale":"zh-CN"},"388":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-14","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#skill-来自哪里","content":"工作区根目录旁的 `.agents/skills`","locale":"zh-CN"},"389":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-15","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#skill-来自哪里","content":"否","locale":"zh-CN"},"390":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-16","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#skill-来自哪里","content":"User","locale":"zh-CN"},"391":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-17","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#skill-来自哪里","content":"受管理的 Skills 根目录","locale":"zh-CN"},"392":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-18","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#skill-来自哪里","content":"是","locale":"zh-CN"},"393":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-19","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#skill-来自哪里","content":"System","locale":"zh-CN"},"394":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-20","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#skill-来自哪里","content":"随应用程序捆绑","locale":"zh-CN"},"395":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-21","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#skill-来自哪里","content":"否","locale":"zh-CN"},"396":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-22","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#skill-来自哪里","content":"加载失败的目录会与目录列表一并报告并跳过，因此一个格式错误的包不会让你失去其余的 Skill。","locale":"zh-CN"},"397":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-23","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#安装和检查","content":"在“设置 → Agent → Skills”中，可以从文件夹安装 Skill，也可以编写、复制、编辑其文件或删除它。只有受管理的 user 根目录中的 Skill 可以修改；repo 和捆绑的 Skill 是只读的，需要先复制一份。","locale":"zh-CN"},"398":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-24","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#安装和检查","content":"安装前检查：","locale":"zh-CN"},"399":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-25","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#安装和检查","content":"包名称、用途、版本和来源是否符合预期。","locale":"zh-CN"},"400":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-26","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#安装和检查","content":"`SKILL.md` 中声明的操作步骤和触发条件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"401":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-27","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#安装和检查","content":"引用资料、资源文件和脚本内容。","locale":"zh-CN"},"402":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-28","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#安装和检查","content":"需要的 MCP 服务、传输方式和外部地址。","locale":"zh-CN"},"403":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-29","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#安装和检查","content":"是否允许 Agent 在未点名时隐式使用该 Skill。","locale":"zh-CN"},"404":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-30","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#安装和检查","content":"Skill 中的说明和脚本可以引导 Agent\n执行命令、修改文件或调用外部工具。只安装可信来源，并在更新后重新检查差异和依赖。","locale":"zh-CN"},"405":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-31","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#启用状态与当前-turn","content":"被发现的 Skill 默认是开启的，直到你关闭它。启用状态决定 Skill 是否会提供给每个新接纳的 user turn。会话不保留自己的 catalog：turn admission 会捕获最新的只读 catalog，而已经运行的 turn 保持其冻结的 catalog 和 Skill context。","locale":"zh-CN"},"406":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-32","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#启用状态与当前-turn","content":"因此一个 Skill 只有两个值得关注的状态，设置页面会同时报告：","locale":"zh-CN"},"407":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-33","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#启用状态与当前-turn","content":"**当前可用**——已启用，会提供给下一个 turn。","locale":"zh-CN"},"408":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-34","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#启用状态与当前-turn","content":"**本 turn 已采用**——运行中的 turn 已读取并正在遵循它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"409":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-35","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#启用状态与当前-turn","content":"启用或停用从下一个 turn 开始生效。任何操作都不会改变正在运行的模型请求。","locale":"zh-CN"},"410":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-36","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#为下一条消息选择-skill","content":"执行 `/skills`，或使用输入框中的 Skill 选择器，为下一条消息选择已启用的 Skill。选中状态只随这次提交发送，不代表永久启用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"411":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-37","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#为下一条消息选择-skill","content":"提示中明确点名 Skill 可以减少歧义，例如：","locale":"zh-CN"},"412":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-38","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#为下一条消息选择-skill","content":"如果 Skill 允许隐式调用，它的名称和描述会进入模型 catalog；任务明确匹配时 Agent 必须使用它。仅允许显式调用的 Skill 不进入该 catalog，但仍可通过点名选中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"413":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-39","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#agent-能对-skill-做什么","content":"Agent 通过 `skills_list` 和 `skills_read` 读取 Skill，并可在你批准后使用 `enable_skill` 和 `disable_skill` 开启或关闭某个 Skill。编写、安装和删除 Skill 包使用普通的文件系统与命令工具——Skill 目录就是一个普通目录——因此这些操作与其他文件写入走同样的审批流程。","locale":"zh-CN"},"414":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-40","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#agent-能对-skill-做什么","content":"捆绑的 **Skill Creator** 和 **Skill Manager** 向 Agent 说明了这些工作流程。","locale":"zh-CN"},"415":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-41","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#删除","content":"删除只移除已安装的包。历史记录会保留早期 turn 实际采用的 Skill context，删除也不会改写正在运行的 turn。应先等待当前任务结束，再整理能力。","locale":"zh-CN"},"416":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","type":"page","content":"工具与后台终端","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","Agent"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","locale":"zh-CN"},"417":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-0","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","content":"阅读工具调用、检查输出，并管理 Agent 启动的后台命令。","locale":"zh-CN"},"418":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-1","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals#阅读工具卡片","content":"阅读工具卡片","locale":"zh-CN"},"419":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-2","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals#停止当前回答","content":"停止当前回答","locale":"zh-CN"},"420":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-3","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals#后台终端","content":"后台终端","locale":"zh-CN"},"421":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-4","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals#安全清理后台命令","content":"安全清理后台命令","locale":"zh-CN"},"422":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-5","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals#判断任务是否完成","content":"判断任务是否完成","locale":"zh-CN"},"423":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-6","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","content":"Agent 通过工具读取文件、修改代码、运行命令或调用应用功能。每次调用都会在消息记录中形成工具卡片，工具状态和最终回答共同构成任务结果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"424":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-7","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals#阅读工具卡片","content":"工具运行时会显示当前状态和实时输出；完成后卡片通常折叠，以保持会话可读。展开后可以查看：","locale":"zh-CN"},"425":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-8","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals#阅读工具卡片","content":"工具名称和模型提交的参数。","locale":"zh-CN"},"426":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-9","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals#阅读工具卡片","content":"命令、工作目录和退出状态。","locale":"zh-CN"},"427":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-10","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals#阅读工具卡片","content":"文件补丁及新增、修改、删除摘要。","locale":"zh-CN"},"428":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-11","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals#阅读工具卡片","content":"自动权限审查的结论和理由。","locale":"zh-CN"},"429":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-12","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals#阅读工具卡片","content":"标准输出、错误输出，以及被截断或省略的提示。","locale":"zh-CN"},"430":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-13","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals#阅读工具卡片","content":"工具可能处于运行、等待审批、等待用户、等待清理、成功、失败、取消或中断等状态。只有进入明确终态后，才能判断该次调用是否结束。","locale":"zh-CN"},"431":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-14","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals#阅读工具卡片","content":"实时输出和持久化历史都会控制体积。看到截断标记时，应让 Agent\n使用更精确的过滤命令或读取指定区段，而不是假设未显示的内容不存在。","locale":"zh-CN"},"432":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-15","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals#停止当前回答","content":"输入框为空且当前回答可取消时，主按钮会变为停止按钮。它用于取消正在进行的 Agent 回答或独立压缩。","locale":"zh-CN"},"433":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-16","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals#停止当前回答","content":"停止请求发出后，应用仍需要确认工具和进程已经进入终态。界面显示等待清理时，不要立即创建替代任务；先等待或按错误提示重试清理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"434":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-17","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals#后台终端","content":"长时间运行的命令可以进入后台，并获得一个终端会话标识。它们属于创建它们的 Agent 会话，不会因为折叠工具卡片、切换会话或关闭 Agent 窗口而自动结束。","locale":"zh-CN"},"435":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-18","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals#后台终端","content":"命令","locale":"zh-CN"},"436":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-19","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals#后台终端","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"437":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-20","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals#后台终端","content":"`/ps`","locale":"zh-CN"},"438":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-21","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals#后台终端","content":"列出当前 Agent 会话保留的后台终端及状态","locale":"zh-CN"},"439":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-22","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals#后台终端","content":"`/stop`","locale":"zh-CN"},"440":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-23","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals#后台终端","content":"请求停止并清理当前会话的全部后台终端","locale":"zh-CN"},"441":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-24","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals#后台终端","content":"`/stop` 与停止当前回答不是同一个操作。前者处理后台终端，后者取消当前模型轮次或压缩。","locale":"zh-CN"},"442":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-25","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals#安全清理后台命令","content":"后台开发服务器、文件监听器和交互式命令可能持续占用端口或文件。任务完成前应明确说明哪些进程被保留、哪些已经停止。","locale":"zh-CN"},"443":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-26","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals#判断任务是否完成","content":"工具调用显示成功，只证明该操作成功，不等于整个目标已经实现。","locale":"zh-CN"},"444":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-27","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals#判断任务是否完成","content":"测试命令需要检查退出状态和失败用例，而不只是看到部分输出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"445":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-28","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals#判断任务是否完成","content":"Agent 最终回答应说明修改内容、验证结果和仍未完成的事项。","locale":"zh-CN"},"446":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-29","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals#判断任务是否完成","content":"如果最终回答声称完成，但工具仍在运行或等待清理，应以后端状态为准。","locale":"zh-CN"},"447":{"id":"/docs/agent","page_id":"/docs/agent","type":"page","content":"Agent 快速开始","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","Agent"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent","locale":"zh-CN"},"448":{"id":"/docs/agent-0","page_id":"/docs/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent","content":"配置模型并完成第一个 Agent 会话。","locale":"zh-CN"},"449":{"id":"/docs/agent-1","page_id":"/docs/agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent#第一次使用","content":"第一次使用","locale":"zh-CN"},"450":{"id":"/docs/agent-2","page_id":"/docs/agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent#配置提供商","content":"配置提供商","locale":"zh-CN"},"451":{"id":"/docs/agent-3","page_id":"/docs/agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent#打开-agent","content":"打开 Agent","locale":"zh-CN"},"452":{"id":"/docs/agent-4","page_id":"/docs/agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent#新建会话","content":"新建会话","locale":"zh-CN"},"453":{"id":"/docs/agent-5","page_id":"/docs/agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent#选择模式和权限","content":"选择模式和权限","locale":"zh-CN"},"454":{"id":"/docs/agent-6","page_id":"/docs/agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent#发送任务","content":"发送任务","locale":"zh-CN"},"455":{"id":"/docs/agent-7","page_id":"/docs/agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent#推荐的任务写法","content":"推荐的任务写法","locale":"zh-CN"},"456":{"id":"/docs/agent-8","page_id":"/docs/agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent#执行过程中看什么","content":"执行过程中看什么","locale":"zh-CN"},"457":{"id":"/docs/agent-9","page_id":"/docs/agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent#继续阅读","content":"继续阅读","locale":"zh-CN"},"458":{"id":"/docs/agent-10","page_id":"/docs/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent","content":"Agent 可以读取项目上下文、调用应用工具、运行命令并协助修改文件。它能做什么取决于当前模型、权限模式、MCP、Skills 和会话状态；开始前至少需要配置一个已启用的模型提供商。","locale":"zh-CN"},"459":{"id":"/docs/agent-11","page_id":"/docs/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent#配置提供商","content":"打开“设置 → Agent”，在模型提供商区域添加 Provider。选择服务端实际支持的协议，填写 API 地址和凭据并保存。","locale":"zh-CN"},"460":{"id":"/docs/agent-12","page_id":"/docs/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent#配置提供商","content":"Provider 只描述服务端连接；模型在单独的模型策略中选择。保存 Provider 后，再选择默认 Provider 和模型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"461":{"id":"/docs/agent-13","page_id":"/docs/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent#打开-agent","content":"点击标题栏中的 Agent 按钮。Agent 默认作为浮动面板打开，也可以通过窗口操作将其分离为独立窗口。","locale":"zh-CN"},"462":{"id":"/docs/agent-14","page_id":"/docs/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent#打开-agent","content":"左侧是会话列表，右侧依次显示当前会话、消息记录、工具调用和输入框。","locale":"zh-CN"},"463":{"id":"/docs/agent-15","page_id":"/docs/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent#新建会话","content":"点击会话列表上方的“新建”按钮，或者在输入框执行 `/new`。如果没有配置默认模型，仍可创建会话，但需要点击输入框旁的模型按钮或执行 `/model` 后才能发送消息。","locale":"zh-CN"},"464":{"id":"/docs/agent-16","page_id":"/docs/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent#新建会话","content":"应用会根据当前页面和已有实例确定可用的项目上下文，不需要在新建会话时选择任意工作目录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"465":{"id":"/docs/agent-17","page_id":"/docs/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent#选择模式和权限","content":"“默认”模式适合直接分析和执行；“Plan”模式只进行调查、提问和方案设计。权限模式决定工具操作是直接执行、自动审查还是等待人工审批。","locale":"zh-CN"},"466":{"id":"/docs/agent-18","page_id":"/docs/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent#选择模式和权限","content":"第一次使用建议采用“手动”或“自动审查”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"467":{"id":"/docs/agent-19","page_id":"/docs/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent#发送任务","content":"写明目标、允许修改的范围和验收方式，然后按 `Enter` 发送。需要换行时使用 `Shift + Enter`。也可以附加图片、引用文件或为本轮选择 Skill。","locale":"zh-CN"},"468":{"id":"/docs/agent-20","page_id":"/docs/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent#推荐的任务写法","content":"一个容易验证的任务通常包含：目标、范围限制、需要保留的行为以及验证命令。涉及发布、删除、外部消息或账号操作时，还应写明准确目标。","locale":"zh-CN"},"469":{"id":"/docs/agent-21","page_id":"/docs/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent#执行过程中看什么","content":"Agent 的说明文字用于汇报当前判断和下一步动作。","locale":"zh-CN"},"470":{"id":"/docs/agent-22","page_id":"/docs/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent#执行过程中看什么","content":"工具卡片显示命令、文件操作、审批结果和输出；展开卡片可以查看详细内容。","locale":"zh-CN"},"471":{"id":"/docs/agent-23","page_id":"/docs/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent#执行过程中看什么","content":"输入框为空时，主按钮可停止当前回答；输入了新内容时，消息会先加入队列，不会自动打断正在进行的回答。","locale":"zh-CN"},"472":{"id":"/docs/agent-24","page_id":"/docs/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent#执行过程中看什么","content":"长时间命令可能转为后台终端。关闭 Agent 面板不代表进程已经停止，应使用 `/ps` 检查、使用 `/stop` 清理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"473":{"id":"/docs/agent-25","page_id":"/docs/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent#执行过程中看什么","content":"最终回答和工具的终态共同说明任务是否完成；不要把“工具已经开始运行”当作成功。","locale":"zh-CN"},"474":{"id":"/docs/agent-26","page_id":"/docs/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent#执行过程中看什么","content":"更高权限只会减少审批步骤，不代表命令、文件修改或外部操作自动安全。允许操作前应核对目标、参数和风险提示，完成后仍需检查差异和测试结果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"475":{"id":"/docs/agent-27","page_id":"/docs/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent#继续阅读","content":"<Card title=\"提供商与模型\" href=\"/docs/agent-providers-models\" description=\"配置连接、模型能力和上下文策略。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"476":{"id":"/docs/agent-28","page_id":"/docs/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent#继续阅读","content":"<Card title=\"会话管理\" href=\"/docs/agent-conversations\" description=\"管理历史、归档、删除和分叉。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"477":{"id":"/docs/agent-29","page_id":"/docs/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent#继续阅读","content":"<Card title=\"消息与附件\" href=\"/docs/agent-messages-attachments\" description=\"引用文件、添加图片并引导正在进行的任务。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"478":{"id":"/docs/agent-30","page_id":"/docs/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent#继续阅读","content":"<Card title=\"模式与计划\" href=\"/docs/agent-modes-plans\" description=\"理解默认模式、Plan 模式和两类计划。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"479":{"id":"/docs/agent-31","page_id":"/docs/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent#继续阅读","content":"<Card title=\"权限与审批\" href=\"/docs/agent-permissions\" description=\"核对审批内容并选择合适的权限模式。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"480":{"id":"/docs/agent-32","page_id":"/docs/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent#继续阅读","content":"<Card title=\"命令与上下文\" href=\"/docs/agent-commands-context\" description=\"使用斜杠命令、查看用量和压缩会话。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"481":{"id":"/docs","page_id":"/docs","type":"page","content":"Hanafubuki","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","开始"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs","locale":"zh-CN"},"482":{"id":"/docs-0","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"一站式安装、运行和管理本地生成式 AI WebUI。","locale":"zh-CN"},"483":{"id":"/docs-1","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"Hanafubuki 是一个基于 Tauri 的桌面管理器，用来安装、导入、运行和维护本地生成式 AI WebUI。它统一管理 Python、Git、运行参数、模型、扩展、快照和诊断信息，并提供可连接本地工具的 Agent。","locale":"zh-CN"},"484":{"id":"/docs-2","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"目前支持 Stable Diffusion WebUI、ComfyUI、InvokeAI、Fooocus、SD Trainer 和 Qwen TTS WebUI。不同类型提供的管理功能可能不同，界面会根据实例能力显示可用项目。","locale":"zh-CN"},"485":{"id":"/docs-3","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"<Card title=\"第一次使用\" href=\"/docs/quick-start\" description=\"从安装应用到启动第一个 WebUI。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"486":{"id":"/docs-4","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"<Card title=\"安装应用\" href=\"/docs/installation\" description=\"选择安装包或便携版并完成首次启动。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"487":{"id":"/docs-5","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"<Card title=\"使用 Agent\" href=\"/docs/agent\" description=\"配置模型并在项目环境中开始会话。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"488":{"id":"/docs-6","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"<Card title=\"故障排查\" href=\"/docs/troubleshooting\" description=\"从任务输出、日志和诊断包定位问题。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"489":{"id":"/docs-7","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"Hanafubuki 仍在开发和测试中。重要实例和配置建议定期创建快照或自行备份。","locale":"zh-CN"},"490":{"id":"/docs/installation","page_id":"/docs/installation","type":"page","content":"安装 Hanafubuki","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","开始"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/installation","locale":"zh-CN"},"491":{"id":"/docs/installation-0","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation","content":"在下载页选择安装包或便携版，并完成首次启动。","locale":"zh-CN"},"492":{"id":"/docs/installation-1","page_id":"/docs/installation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/installation#先选择一种","content":"先选择一种","locale":"zh-CN"},"493":{"id":"/docs/installation-2","page_id":"/docs/installation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/installation#在下载页获取","content":"在下载页获取","locale":"zh-CN"},"494":{"id":"/docs/installation-3","page_id":"/docs/installation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/installation#安装包格式","content":"安装包格式","locale":"zh-CN"},"495":{"id":"/docs/installation-4","page_id":"/docs/installation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/installation#按平台安装","content":"按平台安装","locale":"zh-CN"},"496":{"id":"/docs/installation-5","page_id":"/docs/installation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/installation#便携版","content":"便携版","locale":"zh-CN"},"497":{"id":"/docs/installation-6","page_id":"/docs/installation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/installation#首次启动","content":"首次启动","locale":"zh-CN"},"498":{"id":"/docs/installation-7","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation","content":"Hanafubuki 提供两种获取方式：**安装包**把应用装进系统，**便携版**是一个解压即用的 Launcher。两者都在下载页提供，并且都会自动识别当前系统。","locale":"zh-CN"},"499":{"id":"/docs/installation-8","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#先选择一种","content":"安装包","locale":"zh-CN"},"500":{"id":"/docs/installation-9","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#先选择一种","content":"便携版","locale":"zh-CN"},"501":{"id":"/docs/installation-10","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#先选择一种","content":"使用方式","locale":"zh-CN"},"502":{"id":"/docs/installation-11","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#先选择一种","content":"安装后从桌面或开始菜单启动","locale":"zh-CN"},"503":{"id":"/docs/installation-12","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#先选择一种","content":"解压后直接运行 Launcher","locale":"zh-CN"},"504":{"id":"/docs/installation-13","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#先选择一种","content":"应用本体","locale":"zh-CN"},"505":{"id":"/docs/installation-14","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#先选择一种","content":"包含在安装包中","locale":"zh-CN"},"506":{"id":"/docs/installation-15","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#先选择一种","content":"由 Launcher 下载、校验并在损坏时修复","locale":"zh-CN"},"507":{"id":"/docs/installation-16","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#先选择一种","content":"数据位置","locale":"zh-CN"},"508":{"id":"/docs/installation-17","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#先选择一种","content":"系统的应用数据目录","locale":"zh-CN"},"509":{"id":"/docs/installation-18","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#先选择一种","content":"程序旁的 `.