ocale":"zh-CN"},"545":{"id":"/docs/installation-54","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#安装包格式","content":"RPM 包（`.rpm`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"546":{"id":"/docs/installation-55","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#安装包格式","content":"通过系统包管理器安装；不参与应用内更新","locale":"zh-CN"},"547":{"id":"/docs/installation-56","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#安装包格式","content":"不参与应用内更新的格式仍然可以检查更新，应用会改为提供当前平台的手动安装包。","locale":"zh-CN"},"548":{"id":"/docs/installation-57","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#按平台安装","content":"下载安装程序并按提示完成安装，随后从桌面或开始菜单启动。","locale":"zh-CN"},"549":{"id":"/docs/installation-58","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#按平台安装","content":"选择免安装压缩包时，解压到有写入权限的目录再运行其中的可执行文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"550":{"id":"/docs/installation-59","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#按平台安装","content":"当前 Windows 安装包尚未签名。启动安装程序或免安装版时如果出现 `Windows 已保护你的电脑。Microsoft Defender SmartScreen 阻止了无法识别的应用启动。运行此应用可能会导致你的电脑存在风险。`，请先确认文件来自本站，再点击提示中的“更多信息”，然后点击“仍然运行”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"551":{"id":"/docs/installation-60","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#按平台安装","content":"打开磁盘映像，把 Hanafubuki 拖入“应用程序”。应用归档解压后得到同一个 `.app`，同样放入“应用程序”即可。","locale":"zh-CN"},"552":{"id":"/docs/installation-61","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#按平台安装","content":"当前 macOS 安装包尚未签名。若首次运行出现 `“Hanafubuki” is damaged and can't be opened. You should move it to the Trash.`，请确认安装包来自本站，然后打开“终端”并移除应用的隔离属性：","locale":"zh-CN"},"553":{"id":"/docs/installation-62","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#按平台安装","content":"输入 macOS 密码时终端不会显示字符；完成后重新打开 Hanafubuki。若系统显示的是其他安全确认提示，再前往“系统设置 → 隐私与安全性”确认打开。","locale":"zh-CN"},"554":{"id":"/docs/installation-63","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#按平台安装","content":"AppImage 赋予执行权限后直接运行：","locale":"zh-CN"},"555":{"id":"/docs/installation-64","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#按平台安装","content":"也可以使用系统包管理器安装 `.deb` 或 `.rpm`，安装后从应用菜单启动：","locale":"zh-CN"},"556":{"id":"/docs/installation-65","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#按平台安装","content":"Windows\n的免安装压缩包只是省去安装步骤，数据仍然写入系统的应用数据目录。需要数据跟着程序走时，请使用下面的便携版\nLauncher。","locale":"zh-CN"},"557":{"id":"/docs/installation-66","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#便携版","content":"便携版是一个独立的 Launcher。设置、日志、应用本体和实例数据都保存在它旁边的 `.hanafubuki-launcher` 目录里，不写入系统安装信息。","locale":"zh-CN"},"558":{"id":"/docs/installation-67","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#便携版","content":"下载对应平台的 Launcher 压缩包，解压到有写入权限的目录；不要放在只读介质或系统目录中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"559":{"id":"/docs/installation-68","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#便携版","content":"当前 Windows 便携版同样尚未签名。首次运行 Launcher 时如果 Microsoft Defender SmartScreen 显示\n`Windows 已保护你的电脑`，请先确认压缩包来自本站，然后点击“更多信息”，再点击出现的“仍然运行”按钮。\n“仍然运行”只会在展开“更多信息”后显示。","locale":"zh-CN"},"560":{"id":"/docs/installation-69","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#便携版","content":"当前 macOS 便携版同样尚未签名。确认压缩包来自本站后，在“终端”输入\n`xattr -dr com.apple.quarantine` 并加一个空格，将解压得到的 `Hanafubuki Launcher.app`\n从“访达”拖入终端窗口，再按回车。完整命令类似：","locale":"zh-CN"},"561":{"id":"/docs/installation-70","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#便携版","content":"完成后重新打开 Launcher。命令必须指向实际的 `.app`；不要直接照抄示例中的“实际路径”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"562":{"id":"/docs/installation-71","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#便携版","content":"Launcher 还会处理这些情况：","locale":"zh-CN"},"563":{"id":"/docs/installation-72","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#便携版","content":"首次运行时扫描自己所在的目录，把放在旁边的 WebUI 目录接管为实例。","locale":"zh-CN"},"564":{"id":"/docs/installation-73","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#便携版","content":"本体文件缺失或损坏时按清单重新下载并修复。","locale":"zh-CN"},"565":{"id":"/docs/installation-74","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#便携版","content":"更新源都不可用时跳过远程检查，直接用已下载的版本启动。","locale":"zh-CN"},"566":{"id":"/docs/installation-75","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#便携版","content":"读取系统代理配置，用于自身的下载请求。","locale":"zh-CN"},"567":{"id":"/docs/installation-76","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#便携版","content":"Launcher 在 Windows 上需要长路径支持和 Visual C++\n运行库。缺少时会各请求一次管理员权限来写入注册表或安装运行库，之后仍以普通用户身份运行。取消授权会停在重试界面。","locale":"zh-CN"},"568":{"id":"/docs/installation-77","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#首次启动","content":"应用会准备 Python、Micromamba 和 Git 等运行组件。保持网络连接并等待准备完成。","locale":"zh-CN"},"569":{"id":"/docs/installation-78","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#首次启动","content":"若准备失败，前往“设置 → 运行环境”重试或调整下载来源，也可以参考运行环境故障排查。","locale":"zh-CN"},"570":{"id":"/docs/installation-79","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#首次启动","content":"准备完成后，继续阅读快速开始安装或导入第一个 WebUI。","locale":"zh-CN"},"571":{"id":"/docs/installation-80","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#首次启动","content":"<Card title=\"快速开始\" href=\"/docs/quick-start\" description=\"创建并启动第一个 WebUI 实例。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"572":{"id":"/docs/installation-81","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#首次启动","content":"<Card title=\"关于与更新\" href=\"/docs/settings-about-updates\" description=\"查看版本、检查更新并安装新版本。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"573":{"id":"/docs/installation-82","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#首次启动","content":"<Card title=\"运行环境\" href=\"/docs/settings-runtime\" description=\"调整 Python、Git 与下载来源。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"574":{"id":"/docs/installation-83","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#首次启动","content":"<Card title=\"运行环境故障排查\" href=\"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime\" description=\"准备失败或组件缺失时的处理步骤。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"575":{"id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics","page_id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics","type":"page","content":"实例诊断","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","实例管理"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-diagnostics","locale":"zh-CN"},"576":{"id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics-0","page_id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-diagnostics","content":"收集当前实例的环境、任务、日志和配置，并安全地导出诊断包。","locale":"zh-CN"},"577":{"id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics-1","page_id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-diagnostics#收集诊断包","content":"收集诊断包","locale":"zh-CN"},"578":{"id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics-2","page_id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-diagnostics#复现并记录问题","content":"复现并记录问题","locale":"zh-CN"},"579":{"id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics-3","page_id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-diagnostics#启动收集","content":"启动收集","locale":"zh-CN"},"580":{"id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics-4","page_id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-diagnostics#检查完成状态","content":"检查完成状态","locale":"zh-CN"},"581":{"id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics-5","page_id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-diagnostics#检查并导出","content":"检查并导出","locale":"zh-CN"},"582":{"id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics-6","page_id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-diagnostics#诊断包可能包含什么","content":"诊断包可能包含什么","locale":"zh-CN"},"583":{"id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics-7","page_id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-diagnostics#分享前检查","content":"分享前检查","locale":"zh-CN"},"584":{"id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics-8","page_id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-diagnostics","content":"实例诊断用于把一次问题相关的环境和运行信息收集到 ZIP 中。它不会自动修复实例，适合在启动、扩展、热补丁或环境问题已经复现后提供排查材料。","locale":"zh-CN"},"585":{"id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics-9","page_id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-diagnostics#复现并记录问题","content":"记录操作步骤、大致时间和可见错误。不要连续重试到旧任务输出被新任务淹没。","locale":"zh-CN"},"586":{"id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics-10","page_id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-diagnostics#启动收集","content":"打开“维护 → 诊断”，点击“收集诊断信息”。进度显示在实例管理器右下角；离开诊断页不会取消收集。","locale":"zh-CN"},"587":{"id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics-11","page_id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-diagnostics#检查完成状态","content":"收集完成后刷新诊断包列表。列表会显示文件名、创建时间、大小和采集问题数量；个别来源读取失败时，其他内容仍可能正常写入压缩包。","locale":"zh-CN"},"588":{"id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics-12","page_id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-diagnostics#检查并导出","content":"点击“打开诊断包目录”找到原文件，或使用“另存副本”保存到指定位置。先自行解压检查，再发送给可信的维护者。","locale":"zh-CN"},"589":{"id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics-13","page_id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-diagnostics#诊断包可能包含什么","content":"当前 WebUI 的环境收集结果；","locale":"zh-CN"},"590":{"id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics-14","page_id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-diagnostics#诊断包可能包含什么","content":"实例快照、持久化记录和组件路径；","locale":"zh-CN"},"591":{"id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics-15","page_id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-diagnostics#诊断包可能包含什么","content":"当前保留的实例任务、启动阶段和任务输出；","locale":"zh-CN"},"592":{"id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics-16","page_id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-diagnostics#诊断包可能包含什么","content":"热补丁持久化配置、有效配置、状态、事件和日志；","locale":"zh-CN"},"593":{"id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics-17","page_id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-diagnostics#诊断包可能包含什么","content":"支持排查所需的应用设置、身份和诊断信息；","locale":"zh-CN"},"594":{"id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics-18","page_id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-diagnostics#诊断包可能包含什么","content":"`manifest.json` 中的采集范围、问题、文件大小和 SHA-256。","locale":"zh-CN"},"595":{"id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics-19","page_id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-diagnostics#诊断包可能包含什么","content":"实例诊断与“设置 → 日志与诊断”中的应用诊断不同。实例诊断只以当前实例为主要目标；应用诊断可以按设置把所有实例一起收集到一个压缩包中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"596":{"id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics-20","page_id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-diagnostics#诊断包可能包含什么","content":"被收集的内容会按原值保留，可能包含凭据、令牌、环境变量、本地路径、命令参数和任务输出。虽然部分专门保存凭据的文件会整体排除，但不能据此认为压缩包可以公开分享。","locale":"zh-CN"},"597":{"id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics-21","page_id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-diagnostics#分享前检查","content":"诊断包没有自动过期或删除策略。页面当前不提供删除按钮，需要使用“打开诊断包目录”后自行管理磁盘文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"598":{"id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics-22","page_id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-diagnostics#分享前检查","content":"<Card title=\"日志、诊断与求助\" href=\"/docs/troubleshooting-reporting\" description=\"选择诊断范围并提交可复现的问题报告。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"599":{"id":"/docs/instance-extensions","page_id":"/docs/instance-extensions","type":"page","content":"扩展管理","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","实例管理"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-extensions","locale":"zh-CN"},"600":{"id":"/docs/instance-extensions-0","page_id":"/docs/instance-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-extensions","content":"安装、更新、启停、切换版本或卸载当前 WebUI 支持的扩展。","locale":"zh-CN"},"601":{"id":"/docs/instance-extensions-1","page_id":"/docs/instance-extensions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-extensions#安装扩展","content":"安装扩展","locale":"zh-CN"},"602":{"id":"/docs/instance-extensions-2","page_id":"/docs/instance-extensions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-extensions#管理本地扩展","content":"管理本地扩展","locale":"zh-CN"},"603":{"id":"/docs/instance-extensions-3","page_id":"/docs/instance-extensions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-extensions#更新或切换版本","content":"更新或切换版本","locale":"zh-CN"},"604":{"id":"/docs/instance-extensions-4","page_id":"/docs/instance-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-extensions","content":"“扩展”页是否可用，以及提供哪些按钮，由当前 WebUI 的管理能力决定。页面通常包含“本地扩展”和“扩展市场”两个视图；不支持市场的实例仍可能允许管理已经安装的扩展。","locale":"zh-CN"},"605":{"id":"/docs/instance-extensions-5","page_id":"/docs/instance-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-extensions#安装扩展","content":"扩展市场使用后端缓存的索引。需要获取新条目或最新安装状态时点击刷新；输入搜索词只筛选当前已经加载的数据。","locale":"zh-CN"},"606":{"id":"/docs/instance-extensions-6","page_id":"/docs/instance-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-extensions#管理本地扩展","content":"操作","locale":"zh-CN"},"607":{"id":"/docs/instance-extensions-7","page_id":"/docs/instance-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-extensions#管理本地扩展","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"608":{"id":"/docs/instance-extensions-8","page_id":"/docs/instance-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-extensions#管理本地扩展","content":"启用 / 停用","locale":"zh-CN"},"609":{"id":"/docs/instance-extensions-9","page_id":"/docs/instance-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-extensions#管理本地扩展","content":"修改扩展状态，通常在下次启动 WebUI 时生效","locale":"zh-CN"},"610":{"id":"/docs/instance-extensions-10","page_id":"/docs/instance-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-extensions#管理本地扩展","content":"更新","locale":"zh-CN"},"611":{"id":"/docs/instance-extensions-11","page_id":"/docs/instance-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-extensions#管理本地扩展","content":"更新一个 Git 型扩展","locale":"zh-CN"},"612":{"id":"/docs/instance-extensions-12","page_id":"/docs/instance-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-extensions#管理本地扩展","content":"全部更新","locale":"zh-CN"},"613":{"id":"/docs/instance-extensions-13","page_id":"/docs/instance-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-extensions#管理本地扩展","content":"依次处理当前可以更新的扩展，失败项在任务中心中查看","locale":"zh-CN"},"614":{"id":"/docs/instance-extensions-14","page_id":"/docs/instance-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-extensions#管理本地扩展","content":"分支 / 提交","locale":"zh-CN"},"615":{"id":"/docs/instance-extensions-15","page_id":"/docs/instance-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-extensions#管理本地扩展","content":"将 Git 型扩展切换到指定分支或提交","locale":"zh-CN"},"616":{"id":"/docs/instance-extensions-16","page_id":"/docs/instance-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-extensions#管理本地扩展","content":"Registry 版本","locale":"zh-CN"},"617":{"id":"/docs/instance-extensions-17","page_id":"/docs/instance-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-extensions#管理本地扩展","content":"为支持 Registry 的 ComfyUI 节点选择已发布版本","locale":"zh-CN"},"618":{"id":"/docs/instance-extensions-18","page_id":"/docs/instance-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-extensions#管理本地扩展","content":"卸载","locale":"zh-CN"},"619":{"id":"/docs/instance-extensions-19","page_id":"/docs/instance-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-extensions#管理本地扩展","content":"删除扩展目录或由当前 WebUI 执行对应卸载操作","locale":"zh-CN"},"620":{"id":"/docs/instance-extensions-20","page_id":"/docs/instance-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-extensions#管理本地扩展","content":"列表中的来源标记可以帮助判断可用操作：Git 来源通常支持分支与提交；Registry 来源可能支持发布版本；本地来源不一定能够自动更新。","locale":"zh-CN"},"621":{"id":"/docs/instance-extensions-21","page_id":"/docs/instance-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-extensions#更新或切换版本","content":"卸载确认窗口明确表示扩展文件将从实例中删除。扩展自己的配置、模型或输出是否一并消失取决于它们实际存放的位置；卸载前应先检查并备份。","locale":"zh-CN"},"622":{"id":"/docs/instance-extensions-22","page_id":"/docs/instance-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-extensions#更新或切换版本","content":"扩展下载失败时检查网络与代理和镜像；需要整体回退环境时使用快照管理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"623":{"id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch","page_id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch","type":"page","content":"热补丁","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","实例管理"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-hotpatch","locale":"zh-CN"},"624":{"id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch-0","page_id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-hotpatch","content":"编辑并应用当前 WebUI 支持的热补丁配置，查看运行时日志。","locale":"zh-CN"},"625":{"id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch-1","page_id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-hotpatch#配置编辑方式","content":"配置编辑方式","locale":"zh-CN"},"626":{"id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch-2","page_id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-hotpatch#保存和应用的区别","content":"保存和应用的区别","locale":"zh-CN"},"627":{"id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch-3","page_id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-hotpatch#修改热补丁","content":"修改热补丁","locale":"zh-CN"},"628":{"id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch-4","page_id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-hotpatch","content":"热补丁由当前 WebUI 提供，只有后端检测到配置或运行时能力时才会显示。“热补丁”页负责编辑配置和查看日志；实时运行状态已经放在实例信息的“热补丁运行时”区域。","locale":"zh-CN"},"629":{"id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch-5","page_id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-hotpatch#配置编辑方式","content":"表单根据当前热补丁目录生成。修改布尔值、整数、选项、列表或对象后，会在短暂合并连续输入后自动保存完整配置；“恢复默认值”在表单模式下也会自动保存。","locale":"zh-CN"},"630":{"id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch-6","page_id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-hotpatch#配置编辑方式","content":"原始编辑器用于精确修改完整配置对象。输入必须是合法 JSON\n对象；修改只形成草稿，需要点击保存。半成品或格式错误的 JSON 不会写入实例。","locale":"zh-CN"},"631":{"id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch-7","page_id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-hotpatch#配置编辑方式","content":"“规范化”会让后端按照当前目录整理草稿，例如补齐、转换或拒绝不符合字段约束的值。它不等同于应用到正在运行的 WebUI。","locale":"zh-CN"},"632":{"id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch-8","page_id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-hotpatch#保存和应用的区别","content":"操作","locale":"zh-CN"},"633":{"id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch-9","page_id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-hotpatch#保存和应用的区别","content":"结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"634":{"id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch-10","page_id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-hotpatch#保存和应用的区别","content":"保存配置","locale":"zh-CN"},"635":{"id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch-11","page_id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-hotpatch#保存和应用的区别","content":"持久化当前实例的热补丁配置","locale":"zh-CN"},"636":{"id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch-12","page_id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-hotpatch#保存和应用的区别","content":"应用到本地配置","locale":"zh-CN"},"637":{"id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch-13","page_id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-hotpatch#保存和应用的区别","content":"让支持该操作的 WebUI 更新本地补丁配置","locale":"zh-CN"},"638":{"id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch-14","page_id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-hotpatch#保存和应用的区别","content":"应用到运行时","locale":"zh-CN"},"639":{"id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch-15","page_id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-hotpatch#保存和应用的区别","content":"把规范化后的配置发送给当前正在运行的热补丁会话","locale":"zh-CN"},"640":{"id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch-16","page_id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-hotpatch#保存和应用的区别","content":"运行时未启动时，“应用到运行时”不可用。此时先保存配置，再启动 WebUI；运