/docs/instance-launch#环境变量","content":"只添加当前 WebUI、扩展或脚本明确需要的变量。","locale":"zh-CN"},"672":{"id":"/docs/instance-launch-28","page_id":"/docs/instance-launch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-launch#环境变量","content":"`PATH`、`PYTHONPATH`、`MAMBA_*` 和 `CONDA_*` 等受管环境值可能被应用保留或重新组合，不应依赖它们覆盖桌面运行环境。","locale":"zh-CN"},"673":{"id":"/docs/instance-launch-29","page_id":"/docs/instance-launch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-launch#环境变量","content":"环境变量值会正常显示，也可能进入任务输出或诊断包；分享截图和诊断前先检查令牌等敏感内容。","locale":"zh-CN"},"674":{"id":"/docs/instance-launch-30","page_id":"/docs/instance-launch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-launch#启动时发现不兼容参数","content":"保存阶段允许保留当前参数目录尚未识别的选项，以兼容分支、扩展或未来版本。真正启动时，后端会再次使用当前参数目录检查未知参数、孤立值和其他约束，并提供以下选择：","locale":"zh-CN"},"675":{"id":"/docs/instance-launch-31","page_id":"/docs/instance-launch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-launch#启动时发现不兼容参数","content":"选择","locale":"zh-CN"},"676":{"id":"/docs/instance-launch-32","page_id":"/docs/instance-launch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-launch#启动时发现不兼容参数","content":"结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"677":{"id":"/docs/instance-launch-33","page_id":"/docs/instance-launch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-launch#启动时发现不兼容参数","content":"取消","locale":"zh-CN"},"678":{"id":"/docs/instance-launch-34","page_id":"/docs/instance-launch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-launch#启动时发现不兼容参数","content":"不创建 WebUI 运行资源，返回配置页修改","locale":"zh-CN"},"679":{"id":"/docs/instance-launch-35","page_id":"/docs/instance-launch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-launch#启动时发现不兼容参数","content":"仅本次忽略","locale":"zh-CN"},"680":{"id":"/docs/instance-launch-36","page_id":"/docs/instance-launch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-launch#启动时发现不兼容参数","content":"本次继续使用原始参数，保存的配置不改变","locale":"zh-CN"},"681":{"id":"/docs/instance-launch-37","page_id":"/docs/instance-launch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-launch#启动时发现不兼容参数","content":"移除不兼容项并