e_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#重命名","content":"重命名只改变 Hanafubuki 中显示的实例名称。实例 ID、身份、实例根目录和所有组件路径保持不变；提交相同名称不会产生新的配置修改。","locale":"zh-CN"},"724":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-37","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#迁移实例","content":"迁移会移动完整实例根目录，而不是只修改路径设置。页面要求选择一个已经存在的目标父目录；后端会在其下追加当前实例目录名，并要求最终目录尚不存在。","locale":"zh-CN"},"725":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-38","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#迁移实例","content":"实例根目录内的 Python、Core、模型和其他文件会随整个目录移动。位于根目录之外的组件路径保持原位置，不会复制、移动或删除。","locale":"zh-CN"},"726":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-39","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#选择目标父目录","content":"目标父目录必须存在，并且最终实例目录不能已存在。迁移不会合并或覆盖现有目录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"727":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-40","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#阅读迁移预览","content":"应用会重新验证实例身份、配置、路径重叠和外部组件，并在确认窗口显示最终目录和警告。","locale":"zh-CN"},"728":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-41","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#开始并等待迁移","content":"确认后，应用依次停止 WebUI、管理服务、WebView 和实例终端，再移动文件并原子更新配置。跨磁盘迁移可能需要完整复制，因此时间取决于实例大小。","locale":"zh-CN"},"729":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-42","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#验证迁移结果","content":"完成后重新打开实例，检查根目录和受管组件路径，再使用实例终端和一次实际启动验证环境。","locale":"zh-CN"},"730":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-43","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#验证迁移结果","content":"迁移不会扫描和改写 `.pth`、脚本、环境变量或其他文件中的绝对路径。如果某个第三方组件记录了旧位置，需要在迁移后按该组件自己的方式修正。","locale":"zh-CN"},"731":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-44","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#验证迁移结果","content":"出现“迁移需要恢复”时，实例会保持关闭以保护文件一致性。不要手动移动或删除源目录、目标目录或临时目录；选择原来的目标父目录并再次点击“迁移实例”继续恢复。","locale":"zh-CN"},"732":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-45","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#重装实例","content":"重装会保留实例记录和当前配置，并重新执行完整的 Python 与 WebUI 安装流程。默认尽量复用现有组件；“强制重建 Python”或“强制重建 Core”会在安装前永久删除选中的组件目录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"733":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-46","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#重装实例","content":"适合补齐缺失依赖或重新执行安装流程。现有 Python 和 Core\n会尽量复用，但安装器仍可能更新依赖或代码状态。Core\n位于实例根目录之外时，只要它仍是实例记录指向的同一个现有目录，普通重装也可以继续使用并更新它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"734":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-47","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#重装实例","content":"适合组件损坏且无法修复的情况。仅勾选确实需要重建的组件；位于实例根目录之外的 Python/Core\n不允许被强制删除，任务会在文件修改前拒绝。","locale":"zh-CN"},"735":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-48","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#删除实例或只删除记录","content":"只删除 Hanafubuki 中与当前实例身份绑定的记录，不检查、移动或删除任何文件。实例根目录、外部\nPython/Core 和其他配置路径全部保留，之后可以重新导入。","locale":"zh-CN"},"736":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-49","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#删除实例或只删除记录","content":"先删除经过验证的精确实例根目录，再删除实例记录。根目录内部的\nPython、Core、模型、输出和其他内容都会随根目录消失；位于根目录之外的组件不会被删除。","locale":"zh-CN"},"737":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-50","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#删除实例或只删除记录","content":"文件删除无法通过 Hanafubuki\n撤销。先核对实例根目录，并确认重要模型、输出、配置和自定义代码已有独立备份。外部组件会保留，但根目录内的同类文件会随完整删除消失。","locale":"zh-CN"},"738":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-51","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#失败和恢复","content":"维护操作在无法确认进程停止、文件状态或配置提交时，会保留原任务和恢复义务，而不是假装已经完成。此时：","locale":"zh-CN"},"739":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-52","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#失败和恢复","content":"打开右下角失败项或任务中心查看准确阶段和错误；","locale":"zh-CN"},"740":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-53","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#失败和恢复","content":"不要通过文件管理器手动完成剩余步骤；","locale":"zh-CN"},"741":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-54","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#失败和恢复","content":"修复权限、磁盘或占用问题后，使用界面提供的同一操作重试；","locale":"zh-CN"},"742":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-55","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#失败和恢复","content":"实例仍被维护锁定时，不要创建同路径的新实例作为替代。","locale":"zh-CN"},"743":{"id":"/docs/instance-management","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","type":"page","content":"实例管理","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","实例管理"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-management","locale":"zh-CN"},"744":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-0","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management","content":"了解实例管理入口、功能分区和任务状态，并找到对应的操作教程。","locale":"zh-CN"},"745":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-1","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-management#管理分区","content":"管理分区","locale":"zh-CN"},"746":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-2","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-management#完成一次管理操作","content":"完成一次管理操作","locale":"zh-CN"},"747":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-3","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-management#检查实例状态","content":"检查实例状态","locale":"zh-CN"},"748":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-4","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-management#打开对应分区","content":"打开对应分区","locale":"zh-CN"},"749":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-5","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-management#执行并跟踪任务","content":"执行并跟踪任务","locale":"zh-CN"},"750":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-6","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-management#验证结果","content":"验证结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"751":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-7","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-management#基础","content":"基础","locale":"zh-CN"},"752":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-8","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-management#运行","content":"运行","locale":"zh-CN"},"753":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-9","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-management#资源","content":"资源","locale":"zh-CN"},"754":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-10","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-management#维护","content":"维护","locale":"zh-CN"},"755":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-11","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management","content":"实例管理用于查看和维护已经创建或导入的 WebUI。打开首页的实例管理器，选择一个实例后，右侧会显示管理导航和当前功能页面。","locale":"zh-CN"},"756":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-12","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management","content":"管理项由后端根据 WebUI 类型、安装状态和当前 API 能力决定。某个入口变灰时，将鼠标停留在入口上可以查看原因；实例尚未安装完成时，应先返回实例工作区完成安装。","locale":"zh-CN"},"757":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-13","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management#管理分区","content":"分类","locale":"zh-CN"},"758":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-14","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management#管理分区","content":"主要内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"759":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-15","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management#管理分区","content":"基础","locale":"zh-CN"},"760":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-16","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management#管理分区","content":"实例信息、组件路径、版本、变体","locale":"zh-CN"},"761":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-17","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management#管理分区","content":"运行","locale":"zh-CN"},"762":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-18","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management#管理分区","content":"启动参数、终端、PyTorch","locale":"zh-CN"},"763":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-19","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management#管理分区","content":"资源","locale":"zh-CN"},"764":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-20","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management#管理分区","content":"扩展、模型、快照","locale":"zh-CN"},"765":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-21","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management#管理分区","content":"维护","locale":"zh-CN"},"766":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-22","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management#管理分区","content":"热补丁、诊断、迁移、重装与删除","locale":"zh-CN"},"767":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-23","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management#检查实例状态","content":"先打开“实例信息”，确认实例已经就绪。更新代码、重装环境或恢复快照前，建议先停止 WebUI，并等待已有任务结束。","locale":"zh-CN"},"768":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-24","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management#打开对应分区","content":"按管理导航选择功能。入口不可用通常表示当前 WebUI 不支持该功能、实例尚未就绪，或管理 API 没有提供所需能力。","locale":"zh-CN"},"769":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-25","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management#执行并跟踪任务","content":"保存配置等短操作显示在当前管理器右下角；安装、更新、恢复、迁移等长操作也会进入任务中心。切换分区不会取消后端任务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"770":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-26","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management#验证结果","content":"等待状态进入“已完成”后刷新当前分区，再到“实例信息”检查环境与运行状态。失败时先打开任务输出，不要连续启动相同操作。","locale":"zh-CN"},"771":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-27","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management#验证结果","content":"右下角状态区用于报告当前实例管理器发起的操作；任务中心保存跨页面任务、详细阶段和保留输出。状态仍为“运行中”时，关闭页面不等于任务结束。","locale":"zh-CN"},"772":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-28","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management#基础","content":"<Card title=\"实例信息\" href=\"/docs/instance-overview\" description=\"查看状态、服务、地址和最近错误。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"773":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-29","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management#基础","content":"<Card title=\"组件路径\" href=\"/docs/instance-paths\" description=\"维护 Python 与 Core 目录引用。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"774":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-30","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management#基础","content":"<Card title=\"版本\" href=\"/docs/instance-versions\" description=\"更新 WebUI 或切换分支、提交和版本。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"775":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-31","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management#基础","content":"<Card title=\"WebUI 变体\" href=\"/docs/instance-variants\" description=\"切换预设仓库和分支。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"776":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-32","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management#运行","content":"<Card title=\"启动配置\" href=\"/docs/instance-launch\" description=\"设置启动参数和环境变量。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"777":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-33","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management#运行","content":"<Card title=\"实例终端\" href=\"/docs/instance-terminal\" description=\"在实例的受管环境中执行命令。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"778":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-34","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management#运行","content":"<Card title=\"PyTorch\" href=\"/docs/instance-pytorch\" description=\"检查兼容性并重新安装设备构建。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"779":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-35","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management#资源","content":"<Card title=\"扩展\" href=\"/docs/instance-extensions\" description=\"安装、更新、切换或卸载扩展。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"780":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-36","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management#资源","content":"<Card title=\"模型\" href=\"/docs/instance-models\" description=\"导入、下载和整理模型资源。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"781":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-37","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management#资源","content":"<Card title=\"快照\" href=\"/docs/instance-snapshots\" description=\"记录环境并预览、恢复状态。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"782":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-38","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management#维护","content":"<Card title=\"热补丁\" href=\"/docs/instance-hotpatch\" description=\"保存补丁配置并查看运行日志。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"783":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-39","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management#维护","content":"<Card title=\"实例诊断\" href=\"/docs/instance-diagnostics\" description=\"收集、检查并导出诊断包。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"784":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-40","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management#维护","content":"<Card title=\"实例维护\" href=\"/docs/instance-maintenance\" description=\"重命名、迁移、重装或删除实例。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"785":{"id":"/docs/instance-models","page_id":"/docs/instance-models","type":"page","content":"模型管理","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki