zh-CN"},"797":{"id":"/docs/instance-models-11","page_id":"/docs/instance-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-models","content":"主要操作","locale":"zh-CN"},"798":{"id":"/docs/instance-models-12","page_id":"/docs/instance-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-models","content":"文件浏览器","locale":"zh-CN"},"799":{"id":"/docs/instance-models-13","page_id":"/docs/instance-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-models","content":"使用目录保存模型的 WebUI","locale":"zh-CN"},"800":{"id":"/docs/instance-models-14","page_id":"/docs/instance-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-models","content":"导入、下载、复制、移动、重命名和删除文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"801":{"id":"/docs/instance-models-15","page_id":"/docs/instance-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-models","content":"InvokeAI Registry","locale":"zh-CN"},"802":{"id":"/docs/instance-models-16","page_id":"/docs/instance-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-models","content":"使用注册记录管理模型的 InvokeAI","locale":"zh-CN"},"803":{"id":"/docs/instance-models-17","page_id":"/docs/instance-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-models","content":"从 URL 安装、本地导入、取消注册或删除文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"804":{"id":"/docs/instance-models-18","page_id":"/docs/instance-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-models","content":"内置模型库","locale":"zh-CN"},"805":{"id":"/docs/instance-models-19","page_id":"/docs/instance-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-models","content":"提供桌面模型目录的 WebUI","locale":"zh-CN"},"806":{"id":"/docs/instance-models-20","page_id":"/docs/instance-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-models","content":"搜索预设模型并安装到指定相对目录","locale":"zh-CN"},"807":{"id":"/docs/instance-models-21","page_id":"/docs/instance-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-models#打开目标目录","content":"双击文件夹进入目录，使用面包屑、后退、前进和上一级按钮导航。模型操作只针对后端提供的模型根目录及其子目录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"808":{"id":"/docs/instance-models-22","page_id":"/docs/instance-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-models#选择条目","content":"单击选择一个条目；使用 `Ctrl`/`Cmd` 或 `Shift` 扩展选择。可以按名称、大小或修改时间调整排序。","locale":"zh-CN"},"809":{"id":"/docs/instance-models-23","page_id":"/docs/instance-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-models#执行文件操作","content":"右键条目可以复制、剪切、粘贴、重命名或删除；右键空白处可以新建文件夹、导入文件、导入文件夹或从 URL 下载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"810":{"id":"/docs/instance-models-24","page_id":"/docs/instance-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-models#导入并验证","content":"也可以把桌面文件直接拖到列表中，导入到当前目录。等待任务完成后刷新列表，核对文件名、大小和目标位置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"811":{"id":"/docs/instance-models-25","page_id":"/docs/instance-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-models#导入并验证","content":"复制、移动和导入大型模型可能持续较长时间。切换页面不会取消任务；不要在任务进行时从文件管理器手动移动相同文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"812":{"id":"/docs/instance-models-26","page_id":"/docs/instance-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-models#invokeai-registry","content":"“从 URL 安装”让 InvokeAI 下载并注册模型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"813":{"id":"/docs/instance-models-27","page_id":"/docs/instance-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-models#invokeai-registry","content":"“导入本地模型”或拖放会把本地文件交给 InvokeAI 注册流程。","locale":"zh-CN"},"814":{"id":"/docs/instance-models-28","page_id":"/docs/instance-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-models#invokeai-registry","content":"“取消注册”只删除 Registry 记录，模型文件保留在磁盘上。","locale":"zh-CN"},"815":{"id":"/docs/instance-models-29","page_id":"/docs/instance-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-models#invokeai-registry","content":"“删除”会同时移除 Registry 记录和对应文件，无法撤销。","locale":"zh-CN"},"816":{"id":"/docs/instance-models-30","page_id":"/docs/instance-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-models#invokeai-registry","content":"如果只是不希望 InvokeAI 当前使用某个模型，但仍想保留文件，应选择“取消注册”。需要彻底释放空间时才选择删除。","locale":"zh-CN"},"817":{"id":"/docs/instance-models-31","page_id":"/docs/instance-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-models#内置模型库","content":"模型库使用当前设置中的下载源和自动镜像策略。下载失败时检查镜像设置、网络与代理以及磁盘剩余空间。","locale":"zh-CN"},"818":{"id":"/docs/instance-models-32","page_id":"/docs/instance-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-models#内置模型库","content":"文件浏览器中的删除和 InvokeAI\n的“删除模型和文件”都会修改真实磁盘内容。环境快照通常不包含模型文件，重要模型必须单独备份。","locale":"zh-CN"},"819":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","type":"page","content":"实例信息与运行状态","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","实例管理"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-overview","locale":"zh-CN"},"820":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-0","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-overview","content":"查看实例身份、服务状态、启动阶段、WebUI 地址和最近错误。","locale":"zh-CN"},"821":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-1","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-overview#状态区域","content":"状态区域","locale":"zh-CN"},"822":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-2","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-overview#启动-webui","content":"启动 WebUI","locale":"zh-CN"},"823":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-3","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-overview#检查就绪状态","content":"检查就绪状态","locale":"zh-CN"},"824":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-4","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-overview#点击启动","content":"点击“启动”","locale":"zh-CN"},"825":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-5","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-overview#处理启动决策","content":"处理启动决策","locale":"zh-CN"},"826":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-6","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-overview#等待地址捕获","content":"等待地址捕获","locale":"zh-CN"},"827":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-7","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-overview#停止和排查","content":"停止和排查","locale":"zh-CN"},"828":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-8","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-overview","content":"“实例信息”是排查实例问题的起点。页面会自动刷新，并从后端读取实例身份、路径、环境、服务、热补丁运行状态、WebUI 地址和历史错误。","locale":"zh-CN"},"829":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-9","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-overview#状态区域","content":"区域","locale":"zh-CN"},"830":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-10","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-overview#状态区域","content":"主要用途","locale":"zh-CN"},"831":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-11","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-overview#状态区域","content":"身份信息","locale":"zh-CN"},"832":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-12","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-overview#状态区域","content":"确认实例名称、WebUI 类型、安装生命周期和运行状态","locale":"zh-CN"},"833":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-13","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-overview#状态区域","content":"路径","locale":"zh-CN"},"834":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-14","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-overview#状态区域","content":"核对实例根目录、Core 和 Python 可执行文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"835":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-15","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-overview#状态区域","content":"环境","locale":"zh-CN"},"836":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-16","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-overview#状态区域","content":"查看 Python 版本和当前分支","locale":"zh-CN"},"837":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-17","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-overview#状态区域","content":"服务","locale":"zh-CN"},"838":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-18","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-overview#状态区域","content":"查看管理 API、启动阶段、启动警告和浏览器连接状态","locale":"zh-CN"},"839":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-19","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-overview#状态区域","content":"热补丁运行时","locale":"zh-CN"},"840":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-20","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-overview#状态区域","content":"确认补丁运行时是否已随 WebUI 启动","locale":"zh-CN"},"841":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-21","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-overview#状态区域","content":"已捕获的 WebUI 地址","locale":"zh-CN"},"842":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-22","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-overview#状态区域","content":"查看应用实际捕获到的首选访问地址","locale":"zh-CN"},"843":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-23","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-overview#状态区域","content":"历史","locale":"zh-CN"},"844":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-24","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-overview#状态区域","content":"查看最近失败阶段、退出码和对应任务输出","locale":"zh-CN"},"845":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-25","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-overview#状态区域","content":"安装生命周期表示实例文件是否已经准备完成；运行状态表示 WebUI 进程当前是否启动。只有生命周期为“就绪”且 WebUI 未运行时，页面才允许开始新的启动。","locale":"zh-CN"},"846":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-26","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-overview#检查就绪状态","content":"确认安装生命周期为“就绪”，Python 与 Core 路径存在，并且没有正在重装、恢复 PyTorch 或安装模型库的任务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"847":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-27","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-overview#点击启动","content":"启动任务会在任务中心打开。应用会检查环境、PyTorch、扩展冲突和启动参数；需要选择时会弹出启动决策窗口。","locale":"zh-CN"},"848":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-28","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-overview#处理启动决策","content":"按窗口提示处理不兼容扩展、PyTorch 或启动参数。关闭决策窗口不会自动修复问题；取消后可以进入相应管理分区调整配置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"849":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-29","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-overview#等待地址捕获","content":"运行状态变为“运行中”后，继续等待“已捕获的 WebUI 地址”出现。地址捕获成功表示应用已经识别到 WebUI 的访问入口。","locale":"zh-CN"},"850":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-30","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-overview#停止和排查","content":"点击“停止”后等待运行状态回到“未运行”，不要在停止过程中重复点击启动。","locale":"zh-CN"},"851":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-31","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-overview#停止和排查","content":"“查看启动任务”会打开本次启动的阶段和输出；历史错误中的“查看日志”会打开发生该错误的准确任务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"852":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-32","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-overview#停止和排查","content":"“在文件管理器中显示”打开实例根目录，而不是 Core 或模型目录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"853":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-33","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-overview#停止和排查","content":"WebUI 已运行但没有地址时，检查启动输出中的监听地址、端口冲突和浏览器连接状态。","locale":"zh-CN"},"854":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-34","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-overview#停止和排查","content":"状态为“正在等待启动决策”时，应先处理当前决策，不要创建第二个启动任务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"855":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-35","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-overview#停止和排查","content":"进程进入运行状态后，WebUI\n仍可能正在加载模型或初始化服务。应以捕获到的地址和任务输出为准；只有进程存在但持续没有地址时，再按启动日志排查。","locale":"zh-CN"},"856":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-36","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-overview#停止和排查","content":"需要修改运行参数时参阅启动配置；需要检查 Python 或 Git 时使用实例终端。","locale":"zh-CN"},"857":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","type":"page","content":"组件路径","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","实例管理"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-paths","locale":"zh-CN"},"858":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-0","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-paths","content":"理解实例根目录、Python 和 Core 的区别，并安全地修改组件引用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"859":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-1","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-paths#修改-python-或-core-路径","content":"修改 Python 或 Core 路径","locale":"zh-CN"},"860":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-2","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-paths#停止相关操作","content":"停止相关操作","locale":"zh-CN"},"861":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-3","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-paths#核对目标目录","content":"核对目标目录","locale":"zh-CN"},"862":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-4","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-paths#选择并应用","content":"选择并应用","locale":"zh-CN"},"863":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-5","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-paths#处理过期提示","content":"处理过期提示","locale":"zh-CN"},"864":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-6","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-paths#验证新环境","content":"验证新环境","locale":"zh-CN"},"865":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-7","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-paths#应该使用哪个功能","content":"应该使用哪个功能","locale":"zh-CN"},"866":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-8","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-paths","content":"一个实例包含三个不同的位置：实例根目录是整个实例的边界，Python 目录保存独立运行环境，Core 目录保存 WebUI 代码。Python 和 Core 可以位于实例根目录内，也可能在导入或扫描时引用外部目录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"867":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-9","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-paths","content":"路径","locale":"zh-CN"},"868":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-10","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-paths","content":"用途","locale":"zh-CN"},"869":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-11","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-paths","content":"“组件路径”页能否修改","locale":"zh-CN"},"870":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-12","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-paths","content":"实例根目录","locale":"zh-CN"},"871":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-13","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-paths","content":"实例整体文件边界","locale":"zh-CN"},"872":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-14","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-paths","content":"不能，需使用实例迁移","locale":"zh-CN"},"873":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-15","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-paths","content":"Python 目录","locale":"zh-CN"},"874":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-16","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-paths","content":"独立 Python 与已安装软件包","locale":"zh-CN"},"875":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-17","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-paths","content":"可以","locale":"zh-CN"},"876":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-18","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-paths","content":"Core 目录","locale":"zh-CN"},"877":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-19","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-paths","content":"WebUI 代码、扩展和相关资源","locale":"zh-CN"},"878":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-20","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-paths","content":"可以","locale":"zh-CN"},"879":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-21","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-paths#停止相关操作","content":"建议先停止 WebUI，并等待安装、版本、扩展、快照和模型任务结束。路径更新需要独占当前实例；应用也可能在更新前停止相关运行资源。","locale":"zh-CN"},"880":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-22","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-paths#核对目标目录","content":"Python 目录必须是可用的独立 Python 环境；Core 目录必须符合当前 WebUI 类型。不要选择磁盘根目录、用户主目录或另一个实例正在使用的目录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"881":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-23","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-paths#选择并应用","content":"在“组件路径”中填写或选择新目录，确认两项都不为空，再点击“应用”。后端会验证路径、实例重叠和组件类型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"882":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-24","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-paths#处理过期提示","content":"如果页面提示实例配置已发生变化，点击“重新加载”，重新选择目录后再提交。不要用旧页面覆盖其他管理操作刚写入的配置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"883":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-25","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-paths#验证新环境","content":"返回“实例信息”检查 Python 版本和 Core 路径，再打开实例终端执行版本检查，最后重新启动 WebUI。","locale":"zh-CN"},"884":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-26","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-paths#验证新环境","content":"应用只更新实例记录中的组件引用，不会把原目录复制或移动到新位置。需要搬迁整个实例时使用实例维护中的“迁移实例”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"885":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-27","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-paths#应该使用哪个功能","content":"需求","locale":"zh-CN"},"886":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-28","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-paths#应该使用哪个功能","content":"正确操作","locale":"zh-CN"},"887":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-29","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-paths#应该使用哪个功能","content":"改为引用另一个现成 Python/Core","locale":"zh-CN"},"888":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-30","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-paths#应该使用哪个功能","content":"修改组件路径","locale":"zh-CN"},"889":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-31","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-paths#应该使用哪个功能","content":"把完整实例根目录搬到其他磁盘","locale":"zh-CN"},"890":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-32","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-paths#应该使用哪个功能","content":"迁移实例","locale":"zh-CN"},"891":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-33","pa