"选择版本方式","locale":"zh-CN"},"902":{"id":"/docs/instance-pytorch-5","page_id":"/docs/instance-pytorch","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-pytorch#决定是否强制重装","content":"决定是否强制重装","locale":"zh-CN"},"903":{"id":"/docs/instance-pytorch-6","page_id":"/docs/instance-pytorch","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-pytorch#确认并等待任务","content":"确认并等待任务","locale":"zh-CN"},"904":{"id":"/docs/instance-pytorch-7","page_id":"/docs/instance-pytorch","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-pytorch#验证结果","content":"验证结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"905":{"id":"/docs/instance-pytorch-8","page_id":"/docs/instance-pytorch","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-pytorch#失败处理","content":"失败处理","locale":"zh-CN"},"906":{"id":"/docs/instance-pytorch-9","page_id":"/docs/instance-pytorch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-pytorch","content":"“PyTorch”页会检查实例 Python 中的 Torch 组件、检测到的设备类型，并列出当前 WebUI 支持的安装组合。不同 WebUI、操作系统和硬件看到的选项可能不同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"907":{"id":"/docs/instance-pytorch-10","page_id":"/docs/instance-pytorch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-pytorch#理解检查结果","content":"状态","locale":"zh-CN"},"908":{"id":"/docs/instance-pytorch-11","page_id":"/docs/instance-pytorch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-pytorch#理解检查结果","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"909":{"id":"/docs/instance-pytorch-12","page_id":"/docs/instance-pytorch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-pytorch#理解检查结果","content":"兼容","locale":"zh-CN"},"910":{"id":"/docs/instance-pytorch-13","page_id":"/docs/instance-pytorch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-pytorch#理解检查结果","content":"当前构建符合检测到的设备和 WebUI 规则","locale":"zh-CN"},"911":{"id":"/docs/instance-pytorch-14","page_id":"/docs/instance-pytorch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-pytorch#理解检查结果","content":"不兼容","locale":"zh-CN"},"912":{"id":"/docs/instance-pytorch-15","page_id":"/docs/instance-pytorch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-pytorch#理解检查结果","content":"已安装构建与设备或支持组合不匹配","locale":"zh-CN"},"913":{"id":"/docs/instance-pytorch-16","page_id":"/docs/instance-pytorch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-pytorch#理解检查结果","content":"未安装","locale":"zh-CN"},"914":{"id":"/docs/instance-pytorch-17","page_id":"/docs/instance-pytorch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-pytorch#理解检查结果","content":"实例环境中没有检测到所需 PyTorch 软件包","locale":"zh-CN"},"915":{"id":"/docs/instance-pytorch-18","page_id":"/docs/instance-pytorch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-pytorch#理解检查结果","content":"无法检查","locale":"zh-CN"},"916":{"id":"/docs/instance-pytorch-19","page_id":"/docs/instance-pytorch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-pytorch#理解检查结果","content":"Python、管理 API 或环境查询失败","locale":"zh-CN"},"917":{"id":"/docs/instance-pytorch-20","page_id":"/docs/instance-pytorch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-pytorch#理解检查结果","content":"页面还会显示 Torch、TorchVision、TorchAudio、xFormers 等已检测版本，以及推荐设备构建。版本名称以页面当前目录为准，不要从其他 WebUI 的教程直接复制安装命令。","locale":"zh-CN"},"918":{"id":"/docs/instance-pytorch-21","page_id":"/docs/instance-pytorch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-pytorch#停止-webui","content":"PyTorch 重装会修改正在使用的 Python 环境，因此需要先停止 WebUI。管理 API 会由应用协调，不需要手动结束它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"919":{"id":"/docs/instance-pytorch-22","page_id":"/docs/instance-pytorch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-pytorch#选择版本方式","content":"普通用户选择“自动选择”，让安装任务根据硬件决定组合。只有明确知道驱动、CUDA、ROCm 或 CPU 需求时才使用“手动选择”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"920":{"id":"/docs/instance-pytorch-23","page_id":"/docs/instance-pytorch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-pytorch#决定是否强制重装","content":"当前状态已经兼容时，通常不勾选“即使当前版本正确也重新安装”。只有文件损坏、依赖异常或需要重新部署同一构建时才启用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"921":{"id":"/docs/instance-pytorch-24","page_id":"/docs/instance-pytorch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-pytorch#确认并等待任务","content":"点击“重新安装 PyTorch”，确认后在右下角状态区或任务中心查看依赖下载、安装和环境检查输出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"922":{"id":"/docs/instance-pytorch-25","page_id":"/docs/instance-pytorch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-pytorch#验证结果","content":"任务完成后刷新本页，确认状态为“兼容”并核对已安装构建，再启动 WebUI 完成实际运行验证。","locale":"zh-CN"},"923":{"id":"/docs/instance-pytorch-26","page_id":"/docs/instance-pytorch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-pytorch#失败处理","content":"自动选择失败时，先检查显卡驱动、操作系统支持和页面报告的检测设备，不要随意尝试多个 CUDA/ROCm 构建。","locale":"zh-CN"},"924":{"id":"/docs/instance-pytorch-27","page_id":"/docs/instance-pytorch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-pytorch#失败处理","content":"下载或解析软件包失败时，检查网络与代理和镜像。","locale":"zh-CN"},"925":{"id":"/docs/instance-pytorch-28","page_id":"/docs/instance-pytorch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-pytorch#失败处理","content":"安装后仍不兼容时，打开最近任务输出，记录选择的构建、退出码和环境检查结果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"926":{"id":"/docs/instance-pytorch-29","page_id":"/docs/instance-pytorch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-pytorch#失败处理","content":"启动时出现 PyTorch 决策窗口，可以取消并回到本页修复；“忽略并启动”只用于你能接受本次运行风险的情况。","locale":"zh-CN"},"927":{"id":"/docs/instance-pytorch-30","page_id":"/docs/instance-pytorch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-pytorch#失败处理","content":"该操作会修改当前实例 Python 中的 PyTorch 及配套软件包。不要同时在实例终端手动安装\nTorch，也不要在任务完成前启动 WebUI。","locale":"zh-CN"},"928":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","type":"page","content":"快照管理","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","实例管理"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-snapshots","locale":"zh-CN"},"929":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-0","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-snapshots","content":"创建环境快照，预览恢复影响，并安全地恢复或删除快照。","locale":"zh-CN"},"930":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-1","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#创建和查看快照","content":"创建和查看快照","locale":"zh-CN"},"931":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-2","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#恢复选项","content":"恢复选项","locale":"zh-CN"},"932":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-3","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#预览并恢复","content":"预览并恢复","locale":"zh-CN"},"933":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-4","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#做好恢复准备","content":"做好恢复准备","locale":"zh-CN"},"934":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-5","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#打开恢复窗口","content":"打开恢复窗口","locale":"zh-CN"},"935":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-6","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#阅读阻塞项","content":"阅读阻塞项","locale":"zh-CN"},"936":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-7","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#核对计划变更","content":"核对计划变更","locale":"zh-CN"},"937":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-8","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#确认恢复","content":"确认恢复","locale":"zh-CN"},"938":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-9","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#完成后验证","content":"完成后验证","locale":"zh-CN"},"939":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-10","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-snapshots","content":"快照记录 WebUI 类型、Core 提交、Python 软件包和扩展状态，用于在版本、依赖或扩展修改后恢复环境。创建快照时默认包含软件包信息。","locale":"zh-CN"},"940":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-11","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-snapshots","content":"快照通常不包含模型、输出图片、任意用户文件或未提交代码的完整副本。执行高风险操作前，仍需单独备份这些内容。","locale":"zh-CN"},"941":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-12","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#创建和查看快照","content":"格式错误的快照会显示解析错误，不能直接恢复。删除快照只会永久删除对应的快照文件，不会修改当前环境。","locale":"zh-CN"},"942":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-13","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#恢复选项","content":"选项","locale":"zh-CN"},"943":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-14","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#恢复选项","content":"关闭时","locale":"zh-CN"},"944":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-15","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#恢复选项","content":"开启时","locale":"zh-CN"},"945":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-16","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#恢复选项","content":"清理额外软件包","locale":"zh-CN"},"946":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-17","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#恢复选项","content":"恢复记录的软件包，保留快照之后新增的软件包","locale":"zh-CN"},"947":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-18","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#恢复选项","content":"卸载快照中没有记录的软件包","locale":"zh-CN"},"948":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-19","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#恢复选项","content":"清理额外扩展","locale":"zh-CN"},"949":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-20","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#恢复选项","content":"恢复记录的扩展，保留快照之后新增的扩展","locale":"zh-CN"},"950":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-21","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#恢复选项","content":"删除快照中没有记录的扩展","locale":"zh-CN"},"951":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-22","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#恢复选项","content":"强制 Git 重置","locale":"zh-CN"},"952":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-23","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#恢复选项","content":"未提交修改可能成为恢复阻塞项","locale":"zh-CN"},"953":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-24","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#恢复选项","content":"丢弃 WebUI 和扩展仓库的未提交修改后切换到记录提交","locale":"zh-CN"},"954":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-25","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#恢复选项","content":"某些快照会把选项标记为“必需”；不启用必需选项时，恢复不能开始。","locale":"zh-CN"},"955":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-26","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#做好恢复准备","content":"建议停止 WebUI，等待版本、扩展、模型和 PyTorch 等管理任务结束，并备份未提交代码与重要文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"956":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-27","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#打开恢复窗口","content":"点击目标快照的“恢复”。选择清理和 Git 重置选项后，应用会自动生成与当前实例状态绑定的恢复预览。","locale":"zh-CN"},"957":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-28","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#阅读阻塞项","content":"类型不匹配、Core 缺失、仓库存在未提交修改或其他无法解析的问题会阻止恢复。按提示处理或启用所需选项，然后等待预览自动重新分析。","locale":"zh-CN"},"958":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-29","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#核对计划变更","content":"分别查看仓库、Python 软件包和扩展的新增、移除、更新、跳过与无变化项目。不要只看变更总数。","locale":"zh-CN"},"959":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-30","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#确认恢复","content":"只有当前预览可恢复时才能提交。任务接受后恢复窗口会关闭，后续阶段和输出在右下角状态区及任务中心查看。","locale":"zh-CN"},"960":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-31","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#完成后验证","content":"刷新版本、扩展和 PyTorch 页面，再启动 WebUI。模型和用户文件需要按独立备份自行核对。","locale":"zh-CN"},"961":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-32","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#完成后验证","content":"预览会绑定快照、恢复选项、管理 API 状态和实例配置。预览完成后如果修改了路径、启动配置或其他实例设置，旧预览会失效；关闭窗口并重新生成，不要尝试重复提交。","locale":"zh-CN"},"962":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-33","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#完成后验证","content":"“清理额外软件包”“清理额外扩展”和“强制 Git\n重置”都可能移除当前环境中快照没有保留的内容。只有在预览列表与独立备份都确认无误后再恢复。","locale":"zh-CN"},"963":{"id":"/docs/instance-terminal","page_id":"/docs/instance-terminal","type":"page","content":"实例终端","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","实例管理"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-terminal","locale":"zh-CN"},"964":{"id":"/docs/instance-terminal-0","page_id":"/docs/instance-terminal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-terminal","content":"在当前实例的 Python、Git 和受管环境中执行检查或维护命令。","locale":"zh-CN"},"965":{"id":"/docs/instance-terminal-1","page_id":"/docs/instance-terminal","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-terminal#打开并检查环境","content":"打开并检查环境","locale":"zh-CN"},"966":{"id":"/docs/instance-terminal-2","page_id":"/docs/instance-terminal","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-terminal#会话操作","content":"会话操作","locale":"zh-CN"},"967":{"id":"/docs/instance-terminal-3","page_id":"/docs/instance-terminal","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-terminal#安全使用终端","content":"安全使用终端","locale":"zh-CN"},"968":{"id":"/docs/instance-terminal-4","page_id":"/docs/instance-terminal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-terminal","content":"实例终端会使用当前实例的工作目录和受管环境，并将独立 Python、Git、Micromamba/Conda 工具加入正确的 `PATH`。普通应用终端不自动绑定某个实例，排查 WebUI 时应优先使用实例终端。","locale":"zh-CN"},"969":{"id":"/docs/instance-terminal-5","page_id":"/docs/instance-terminal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-terminal#打开并检查环境","content":"进入“运行 → 终端”时，应用会创建或重新订阅当前实例的终端会话，并恢复保留的输出。状态变为“运行中”后即可输入命令。","locale":"zh-CN"},"970":{"id":"/docs/instance-terminal-6","page_id":"/docs/instance-terminal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-terminal#打开并检查环境","content":"常用的只读检查：","locale":"zh-CN"},"971":{"id":"/docs/instance-terminal-7","page_id":"/docs/instance-terminal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-terminal#打开并检查环境","content":"还可以在 Core 仓库中使用 `git status` 检查未提交修改。路径显示方式和切换目录命令取决于 Windows、macOS 或 Linux 当前使用的 Shell。","locale":"zh-CN"},"972":{"id":"/docs/instance-terminal-8","page_id":"/docs/instance-terminal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-terminal#会话操作","content":"操作","locale":"zh-CN"},"973":{"id":"/docs/instance-terminal-9","page_id":"/docs/instance-terminal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-terminal#会话操作","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"974":{"id":"/docs/instance-terminal-10","page_id":"/docs/instance-terminal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-terminal#会话操作","content":"离开分区","locale":"zh-CN"},"975":{"id":"/docs/instance-terminal-11","page_id":"/docs/instance-terminal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-terminal#会话操作","content":"取消当前界面订阅，但不应当被当作已结束进程","locale":"zh-CN"},"976":{"id":"/docs/instance-terminal-12","page_id":"/docs/instance-terminal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-terminal#会话操作","content":"重启终端","locale":"zh-CN"},"977":{"id":"/docs/instance-terminal-13","page_id":"/docs/instance-terminal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-terminal#会话操作","content":"结束当前 PTY，并为同一实例创建新的终端会话","locale":"zh-CN"},"978":{"id":"/docs/instance-terminal-14","page_id":"/docs/instance-terminal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-terminal#会话操作","content":"关闭终端","locale":"zh-CN"},"979":{"id":"/docs/instance-terminal-15","page_id":"/docs/instance-terminal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-terminal#会话操作","content":"确认终止并释放当前终端进程","locale":"zh-CN"},"980":{"id":"/docs/instance-terminal-16","page_id":"/docs/instance-terminal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-terminal#会话操作","content":"重新进入","locale":"zh-CN"},"981":{"id":"/docs/instance-terminal-17","page_id":"/docs/instance-terminal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-terminal#会话操作","content":"订阅已有会话，恢复保留输出并继续接收新输出","locale":"zh-CN"},"982":{"id":"/docs/instance-terminal-18","page_id":"/docs/instance-terminal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-terminal#会话操作","content":"终端状态为“已退出”时可以重启；状态为“关闭失败”时，后端仍保留原会话的清理义务，应再次使用“关闭终端进程”，不要连续创建替代会话。","locale":"zh-CN"},"983":{"id":"/docs/instance-terminal-19","page_id":"/docs/instance-terminal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-terminal#安全使用终端","content":"执行安装、删除、移动或 Git 命令前，先确认当前目录和目标路径。","locale":"zh-CN"},"984":{"id":"/docs/instance-terminal-20","page_id":"/docs/instance-terminal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-terminal#安全使用终端","content":"不要在 WebUI、版本更新、快照恢复或重装任务修改同一环境时手动安装软件包。","locale":"zh-CN"},"985":{"id":"/docs/instance-terminal-21","page_id":"/docs/instance-terminal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-terminal#安全使用终端","content":"优先使用 `python -m <模块>`，确保调用的是当前实例 Python 对应的模块。","locale":"zh-CN"},"986":{"id":"/docs/instance-terminal-22","page_id":"/docs/instance-terminal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-terminal#安全使用终端","content":"终端中的手动修改不会自动形成快照，也不保证能被 Hanafubuki 撤销。","locale":"zh-CN"},"987":{"id":"/docs/instance-terminal-23","page_id":"/docs/instance-terminal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-terminal#安全使用终端","content":"需要修改受支持的扩展、模型、版本或 PyTorch 时，优先使用对应管理页面，以便获得任务状态和错误输出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"988":{"id":"/docs/instance-terminal-24","page_id":"/docs/instance-terminal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-terminal#安全使用终端","content":"实例终端不是模拟环境。删除目录、重置 Git\n或重装软件包会直接改变实例；重要操作前先创建快照，并单独备份模型、输出和自定义代码。","locale":"zh-CN"},"989":{"id":"/docs/instance-variants","page_id":"/docs/instance-variants","type":"page","content":"WebUI 变体","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","实例管理"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-variants","locale":"zh-CN"},"990":{"id":"/docs/instance-variants-0","page_id":"/docs/instance-variants","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-variants","content":"在支持的实例中切换预设仓库和分支，并同步重装配置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"991":{"id":"/docs/instance-variants-1","page_id":"/docs/instance-variants","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-variants#切换变体","content":"切换变体","locale":"zh-CN"},"992":{"id":"/docs/instance-variants-2","page_id":"/docs/instance-variants","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-variants#备份当前状态","content":"备份当前状态","locale":"zh-CN"},"993":{"id":"/docs/instance-variants-3","page_id":"/docs/instance-variants","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-variants#停止-webui","content":"停止 WebUI","locale":"zh-CN"},"994":{"id":"/docs/instance-variants-4","page_id":"/docs/instance-variants","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-variants#核对目标来源","content":"核对目标来源","locale":"zh-CN"},"995":{"id":"/docs/instance-variants-5","page_id":"/docs/instance-variants","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-variants#点击切换并确认","content":"点击“切换”并确认","locale":"zh-CN"},"996":{"id":"/docs/instance-variants-6","page_id":"/docs/instance-variants","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-variants#验证变体","content":"验证变体","locale":"zh-CN"},"997":{"id":"/docs/instance-variants-7","page_id":"/docs/instance-variants","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-variants#只同步重装配置","content":"只同步重装配置","locale":"zh-CN"},"998":{"id":"/docs/instance-variants-8","page_id":"/docs/instance-variants","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-variants","content":"WebUI 变体是一组由当前 WebUI 提供的仓库、分支和子模块设置。它与普通“切换分支”不同：切换变体可能替换 Git 远程地址，并决定以后重装 Core 时使用哪个来源。","locale":"zh-CN"},"999":{"id":"/docs/instance-variants-9","page_id":"/docs/instance-variants","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-variants","content":"页面会分别标记：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1000":{"id":"/docs/instance-variants-10","page_id":"/docs/instance-variants","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-variants","content":"“当前”：Core 仓库现在实际对应的变体；","locale":"zh-CN"},"1001":{"id":"/docs/instance-variants-11","page_id":"/docs/instance-variants","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-variants","content":"“重新安装”：实例记录中保存、以后重装时使用的变体。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1002":{"id":"/docs/instance-variants-12","page_id":"/docs/instance-variants","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-variants","content":"两者不一致时，页面会提示同步重装设置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1003":{"id":"/docs/instance-variants-13","page_id":"/docs/instance-variants","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-variants#备份当前状态","content":"创建快照，并单独备份未提交代码、扩展配置和重要用户文件。变体切换可能强制切换工作树。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1004":{"id":"/docs/instance-variants-14","page_id":"/docs/instance-variants","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-variants#停止-webui","content":"变体切换要求 WebUI 已停止。等待“实例信息”中的运行状态回到“未运行”后再继续。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1005":{"id":"/docs/instance-variants-15","page_id":"/docs/instance-variants","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-variants#核对目标来源","content":"查看变体名称、仓库地址、分支和是否包含子模块。不要仅凭名称判断它是否与当前扩展或模型工作流兼容。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1006":{"id":"/docs/instance-variants-16","page_id":"/docs/instance-variants","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-variants#点击切换并确认","content":"确认窗口会再次显示仓库和分支。接受后，应用会启动版本切换任务，并在成功后保存该变体作为重装配置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1007":{"id":"/docs/instance-variants-17","page_id":"/docs/instance-variants","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-variants#验证变体","content":"刷新页面，确认“当前”和“重新安装”指向目标变体，再到版本页检查分支和提交，最后启动 WebUI。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1008":{"id":"/docs/instance-variants-18","page_id":"/docs/instance-variants","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-variants#只同步重装配置","content":"如果你已经通过其他方式把 Core 切换到了某个已知变体，但“重新安装”仍显示旧值，可以使用“同步重新安装设置”。这个操作只让以后重装使用当前变体，不再次切换仓库内容。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1009":{"id":"/docs/instance-variants-19","page_id":"/docs/instance-variants","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-variants#只同步重装配置","content":"变体切换可能更换远程仓库并强制切换到目标分支。界面确认不能替代备份；需要保留的改动应先提交到自己的仓库或导出补丁。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1010":{"id":"/docs/instance-variants-20","page_id":"/docs/instance-variants","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-variants#只同步重装配置","content":"只需要在同一仓库内更新或定位提交时，应使用WebUI 版本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1011":{"id":"/docs/instance-versions","page_id":"/docs/instance-versions","type":"page","content":"WebUI 版本","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","实例管理"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-versions","locale":"zh-CN"},"1012":{"id":"/docs/instance-versions-0","page_id":"/docs/instance-versions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-versions","content":"更新 WebUI，或在支持的实例中切换分支、提交和软件包版本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1013":{"id":"/docs/instance-versions-1","page_id":"/docs/instance-versions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-versions#git-型-webui","content":"Git 型 WebUI","locale":"zh-CN"},"1014":{"id":"/docs/instance-versions-2","page_id":"/docs/instance-versions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-versions#创建快照和代码备份","content":"创建快照和代码备份","locale":"zh-CN"},"1015":{"id":"/docs/instance-versions-3","page_id":"/docs/instance-versions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-versions#停止-webui","content":"停止 WebUI","locale":"zh-CN"},"1016":{"id":"/docs/instance-versions-4","page_id":"/docs/instance-versions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-versions#选择操作","content":"选择操作","locale":"zh-CN"},"1017":{"id":"/docs/instance-versions-5","page_id":"/docs/instance-versions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-versions#确认本地修改提示","content":"确认本地修改提示","locale":"zh-CN"},"1018":{"id":"/docs/instance-versions-6","page_id":"/docs/instance-versions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-versions#跟踪并验证","content":"跟踪并验证","locale":"zh-CN"},"1019":{"id":"/docs/instance-versions-7","page_id":"/docs/instance-versions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-versions#invokeai-软件包版本","content":"InvokeAI 软件包版本","locale":"zh-CN"},"1020":{"id":"/docs/instance-versions-8","page_id":"/docs/instance-versions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-versions","content":"“版本”页会根据 WebUI 类型显示不同界面。Stable Diffusion WebUI、ComfyUI、Fooocus 和 SD Trainer 等 Git 型实例显示仓库分支与提交；InvokeAI 显示已经安装和可以安装的软件包版本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1021":{"id":"/docs/instance-versions-9","page_id":"/docs/instance-versions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-versions#git-型-webui","content":"页面会显示当前分支、提交、提交日期，以及相对远程分支领先或落后的数量。更新提示还可能汇总扩展和 PyTorch 的可用更新。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1022":{"id":"/docs/instance-versions-10","page_id":"/docs/instance-versions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-versions#创建快照和代码备份","content":"先创建环境快照。自己修改过 Core 文件时，还应复制补丁、提交到个人分支或单独备份，因为快照恢复和某些切换会重置 Git 工作区。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1023":{"id":"/docs/instance-versions-11","page_id":"/docs/instance-versions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-versions#停止-webui","content":"普通版本操作不一定强制停止运行进程，但停止后再修改代码更容易保证下一次启动使用同一套文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1024":{"id":"/docs/instance-versions-12","page_id":"/docs/instance-versions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-versions#选择操作","content":"“更新当前分支”获取并更新当前分支；“切换分支”选择本地或远程分支；提交列表用于定位并切换到某个具体提交。需要最新远程数据时先重新加载分支或提交。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1025":{"id":"/docs/instance-versions-13","page_id":"/docs/instance-versions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-versions#确认本地修改提示","content":"仓库存在未提交修改时，界面会要求确认。继续不代表这些修改一定能保留；如果无法接受丢失或冲突，应取消并先备份。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1026":{"id":"/docs/instance-versions-14","page_id":"/docs/instance-versions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-versions#跟踪并验证","content":"在右下角状态区或任务中心等待任务完成，刷新版本页确认新的分支和提交，再启动 WebUI 检查扩展与依赖兼容性。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1027":{"id":"/docs/instance-versions-15","page_id":"/docs/instance-versions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-versions#invokeai-软件包版本","content":"InvokeAI 的版本页显示当前版本、最新稳定版本、可用版本和预发布标记。选择具体版本会安装该版本；“升级”用于升级到当前规则下的目标版本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1028":{"id":"/docs/instance-versions-16","page_id":"/docs/instance-versions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-versions#invokeai-软件包版本","content":"不需要测试新功能时优先选择最新稳定版本，不要选择带“预发布”标记的版本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1029":{"id":"/docs/instance-versions-17","page_id":"/docs/instance-versions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-versions#invokeai-软件包版本","content":"软件包安装会修改实例 Python 环境，应先停止 WebUI，并在任务完成后检查 PyTorch 与启动状态。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1030":{"id":"/docs/instance-versions-18","page_id":"/docs/instance-versions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-versions#invokeai-软件包版本","content":"列表为空或刷新失败时，检查网络、PyPI 镜像和实例管理 API。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1031":{"id":"/docs/instance-versions-19","page_id":"/docs/instance-versions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-versions#invokeai-软件包版本","content":"Git\n操作只管理代码仓库，不能保护模型、输出、配置或未提交代码。执行切换前应同时准备环境快照和独立文件备份。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1032":{"id":"/docs/instance-versions-20","page_id":"/docs/instance-versions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-versions#invokeai-软件包版本","content":"需要更换预设仓库和分支组合时，参阅WebUI 变体。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1033":{"id":"/docs/quick-start","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","type":"page","content":"快速开始","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","开始"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/quick-start","locale":"zh-CN"},"1034":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-0","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start","content":"用最短流程创建并启动第一个 WebUI 实例。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1035":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-1","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quick-start#等待运行环境就绪","content":"等待运行环境就绪","locale":"zh-CN"},"1036":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-2","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quick-start#添加实例","content":"添加实例","locale":"zh-CN"},"1037":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-3","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quick-start#完成安装","content":"完成安装","locale":"zh-CN"},"1038":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-4","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quick-start#启动-webui","content":"启动 WebUI","locale":"zh-CN"},"1039":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-5","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quick-start#管理实例","content":"管理实例","locale":"zh-CN"},"1040":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-6","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#等待运行环境就绪","content":"首次启动时等待 Python、Micromamba 和 Git 准备完成。若顶部或首页出现运行环境错误，先前往“设置 → 运行环境”处理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1041":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-7","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#添加实例","content":"在首页选择“添加实例”。新用户通常选择“全新安装”；已有 WebUI 时选择“导入现有实例”或“扫描系统”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1042":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-8","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#完成安装","content":"选择 WebUI 类型和安装目录。保留默认 Python、PyTorch 与分支设置即可开始。安装进度会占据实例工作区，并提供任务输出、取消和失败重试。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1043":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-9","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#启动-webui","content":"打开实例，在概览或工作区点击启动。地址捕获成功后可直接打开 WebUI；需要调整参数时进入“运行 → 启动”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1044":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-10","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#管理实例","content":"从实例管理页维护版本、扩展、模型、快照和路径。长任务统一显示在右下角状态区，也可从标题栏打开任务中心查看输出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1045":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-11","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#管理实例","content":"<Card title=\"安装方式\" href=\"/docs/webui-install\" description=\"比较全新安装、导入、扫描和快照恢复。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"1046":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-12","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#管理实例","content":"<Card title=\"实例管理\" href=\"/docs/instance-management\" description=\"了解实例页面中的全部管理分区。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"1047":{"id":"/docs/settings-about-updates","page_id":"/docs/settings-about-updates","type":"page","content":"关于与更新","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","设置"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-about-updates","locale":"zh-CN"},"1048":{"id":"/docs/settings-about-updates-0","page_id":"/docs/settings-about-updates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-about-updates","content":"查看应用版本、项目链接并检查更新。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1049":{"id":"/docs/settings-about-updates-1","page_id":"/docs/settings-about-updates","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-about-updates#检查更新","content":"检查更新","locale":"zh-CN"},"1050":{"id":"/docs/settings-about-updates-2","page_id":"/docs/settings-about-updates","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-about-updates#安装签名更新","content":"安装签名更新","locale":"zh-CN"},"1051":{"id":"/docs/settings-about-updates-3","page_id":"/docs/settings-about-updates","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-about-updates#便携版更新","content":"便携版更新","locale":"zh-CN"},"1052":{"id":"/docs/settings-about-updates-4","page_id":"/docs/settings-about-updates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-about-updates","content":"“关于”页显示当前 Hanafubuki 版本，并提供项目仓库、作者和相关 WebUI 文档链接。外部链接会使用系统浏览器打开，不会替换应用窗口。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1053":{"id":"/docs/settings-about-updates-5","page_id":"/docs/settings-about-updates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-about-updates#检查更新","content":"非便携模式会在后台定期检查更新，也可以在“关于”页点击“检查更新”立即检查。进度和结果显示在设置窗口右下角。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1054":{"id":"/docs/settings-about-updates-6","page_id":"/docs/settings-about-updates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-about-updates#检查更新","content":"更新可能出现三种结果：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1055":{"id":"/docs/settings-about-updates-7","page_id":"/docs/settings-about-updates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-about-updates#检查更新","content":"结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"1056":{"id":"/docs/settings-about-updates-8","page_id":"/docs/settings-about-updates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-about-updates#检查更新","content":"后续操作","locale":"zh-CN"},"1057":{"id":"/docs/settings-about-updates-9","page_id":"/docs/settings-about-updates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-about-updates#检查更新","content":"签名更新可用","locale":"zh-CN"},"1058":{"id":"/docs/settings-about-updates-10","page_id":"/docs/settings-about-updates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-about-updates#检查更新","content":"应用已经下载并验证适用于当前安装类型的更新，可确认安装并重启","locale":"zh-CN"},"1059":{"id":"/docs/settings-about-updates-11","page_id":"/docs/settings-about-updates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-about-updates#检查更新","content":"手动安装包可用","locale":"zh-CN"},"1060":{"id":"/docs/settings-about-updates-12","page_id":"/docs/settings-about-updates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-about-updates#检查更新","content":"自动更新不可用或验证失败，选择当前平台的安装包并在浏览器下载","locale":"zh-CN"},"1061":{"id":"/docs/settings-about-updates-13","page_id":"/docs/settings-about-updates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-about-updates#检查更新","content":"已是最新或不可用","locale":"zh-CN"},"1062":{"id":"/docs/settings-about-updates-14","page_id":"/docs/settings-about-updates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-about-updates#检查更新","content":"无需操作，或根据错误检查网络、代理和更新来源","locale":"zh-CN"},"1063":{"id":"/docs/settings-about-updates-15","page_id":"/docs/settings-about-updates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-about-updates#检查更新","content":"手动安装包列表只提供当前平台经过校验的可用类型，并标记推荐项。点击下载会打开保留的发布地址，不会让界面接受任意下载 URL。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1064":{"id":"/docs/settings-about-updates-16","page_id":"/docs/settings-about-updates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-about-updates#安装签名更新","content":"如果自动安装失败，应用会尝试提供手动安装包。此时先完全退出应用，再按当前平台正常安装；不要同时运行旧程序和安装器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1065":{"id":"/docs/settings-about-updates-17","page_id":"/docs/settings-about-updates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-about-updates#便携版更新","content":"Launcher 便携模式不执行应用内自动更新。点击检查更新时，界面会提示手动替换便携包。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1066":{"id":"/docs/settings-about-updates-18","page_id":"/docs/settings-about-updates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-about-updates#便携版更新","content":"Windows、Linux 和 macOS\n都可能在进程运行时占用程序或运行时文件。先正常退出并确认进程已经结束，再执行安装或便携包替换。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1067":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","type":"page","content":"Agent 设置","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","设置"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-agent","locale":"zh-CN"},"1068":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-0","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-agent","content":"配置模型、权限、记忆、网络工具、MCP 和 Skills。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1069":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-1","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-agent#推荐配置顺序","content":"推荐配置顺序","locale":"zh-CN"},"1070":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-2","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-agent#添加提供商并选择模型","content":"添加提供商并选择模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"1071":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-3","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-agent#选择权限模式","content":"选择权限模式","locale":"zh-CN"},"1072":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-4","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-agent#决定是否使用记忆","content":"决定是否使用记忆","locale":"zh-CN"},"1073":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-5","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-agent#配置内置网络工具","content":"配置内置网络工具","locale":"zh-CN"},"1074":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-6","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-agent#按需添加-mcp-和-skills","content":"按需添加 MCP 和 Skills","locale":"zh-CN"},"1075":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-7","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-agent#保存与生效范围","content":"保存与生效范围","locale":"zh-CN"},"1076":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-8","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-agent#继续阅读","content":"继续阅读","locale":"zh-CN"},"1077":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-9","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-agent","content":"Agent 设置从上到下分为模型与提供商、行为与记忆、内置网络工具、MCP 和 Skills。开始使用前至少需要一个已启用的模型提供商；模型可以在全局设置中选择，也可以在创建会话后单独选择。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1078":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-10","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-agent#添加提供商并选择模型","content":"添加与服务端协议一致的 Provider，填写 API 地址和凭据并保存。启用 Provider 后，在独立的模型策略中选择默认 Provider 和模型，再配置推理强度、上下文窗口、图片输入和压缩策略。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1079":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-11","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-agent#选择权限模式","content":"初次使用建议选择“手动”或“自动审查”。“完全访问”会减少审批，而且应用不提供操作系统沙箱保护，需要在界面中再次确认，只应在可信目录和明确任务中启用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1080":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-12","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-agent#决定是否使用记忆","content":"记忆默认可保持关闭。启用后再分别决定是否读取记忆、从会话生成记忆以及是否排除外部内容。重置会清除已有记忆，执行前应确认不再需要。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1081":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-13","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-agent#配置内置网络工具","content":"选择 DuckDuckGo、SearXNG 或自动搜索，并按需要配置 SearXNG 地址和 Jina Reader 回退。网络搜索与抓取策略在重启后生效。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1082":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-14","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-agent#按需添加-mcp-和-skills","content":"只连接可信 MCP 服务器并为工具设置最小权限；安装 Skill 前检查其说明、脚本和资源。完成后创建测试会话验证实际能力。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1083":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-15","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-agent#保存与生效范围","content":"模型策略和提供商列表有各自的保存按钮，不要在未保存时直接关闭窗口。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1084":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-16","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-agent#保存与生效范围","content":"权限模式和记忆开关修改后按当前设置规则保存。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1085":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-17","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-agent#保存与生效范围","content":"MCP 服务器、MCP 凭据和 Skills 使用各自的管理操作，不属于普通“恢复默认”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1086":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-18","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-agent#保存与生效范围","content":"会话会保留自己的模型和 Skill 状态；每个模型采样步骤还会冻结当时的工具计划。修改全局设置后应按专题说明确认是当前会话下一轮生效，还是需要新建会话。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1087":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-19","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-agent#保存与生效范围","content":"提供商 Token、自定义认证头和 MCP\n凭据属于敏感信息。不要写入提示词、项目文件或截图。诊断会排除已知凭据文档，但诊断包不会对其他收集内容逐项脱敏，分享前仍须检查。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1088":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-20","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-agent#继续阅读","content":"<Card title=\"Agent 快速开始\" href=\"/docs/agent\" description=\"完成第一次配置和会话。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"1089":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-21","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-agent#继续阅读","content":"<Card title=\"提供商与模型\" href=\"/docs/agent-providers-models\" description=\"理解协议、模型能力和上下文。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"1090":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-22","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-agent#继续阅读","content":"<Card title=\"会话管理\" href=\"/docs/agent-conversations\" description=\"管理历史、归档、删除和分叉。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"1091":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-23","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-agent#继续阅读","content":"<Card title=\"权限与审批\" href=\"/docs/agent-permissions\" description=\"选择权限模式并核对操作目标。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"1092":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-24","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-agent#继续阅读","content":"<Card title=\"MCP\" href=\"/docs/agent-mcp\" description=\"配置外部服务器、连接和工具策略。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"1093":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-25","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-agent#继续阅读","content":"<Card title=\"Skills\" href=\"/docs/agent-skills\" description=\"安装并为会话选择可复用流程。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"1094":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-26","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-agent#继续阅读","content":"<Card title=\"记忆\" href=\"/docs/agent-memory\" description=\"管理读取、生成、贡献和重置。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"1095":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","type":"page","content":"外观","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","设置"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-appearance","locale":"zh-CN"},"1096":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-0","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-appearance","content":"配置主题、主题色、壁纸和背景显示效果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1097":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-1","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-appearance#主题与主题色","content":"主题与主题色","locale":"zh-CN"},"1098":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-2","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-appearance#添加和选择壁纸","content":"添加和选择壁纸","locale":"zh-CN"},"1099":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-3","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-appearance#导入图片","content":"导入图片","locale":"zh-CN"},"1100":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-4","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-appearance#检查导入结果","content":"检查导入结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"1101":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-5","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-appearance#选择壁纸","content":"选择壁纸","locale":"zh-CN"},"1102":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-6","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-appearance#选择固定或随机","content":"选择固定或随机","locale":"zh-CN"},"1103":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-7","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-appearance#调整背景效果","content":"调整背景效果","locale":"zh-CN"},"1104":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-8","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-appearance","content":"外观设置只影响界面显示，不会修改实例、模型或运行环境。主题和背景调整会立即应用，适合边修改边检查可读性。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1105":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-9","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-appearance#主题与主题色","content":"主题可以选择“跟随系统”“浅色”或“深色”。跟随系统会使用操作系统当前的明暗模式；固定主题适合系统主题经常变化但希望应用保持一致的情况。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1106":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-10","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-appearance#主题与主题色","content":"主题色用于按钮、选中状态和强调信息。选择颜色后检查普通文本、选中项、警告和链接是否都容易辨认；效果不合适时使用外观页底部的“恢复默认”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1107":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-11","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-appearance#导入图片","content":"点击“添加”，选择一张或多张图片；也可以把系统文件管理器中的图片拖到壁纸区域。应用会将可用图片复制到自己的外观资源目录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1108":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-12","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-appearance#检查导入结果","content":"等待缩略图和图片尺寸出现。部分文件失败时，页面会列出对应文件名和错误，其余成功图片仍会保留。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1109":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-13","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-appearance#选择壁纸","content":"点击缩略图将它设为选中壁纸，然后开启“显示背景图片”。如果资源已经丢失，条目会显示为缺失，不能作为有效背景使用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1110":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-14","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-appearance#选择固定或随机","content":"关闭“随机壁纸”时始终使用选中的图片；开启后，应用每次启动时会从可用壁纸中随机选择一张。资源数量不足时随机选项不可用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1111":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-15","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-appearance#选择固定或随机","content":"删除单张壁纸或“清空”会移除应用保存的副本，不会删除最初导入位置的原图。反过来，移动原图通常不会影响已经成功导入的副本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1112":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-16","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-appearance#调整背景效果","content":"设置","locale":"zh-CN"},"1113":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-17","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-appearance#调整背景效果","content":"建议","locale":"zh-CN"},"1114":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-18","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-appearance#调整背景效果","content":"界面不透明度","locale":"zh-CN"},"1115":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-19","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-appearance#调整背景效果","content":"范围为 40%–100%；越低，壁纸透出越多","locale":"zh-CN"},"1116":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-20","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-appearance#调整背景效果","content":"毛玻璃模糊","locale":"zh-CN"},"1117":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-21","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-appearance#调整背景效果","content":"范围为 0–32；设为 0 可关闭模糊","locale":"zh-CN"},"1118":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-22","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-appearance#调整背景效果","content":"覆盖","locale":"zh-CN"},"1119":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-23","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-appearance#调整背景效果","content":"填满窗口，可能裁剪图片边缘","locale":"zh-CN"},"1120":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-24","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-appearance#调整背景效果","content":"适应","locale":"zh-CN"},"1121":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-25","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-appearance#调整背景效果","content":"完整显示图片，图片比例不同时可能留白","locale":"zh-CN"},"1122":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-26","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-appearance#调整背景效果","content":"拉伸","locale":"zh-CN"},"1123":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-27","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-appearance#调整背景效果","content":"精确填满窗口，可能使图片变形；此时“图片位置”不再生效","locale":"zh-CN"},"1124":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-28","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-appearance#调整背景效果","content":"图片位置","locale":"zh-CN"},"1125":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-29","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-appearance#调整背景效果","content":"决定覆盖裁剪或适应留白时优先保留的区域","locale":"zh-CN"},"1126":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-30","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-appearance#调整背景效果","content":"高对比度或细节复杂的壁纸应提高界面不透明度或模糊强度。设置后至少检查首页、设置窗口、实例管理和对话框中的文字、错误与状态提示。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1127":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-31","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-appearance#调整背景效果","content":"若壁纸显示失败，先确认条目没有“缺失”标记，再尝试重新导入。不要直接修改应用数据目录中的壁纸文件，否则资源记录可能仍在但文件已经不可用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1128":{"id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics","page_id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics","type":"page","content":"诊断","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","设置"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-diagnostics","locale":"zh-CN"},"1129":{"id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics-0","page_id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-diagnostics","content":"生成、查看并导出应用级诊断包。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1130":{"id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics-1","page_id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-diagnostics#生成应用诊断","content":"生成应用诊断","locale":"zh-CN"},"1131":{"id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics-2","page_id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-diagnostics#是否包含所有实例","content":"是否包含所有实例","locale":"zh-CN"},"1132":{"id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics-3","page_id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-diagnostics#诊断包包含什么","content":"诊断包包含什么","locale":"zh-CN"},"1133":{"id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics-4","page_id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-diagnostics","content":"应用诊断适合排查首次启动、运行时准备、跨实例任务、Agent 和平台问题。单个实例的环境或维护问题，优先从实例管理中的实例诊断生成范围更小的诊断包。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1134":{"id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics-5","page_id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-diagnostics#是否包含所有实例","content":"开启后，开始收集时会固定一份实例清单，再按顺序收集每个实例。收集期间新建的实例不会追加；某个实例无法访问、正在维护或已被替换时，会在诊断清单中记录问题，但不会丢弃已经收集的其他内容。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1135":{"id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics-6","page_id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-diagnostics#是否包含所有实例","content":"关闭后，应用包只收集应用级配置、日志、状态、Agent 非凭据数据和应用任务等内容，生成速度更快、体积更小。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1136":{"id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics-7","page_id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-diagnostics#诊断包包含什么","content":"应用诊断通常包含：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1137":{"id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics-8","page_id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-diagnostics#诊断包包含什么","content":"当前全局设置和配置目录；","locale":"zh-CN"},"1138":{"id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics-9","page_id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-diagnostics#诊断包包含什么","content":"文件日志与本次运行的内存日志；","locale":"zh-CN"},"1139":{"id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics-10","page_id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-diagnostics#诊断包包含什么","content":"应用状态、任务活动和诊断状态；","locale":"zh-CN"},"1140":{"id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics-11","page_id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-diagnostics#诊断包包含什么","content":"Agent 历史、记忆和非敏感 Skill 状态；","locale":"zh-CN"},"1141":{"id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics-12","page_id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-diagnostics#诊断包包含什么","content":"开启实例收集时的实例快照、环境报告、任务和运行状态。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1142":{"id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics-13","page_id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-diagnostics#诊断包包含什么","content":"提供商凭据文档和 MCP 凭据文档会整体排除，但其余内容不会自动遮盖或改写。路径、环境变量、命令、输出、Token 或用户数据仍可能出现在其他原始来源中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1143":{"id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics-14","page_id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-diagnostics#诊断包包含什么","content":"分享前解压 ZIP，检查\n`manifest.json`、日志、环境报告和任务输出，删除或遮盖不应公开的内容。只把诊断包发送给可信接收者。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1144":{"id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics-15","page_id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-diagnostics#诊断包包含什么","content":"诊断 ZIP 没有自动保留期限，也不会随日志保留策略删除。确认不再需要后，应通过系统文件管理器清理应用诊断目录中的旧文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1145":{"id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools","page_id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools","type":"page","content":"环境工具","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","设置"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-environment-tools","locale":"zh-CN"},"1146":{"id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools-0","page_id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-environment-tools","content":"配置 uv、启动前环境检查和 CUDA 显存优化。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1147":{"id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools-1","page_id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-environment-tools#启用-uv","content":"启用 uv","locale":"zh-CN"},"1148":{"id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools-2","page_id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-environment-tools#启用环境检查","content":"启用环境检查","locale":"zh-CN"},"1149":{"id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools-3","page_id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-environment-tools#启用-cuda-显存优化","content":"启用 CUDA 显存优化","locale":"zh-CN"},"1150":{"id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools-4","page_id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-environment-tools#修改与验证","content":"修改与验证","locale":"zh-CN"},"1151":{"id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools-5","page_id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-environment-tools","content":"环境工具决定安装流程和 WebUI 启动时怎样使用实例 Python。它们不会选择应用 Python 版本，也不会代替实例管理中的 PyTorch、扩展或版本操作。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1152":{"id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools-6","page_id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-environment-tools#启用-uv","content":"开启后，支持的 Python 软件包安装使用 uv 代替 pip，通常速度更快。某些安装脚本或非标准软件包与 uv 不兼容时，可以临时关闭后重试同一个操作。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1153":{"id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools-7","page_id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-environment-tools#启用-uv","content":"关闭 uv 不会卸载已经安装的软件包，也不会自动把环境恢复到之前状态；它只改变后续安装命令使用的工具。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1154":{"id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools-8","page_id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-environment-tools#启用环境检查","content":"开启后，应用会在 WebUI 启动前检查并修复其依赖。首次启动、更新 Core、恢复快照或修改依赖后建议保持开启。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1155":{"id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools-9","page_id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-environment-tools#启用环境检查","content":"环境检查可能增加启动时间。只有确认实例环境已经完整，并且需要对比检查流程是否导致启动失败时，才临时关闭；排查结束后应重新开启。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1156":{"id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools-10","page_id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-environment-tools#启用-cuda-显存优化","content":"该选项在启动 WebUI 时请求 CUDA 异步显存分配器：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1157":{"id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools-11","page_id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-environment-tools#启用-cuda-显存优化","content":"只在支持该能力的 NVIDIA 环境中生效；","locale":"zh-CN"},"1158":{"id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools-12","page_id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-environment-tools#启用-cuda-显存优化","content":"AMD、Intel、Apple 或 CPU 环境会忽略；","locale":"zh-CN"},"1159":{"id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools-13","page_id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-environment-tools#启用-cuda-显存优化","content":"某些旧驱动、旧版 CUDA 或特定 WebUI 组合可能不兼容。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1160":{"id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools-14","page_id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-environment-tools#启用-cuda-显存优化","content":"遇到启动阶段的 CUDA 分配器错误时，先关闭此项并重新启动实例进行对比，不要同时更换 PyTorch 和多个启动参数。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1161":{"id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools-15","page_id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-environment-tools#修改与验证","content":"环境工具属于应用级设置。修改后，之后执行相关流程的所有实例都可能受到影响，因此不要为解决单个实例问题长期关闭必要检查。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1162":{"id":"/docs/settings-la