log`。关闭“保存日志到文件”只停止磁盘持久化，不会让本次运行的诊断日志消失。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1184":{"id":"/docs/settings-logs-7","page_id":"/docs/settings-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-logs#内存日志与文件日志","content":"开启文件持久化后，日志写入应用数据目录的 `logs` 文件夹：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1185":{"id":"/docs/settings-logs-8","page_id":"/docs/settings-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-logs#内存日志与文件日志","content":"当前文件为 `hanafubuki.log`；","locale":"zh-CN"},"1186":{"id":"/docs/settings-logs-9","page_id":"/docs/settings-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-logs#内存日志与文件日志","content":"达到大小上限后，旧文件改为带 UTC 时间戳的名称，新文件继续记录；","locale":"zh-CN"},"1187":{"id":"/docs/settings-logs-10","page_id":"/docs/settings-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-logs#内存日志与文件日志","content":"超过保留天数的历史 `.log` 文件会被清理；","locale":"zh-CN"},"1188":{"id":"/docs/settings-logs-11","page_id":"/docs/settings-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-logs#内存日志与文件日志","content":"当前活动日志、目录和符号链接不会被保留策略删除。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1189":{"id":"/docs/settings-logs-12","page_id":"/docs/settings-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-logs#字段说明","content":"设置","locale":"zh-CN"},"1190":{"id":"/docs/settings-logs-13","page_id":"/docs/settings-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-logs#字段说明","content":"范围或行为","locale":"zh-CN"},"1191":{"id":"/docs/settings-logs-14","page_id":"/docs/settings-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-logs#字段说明","content":"保存日志到文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"1192":{"id":"/docs/settings-logs-15","page_id":"/docs/settings-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-logs#字段说明","content":"控制是否把日志持久化到磁盘","locale":"zh-CN"},"1193":{"id":"/docs/settings-logs-16","page_id":"/docs/settings-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-logs#字段说明","content":"日志文件大小上限","locale":"zh-CN"},"1194":{"id":"/docs/settings-logs-17","page_id":"/docs/settings-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-logs#字段说明","content":"1–512 MB；达到上限后轮转","locale":"