id":"/docs/settings-mirrors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mirrors","content":"配置 Micromamba、PyPI、GitHub、Hugging Face 和模型下载来源。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1218":{"id":"/docs/settings-mirrors-1","page_id":"/docs/settings-mirrors","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-mirrors#自动与手动模式","content":"自动与手动模式","locale":"zh-CN"},"1219":{"id":"/docs/settings-mirrors-2","page_id":"/docs/settings-mirrors","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-mirrors#推荐配置顺序","content":"推荐配置顺序","locale":"zh-CN"},"1220":{"id":"/docs/settings-mirrors-3","page_id":"/docs/settings-mirrors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mirrors","content":"镜像可以改善特定网络下的软件包和资源下载速度，但镜像内容可能延迟或缺失。普通用户建议先使用“自动选择镜像”，只有需要固定来源或排查问题时才改为手动。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1221":{"id":"/docs/settings-mirrors-4","page_id":"/docs/settings-mirrors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mirrors#自动与手动模式","content":"开启“自动选择镜像”后，应用会按当前网络为 Micromamba 解析通道，并把自动策略交给 Python 安装流程处理其支持的软件源。此时手动开关和自定义地址会被禁用，避免两套策略同时生效。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1222":{"id":"/docs/settings-mirrors-5","page_id":"/docs/settings-mirrors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mirrors#自动与手动模式","content":"关闭自动选择后，可以分别控制：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1223":{"id":"/docs/settings-mirrors-6","page_id":"/docs/settings-mirrors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mirrors#自动与手动模式","content":"设置","locale":"zh-CN"},"1224":{"id":"/docs/settings-mirrors-7","page_id":"/docs/settings-mirrors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mirrors#自动与手动模式","content":"主要用途","locale":"zh-CN"},"1225":{"id":"/docs/settings-mirrors-8","page_id":"/docs/settings-mirrors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mirrors#自动与手动模式","content":"Micromamba 镜像","locale":"zh-CN"},"1226":{"id":"/docs/settings-mirrors-9","page_id":"/docs/settings-mirrors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mirrors#自动与手动模式","content":"Conda 环境、Git 等受管工具的包与通道","locale":"zh-CN"},"1227":{"id":"/docs/settings-mirrors-10","page_id":"/docs/settings-mirrors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mirrors#自动与手动模式","content":"PyPI 镜像","locale":"zh-CN"},"1228":{"id":"/docs/settings-mirrors-11","page_id":"/docs/settings-mirrors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mirrors#自动与手动模式","content":"WebUI Python 依赖安装","locale":"zh-CN"},"1229":{"id":"/docs/settings-mirrors-12","page_id":"/docs/settings-mirrors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mirrors#自动与手动模式","content":"GitHub 镜像","locale":"zh-CN"},"1230":{"id":"/docs/settings-mirrors-13","page_id":"/docs/settings-mirrors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mirrors#自动与手动模式","content":"Core、扩展和发布资源","locale":"zh-CN"},"1231":{"id":"/docs/settings-mirrors-14","page_id":"/docs/settings-mirrors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mirrors#自动与手动模式","content":"Hugging Face 镜像","locale":"zh-CN"},"1232":{"id":"/docs/settings-mirrors-15","page_id":"/docs/settings-mirrors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mirrors#自动与手动模式","content":"Hugging Face 仓库与文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"1233":{"id":"/docs/settings-mirrors-16","page_id":"/docs/settings-mirrors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mirrors#自动与手动模式","content":"模型下载源","locale":"zh-CN"},"1234":{"id":"/docs/settings-mirrors-17","page_id":"/docs/settings-mirrors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mirrors#自动与手动模式","content":"在 ModelScope 与 Hugging Face 之间选择","locale":"zh-CN"},"1235":{"id":"/docs/settings-mirrors-18","page_id":"/docs/settings-mirrors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mirrors#自动与手动模式","content":"自定义 GitHub 或 Hugging Face 地址只有在关闭自动选择并启用对应手动镜像后才可填写。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1236":{"id":"/docs/settings-mirrors-19","page_id":"/docs/settings-mirrors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mirrors#推荐配置顺序","content":"模型下载源只影响使用内置模型下载能力的操作，不会移动现有模型，也不会改变扩展从 Git 仓库下载的来源。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1237":{"id":"/docs/settings-mirrors-20","page_id":"/docs/settings-mirrors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mirrors#推荐配置顺序","content":"镜像可能缺少最新提交、返回不同文件或延迟同步。安装结果出现异常时，应使用官方来源重试并核对任务输出；不要通过关闭校验来接受不一致文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1238":{"id":"/docs/settings-mirrors-21","page_id":"/docs/settings-mirrors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mirrors#推荐配置顺序","content":"如果所有来源都连接失败，优先检查系统时间、DNS、代理和防火墙；如果只有某一种资源失败，再检查对应镜像或切换模型下载源。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1239":{"id":"/docs/settings-network","page_id":"/docs/settings-network","type":"page","content":"网络与代理","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","设置"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-network","locale":"zh-CN"},"1240":{"id":"/docs/settings-network-0","page_id":"/docs/settings-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-network","content":"配置系统代理、手动代理或直接连接。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1241":{"id":"/docs/settings-network-1","page_id":"/docs/settings-network","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-network#选择代理模式","content":"选择代理模式","locale":"zh-CN"},"1242":{"id":"/docs/settings-network-2","page_id":"/docs/settings-network","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-network#配置手动代理","content":"配置手动代理","locale":"zh-CN"},"1243":{"id":"/docs/settings-network-3","page_id":"/docs/settings-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-network","content":"代理设置控制后端下载、托管服务以及之后启动的任务和终端怎样访问网络。它与镜像设置相互独立：代理决定“怎样连接”，镜像决定“连接哪个来源”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1244":{"id":"/docs/settings-network-4","page_id":"/docs/settings-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-network#选择代理模式","content":"应用读取操作系统当前代理，并在页面下方显示检测到的有效地址。没有检测到地址时会显示“未检测到系统代理”，此时相关连接按直连处理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1245":{"id":"/docs/settings-network-5","page_id":"/docs/settings-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-network#选择代理模式","content":"所有相关网络操作使用你填写的代理 URL。适合系统代理无法被检测，或只希望 Hanafubuki\n使用指定代理的情况。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1246":{"id":"/docs/settings-network-6","page_id":"/docs/settings-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-network#选择代理模式","content":"忽略系统代理和手动代理，使用直接连接。可用于直连网络，也可用于判断失败是否由错误代理造成。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1247":{"id":"/docs/settings-network-7","page_id":"/docs/settings-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-network#配置手动代理","content":"手动地址必须包含协议、主机和明确端口，例如：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1248":{"id":"/docs/settings-network-8","page_id":"/docs/settings-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-network#配置手动代理","content":"支持 `http`、`https`、`socks`、`socks4`、`socks4a`、`socks5` 和 `socks5h`。只填写 `127.0.0.1`、省略端口或使用 `ftp` 等协议都会被拒绝。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1249":{"id":"/docs/settings-network-9","page_id":"/docs/settings-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-network#配置手动代理","content":"代理快照会作用于之后创建的子进程。已经启动的 WebUI、任务或普通终端保留启动时的环境；修改代理后需要停止并重新创建这些进程，不能只刷新页面。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1250":{"id":"/docs/settings-network-10","page_id":"/docs/settings-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-network#配置手动代理","content":"如果代理 URL\n包含用户名或密码，不要把完整地址复制到公开日志、截图或问题报告中。生成诊断包后也应先检查再分享。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1251":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","type":"page","content":"路径","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","设置"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-paths","locale":"zh-CN"},"1252":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-0","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-paths","content":"管理产物缓存、默认安装目录和受管运行时存储。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1253":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-1","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-paths#缓存与默认安装目录","content":"缓存与默认安装目录","locale":"zh-CN"},"1254":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-2","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-paths#受管运行时存储","content":"受管运行时存储","locale":"zh-CN"},"1255":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-3","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-paths#迁移受管运行时","content":"迁移受管运行时","locale":"zh-CN"},"1256":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-4","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-paths#填写新目录","content":"填写新目录","locale":"zh-CN"},"1257":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-5","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-paths#预览组件位置","content":"预览组件位置","locale":"zh-CN"},"1258":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-6","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-paths#安排迁移","content":"安排迁移","locale":"zh-CN"},"1259":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-7","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-paths#正常退出并重新启动","content":"正常退出并重新启动","locale":"zh-CN"},"1260":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-8","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-paths#验证结果","content":"验证结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"1261":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-9","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-paths","content":"路径页包含两类位置：普通下载与实例默认路径，以及应用自己维护的运行时存储。它们用途不同，修改其中一个不会自动迁移其他目录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1262":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-10","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-paths#缓存与默认安装目录","content":"设置","locale":"zh-CN"},"1263":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-11","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-paths#缓存与默认安装目录","content":"影响","locale":"zh-CN"},"1264":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-12","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-paths#缓存与默认安装目录","content":"产物缓存目录","locale":"zh-CN"},"1265":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-13","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-paths#缓存与默认安装目录","content":"后续安装和下载任务用于保存、复用下载产物的位置","locale":"zh-CN"},"1266":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-14","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-paths#缓存与默认安装目录","content":"默认 WebUI 安装目录","locale":"zh-CN"},"1267":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-15","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-paths#缓存与默认安装目录","content":"新建实例时预填的根目录；不会移动或改写已有实例","locale":"zh-CN"},"1268":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-16","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-paths#缓存与默认安装目录","content":"这两个字段必须手动保存。保存时后端会验证并准备目录，因此不要在输入尚未完成时按 `Enter`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1269":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-17","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-paths#缓存与默认安装目录","content":"修改产物缓存不会移动旧缓存，也不会删除原目录。确认新任务工作正常后，再通过系统文件管理器自行评估旧缓存是否可以清理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1270":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-18","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-paths#受管运行时存储","content":"受管运行时存储是 Hanafubuki 自己维护的目录，包含：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1271":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-19","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-paths#受管运行时存储","content":"应用 Standalone Python；","locale":"zh-CN"},"1272":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-20","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-paths#受管运行时存储","content":"Micromamba 可执行文件；","locale":"zh-CN"},"1273":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-21","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-paths#受管运行时存储","content":"Conda 根目录和包缓存；","locale":"zh-CN"},"1274":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-22","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-paths#受管运行时存储","content":"已校验的 Launcher Python 代码。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1275":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-23","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-paths#受管运行时存储","content":"它不包含 WebUI 实例、模型、普通产物缓存或诊断包。若只是想改变新实例的位置，应修改“默认 WebUI 安装目录”，不要迁移受管运行时。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1276":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-24","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-paths#填写新目录","content":"最终目标必须是一个尚不存在的新目录，不能与应用数据、已有实例或组件路径重叠，也不能经过符号链接。使用浏览按钮定位父目录后，可在输入框末尾补上新的子目录名。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1277":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-25","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-paths#预览组件位置","content":"点击“迁移”，检查确认窗口列出的 Python、Micromamba、Conda 和 Launcher Code 目标位置。此时只生成计划，不会复制文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1278":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-26","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-paths#安排迁移","content":"点击“下次重启时迁移”。页面会记录待迁移目标；如果还没有退出应用，可以使用“取消”撤销这个已安排计划。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1279":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-27","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-paths#正常退出并重新启动","content":"先完成正在运行的实例、终端和维护任务，再通过正常方式退出应用。重新启动后，启动页会在加载其他功能前完成迁移。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1280":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-28","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-paths#验证结果","content":"应用打开后回到“路径”和“运行环境”，确认当前运行时根目录以及 Python、Micromamba、Git 状态正常。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1281":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-29","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-paths#验证结果","content":"迁移不会把运行时合并到已有目录。迁移期间不要移动源目录、预先创建目标目录或同时启动第二个\nHanafubuki 进程。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1282":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-30","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-paths#验证结果","content":"若迁移失败，应用会继续使用仍然有效的原位置，并显示需要恢复的记录。排除磁盘空间、权限或目标冲突后点击“重试”，再正常退出和启动；不要直接删除源目录或目标暂存内容。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1283":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","type":"page","content":"运行环境","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","设置"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-runtime","locale":"zh-CN"},"1284":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime-0","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-runtime","content":"检查并配置应用 Python、Micromamba 和 Git。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1285":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime-1","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-runtime#阅读状态面板","content":"阅读状态面板","locale":"zh-CN"},"1286":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime-2","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-runtime#选择应用-python","content":"选择应用 Python","locale":"zh-CN"},"1287":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime-3","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-runtime#选择-git-来源","content":"选择 Git 来源","locale":"zh-CN"},"1288":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime-4","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-runtime#失败排查","content":"失败排查","locale":"zh-CN"},"1289":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime-5","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-runtime","content":"运行环境页显示 Hanafubuki 自己依赖的 Python、Micromamba 和 Git。它们属于应用级运行时，与每个 WebUI 实例自己的 Python 和 Core 相互独立。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1290":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime-6","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-runtime#阅读状态面板","content":"每个面板会显示当前状态、准备步骤、错误和已检测信息：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1291":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime-7","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-runtime#阅读状态面板","content":"面板","locale":"zh-CN"},"1292":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime-8","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-runtime#阅读状态面板","content":"重点信息","locale":"zh-CN"},"1293":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime-9","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-runtime#阅读状态面板","content":"应用运行环境","locale":"zh-CN"},"1294":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime-10","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-runtime#阅读状态面板","content":"Python 版本、可执行文件、Python 目录、Launcher Code 和应用 API","locale":"zh-CN"},"1295":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime-11","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-runtime#阅读状态面板","content":"Micromamba","locale":"zh-CN"},"1296":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime-12","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-runtime#阅读状态面板","content":"内置版本、检测版本、可执行文件和 SHA-256","locale":"zh-CN"},"1297":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime-13","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-runtime#阅读状态面板","content":"Git","locale":"zh-CN"},"1298":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime-14","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-runtime#阅读状态面板","content":"检测版本、可执行文件、安装任务和 Conda 根修复状态","locale":"zh-CN"},"1299":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime-15","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-runtime#阅读状态面板","content":"状态为“准备中”时查看当前步骤，不要连续点击重试。状态为“失败”时先展开错误，记录失败阶段和详细信息；面板允许重试时再使用重试按钮。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1300":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime-16","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-runtime#选择应用-python","content":"“应用 Python 版本”支持当前界面列出的 Python 版本。修改会立即保存，但只在下次启动时切换应用运行时。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1301":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime-17","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-runtime#选择应用-python","content":"切换应用 Python 不会重装实例 Python，也不会改变实例选用的 Python 版本。实例环境问题应在对应实例的管理页处理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1302":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime-18","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-runtime#选择-git-来源","content":"来源","locale":"zh-CN"},"1303":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime-19","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-runtime#选择-git-来源","content":"行为","locale":"zh-CN"},"1304":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime-20","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-runtime#选择-git-来源","content":"优先使用系统 Git","locale":"zh-CN"},"1305":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime-21","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-runtime#选择-git-来源","content":"下次启动时检查系统 `PATH` 中的 Git；不可用时自动回退到 Micromamba Git","locale":"zh-CN"},"1306":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime-22","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-runtime#选择-git-来源","content":"使用 Micromamba Git","locale":"zh-CN"},"1307":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime-23","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-runtime#选择-git-来源","content":"跳过系统 Git，始终使用应用托管的 Git","locale":"zh-CN"},"1308":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime-24","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-runtime#选择-git-来源","content":"Git 来源同样在下次应用启动时生效。系统已经安装可用 Git 时通常保留默认选择；需要固定、隔离的 Git 环境时再选择 Micromamba。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1309":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime-25","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-runtime#失败排查","content":"Python 下载或校验失败：检查网络、代理、镜像、磁盘空间和受管运行时目录权限。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1310":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime-26","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-runtime#失败排查","content":"Micromamba 失败：确认没有第二个应用进程占用运行时，并检查目标磁盘是否可写。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1311":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime-27","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-runtime#失败排查","content":"Git 等待 Micromamba：先让 Micromamba 完成准备，这不是独立的 Git 卡死。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1312":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime-28","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-runtime#失败排查","content":"状态订阅不可用：使用面板重试；仍失败时生成应用诊断包。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1313":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime-29","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-runtime#失败排查","content":"不要从外部覆盖受管 Python、Micromamba、Conda 或 Launcher\nCode。应用会按自己的版本和校验规则准备这些组件，手动修改可能在下次检查时被判定为损坏。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1314":{"id":"/docs/settings","page_id":"/docs/settings","type":"page","content":"设置","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","设置"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings","locale":"zh-CN"},"1315":{"id":"/docs/settings-0","page_id":"/docs/settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings","content":"了解设置的保存方式，并按分区配置 Hanafubuki。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1316":{"id":"/docs/settings-1","page_id":"/docs/settings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings#设置怎样保存","content":"设置怎样保存","locale":"zh-CN"},"1317":{"id":"/docs/settings-2","page_id":"/docs/settings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings#按分区查找","content":"按分区查找","locale":"zh-CN"},"1318":{"id":"/docs/settings-3","page_id":"/docs/settings","ta