-runtime#应用-python-或-git-切换后无变化","content":"应用 Python 版本和 Git 来源在下次启动生效：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1366":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-19","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#应用-python-或-git-切换后无变化","content":"等待正在运行的安装、管理和 Agent 任务结束。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1367":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-20","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#应用-python-或-git-切换后无变化","content":"保存新的版本或来源。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1368":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-21","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#应用-python-或-git-切换后无变化","content":"正常退出所有 Hanafubuki 窗口。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1369":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-22","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#应用-python-或-git-切换后无变化","content":"重新启动后返回运行环境页核对实际路径和版本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1370":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-23","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#应用-python-或-git-切换后无变化","content":"修改这些设置不会重装实例 Python，也不会修复某个 WebUI 扩展的依赖。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1371":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-24","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#windows-smartscreen-阻止应用启动","content":"当前 Windows 安装包与便携版尚未签名。首次启动安装程序、免安装版或 Launcher 时，如果系统显示 `Windows 已保护你的电脑。Microsoft Defender SmartScreen 阻止了无法识别的应用启动。运行此应用可能会导致你的电脑存在风险。`，请确认文件来自本站，然后点击“更多信息”，再点击“仍然运行”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1372":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-25","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#windows-smartscreen-阻止应用启动","content":"“仍然运行”只会在展开“更多信息”后显示。只对从本站下载并核对过名称与平台的文件执行此操作；第三方转载或来源不明的文件应删除并重新下载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1373":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-26","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#macos-提示应用已损坏","content":"当前 macOS 安装包与便携版尚未签名。首次打开时如果系统提示 `“Hanafubuki” is damaged and can't be opened` 或 `“Hanafubuki Launcher” is damaged and can't be opened`，请不要移到废纸篓。确认文件来自本站后，按照安装 Hanafubuki 的 macOS 步骤对相应 `.app` 执行 `xattr -dr com.apple.quarantine`，然后重新打开。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1374":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-27","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#macos-提示应用已损坏","content":"只对从本站下载并核对过名称与平台的应用移除隔离属性；第三方转载或来源不明的文件应删除并重新下载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1375":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-28","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#应用界面或窗口异常","content":"应用仍能操作时，先记录出现异常的页面并正常重启。若异常只发生在嵌入式 WebUI，先尝试从“实例信息”使用捕获地址在外部浏览器打开，以区分 WebUI 页面问题和应用窗口呈现问题。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1376":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-29","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#应用界面或窗口异常","content":"窗口无法打开、持续白屏或启动即退出时：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1377":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-30","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#应用界面或窗口异常","content":"记录操作系统、Hanafubuki 版本和发生时间。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1378":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-31","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#应用界面或窗口异常","content":"检查应用日志与操作系统崩溃记录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1379":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-32","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#应用界面或窗口异常","content":"不要先删除应用数据目录；其中包含实例记录、设置和诊断材料。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1380":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-33","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#应用界面或窗口异常","content":"使用应用诊断包向 Hanafubuki 维护者报告，而不是向 WebUI 扩展作者报告。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1381":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-34","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#更新失败","content":"阶段","locale":"zh-CN"},"1382":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-35","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#更新失败","content":"优先检查","locale":"zh-CN"},"1383":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-36","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#更新失败","content":"无法检查更新","locale":"zh-CN"},"1384":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-37","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#更新失败","content":"网络、代理、系统时间和更新源可达性","locale":"zh-CN"},"1385":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-38","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#更新失败","content":"下载失败","locale":"zh-CN"},"1386":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-39","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#更新失败","content":"任务输出、磁盘空间、临时目录和安全软件","locale":"zh-CN"},"1387":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-40","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#更新失败","content":"安装包打不开","locale":"zh-CN"},"1388":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-41","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#更新失败","content":"平台和架构是否正确、文件是否完整、系统安全提示","locale":"zh-CN"},"1389":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-42","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#更新失败","content":"重启后