":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#路径权限和磁盘","content":"遇到拒绝访问时检查文件是否被 WebUI、终端、编辑器、安全软件或另一个应用进程占用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1423":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-25","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#路径权限和磁盘","content":"不要为了通过校验而关闭完整性检查或手动合并不明来源文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1424":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-26","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#依赖和-pytorch-安装失败","content":"`No module named`、编译失败或包版本冲突通常来自实例环境：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1425":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-27","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#依赖和-pytorch-安装失败","content":"记录具体包名、要求版本和最早的安装错误。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1426":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-28","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#依赖和-pytorch-安装失败","content":"确认安装选项与当前 WebUI 类型和操作系统匹配。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1427":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-29","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#依赖和-pytorch-安装失败","content":"PyTorch 失败时恢复“自动”或类型默认选项，并核对显卡驱动。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1428":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-30","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#依赖和-pytorch-安装失败","content":"扩展依赖失败时先确认是可选扩展，不要立即重建整个 Core。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1429":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-31","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#依赖和-pytorch-安装失败","content":"确需手动处理时使用实例终端，并在操作前创建快照。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1430":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-32","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#取消清理和重试","content":"取消只是请求。点击取消后等待任务进入“已取消”或明确失败；只有界面出现“重试进程清理”时才执行清理。清理完成后再“重试安装”，不要同时创建同路径的新实例。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1431":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-33","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#取消清理和重试","content":"若实例记录已保存但任务尚未启动，重新打开该实例并点击“开始安装”，不需要删除记录或重新创建同名实例。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1432":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-34","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#取消清理和重试","content":"安装完成并已经获得 WebUI 地址后，模型、扩展、节点和生成错误应进入 WebUI\n上游问题，而不是反复重装应用运行环境。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1433":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-35","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#取消清理和重试","content":"<Card title=\"安装进度与故障处理\" href=\"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting\" description=\"理解安装阶段、日志和重试按钮。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"1434":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-36","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#取消清理和重试","content":"<Card title=\"网络与代理\" href=\"/docs/settings-network\" description=\"验证系统代理、手动代理和直连。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"1435":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-37","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#取消清理和重试","content":"<Card title=\"镜像\" href=\"/docs/settings-mirrors\" description=\"检查软件包、代码和模型来源。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"1436":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-38","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#取消清理和重试","content":"<Card title=\"路径与存储\" href=\"/docs/settings-paths\" description=\"检查缓存、安装目录和受管存储。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"1437":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-sta