动”不代表 WebUI 已经就绪。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1446":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-8","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#阅读启动状态","content":"进入实例工作区查看启动接管页面，或在“实例信息”中查看实时启动阶段、警告、捕获地址和最近失败。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1447":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-9","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#阅读启动状态","content":"现象","locale":"zh-CN"},"1448":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-10","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#阅读启动状态","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"1449":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-11","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#阅读启动状态","content":"启动任务立即失败","locale":"zh-CN"},"1450":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-12","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#阅读启动状态","content":"参数校验、Python、Core、依赖或进程创建失败","locale":"zh-CN"},"1451":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-13","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#阅读启动状态","content":"日志持续输出但没有地址","locale":"zh-CN"},"1452":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-14","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#阅读启动状态","content":"WebUI 仍在加载模型/扩展，或没有输出可识别的监听地址","locale":"zh-CN"},"1453":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-15","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#阅读启动状态","content":"进程退出并有 Python traceback","locale":"zh-CN"},"1454":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-16","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#阅读启动状态","content":"Core、扩展、依赖或 PyTorch 在初始化时失败","locale":"zh-CN"},"1455":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-17","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#阅读启动状态","content":"已捕获地址但嵌入页面打不开","locale":"zh-CN"},"1456":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-18","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#阅读启动状态","content":"地址监听、浏览器呈现、代理或 WebView 问题","locale":"zh-CN"},"1457":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-19","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#阅读启动状态","content":"外部浏览器可以打开","locale":"zh-CN"},"1458":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-20","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#阅读启动状态","content":"WebUI 本身已运行，重点检查嵌入呈现而不是重装实例","locale":"zh-CN"},"1459":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-21","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#启动后立即退出","content":"如果日志明确来自某个扩展，先禁用、更新或回退该扩展；如果来自 Core 与扩展接口不兼容，应同时核对两者版本。不要先卸载所有 Python 包，这会破坏进一步定位所需的环境。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1460":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-22","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#启动参数和环境变量","content":"在“启动”页检查原始参数解析错误、未知参数和互斥选项。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1461":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-23","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#启动参数和环境变量","content":"原始参数只填写传给 WebUI 的内容，不包含 Python 或启动脚本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1462":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-24","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#启动参数和环境变量","content":"“仅本次忽略”只适合确认当前分支仍接受该参数，不应长期跳过同一警告。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1463":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-25","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#启动参数和环境变量","content":"修改参数或环境变量后必须重新启动 WebUI，刷新页面不会改变已运行进程。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1464":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-26","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#启动参数和环境变量","content":"不要用自定义 `PATH`、`PYTHONPATH`、`MAMBA_*` 或 `CONDA_*` 覆盖受管环境。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1465":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-27","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#端口和地址","content":"出现端口占用或无法连接时：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1466":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-28","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#端口和地址","content":"从启动日志确认实际监听地址和端口，不要只假设为 `7860`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1467":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-29","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#端口和地址","content":"使用任务中心和系统工具确认是否有旧 WebUI 或其他服务占用端口。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1468":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-30","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#端口和地址","content":"旧任务属于 Hanafubuki 时，先完成原任务停止和清理，不要直接杀进程后立即重启。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1469":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-31","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#端口和地址","content":"需要改端口时在实例启动参数中使用当前 WebUI 支持的端口选项。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1470":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-32","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#端口和地址","content":"重启后确认日志、捕获地址和浏览器打开的端口一致。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1471":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-33","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#端口和地址","content":"监听 `127.0.0.1` 通常只允许本机访问；监听所有网卡或开放远程连接会扩大安全边界。不要为了排查本地页面而无条件开启远程访问。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1472":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-34","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#有地址但页面打不开","content":"依次检查：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1473":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-35","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#有地址但页面打不开","content":"WebUI 进程是否仍在运行，而不是启动后立刻退出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1474":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-36","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#有地址但页面打不开","content":"地址中的协议、主机和端口是否与日志一致。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1475":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-37","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#有地址但页面打不开","content":"使用系统浏览器打开捕获地址，区分 WebUI 服务和嵌入 WebView。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1476":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-38","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#有地址但页面打不开","content":"浏览器代理、翻译扩展、缓存或安全软件是否修改了本地页面请求。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1477":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-39","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#有地址但页面打不开","content":"WebUI 是否配置了认证、子路径或仅允许特定主机访问。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1478":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-40","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#有地址但页面打不开","content":"页面能打开但生成、模型或节点失败时，启动已经成功，应转到 WebUI 上游问题。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1479":{"id":