859":{"id":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-28","page_id":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#查看和保存输出","content":"安装诊断可能包含环境变量、本地路径、命令输出、凭据或令牌。分享前先解压检查并脱敏，详见实例诊断。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1860":{"id":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-29","page_id":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#请求取消","content":"运行中且允许取消时，点击“取消安装”。取消是一个请求；应等待界面进入“已取消”或失败状态，不要立即删除目录或退出进程。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1861":{"id":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-30","page_id":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#检查清理状态","content":"如果子进程已经确认结束，界面会释放本次安装的所有权。如果终止或检查失败，错误中会保留待处理的清理义务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1862":{"id":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-31","page_id":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#重试进程清理","content":"只有界面显示“重试进程清理”时才使用它。该操作只确认并释放残留进程状态，不会重新安装 Python 或 Core。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1863":{"id":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-32","page_id":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#重新安装","content":"清理完成后点击“重试安装”。应用会创建新的安装操作，并从当前实例状态重新执行需要的步骤。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1864":{"id":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-33","page_id":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#重新安装","content":"不要通过任务管理器强行结束后立刻重复创建同一路径的实例；后端仍可能保留需要确认的进程和实例状态。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1865":{"id":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-34","page_id":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#按错误类型处理","content":"现象或错误","locale":"zh-CN"},"1866":{"id":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-35","page_id":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#按错误类型处理","content":"优先处理","locale":"zh-CN"},"1867":{"id":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-36","page_id":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#按错误类型处理","content":"安装选项加载失败","locale":"zh-CN"},"1868":{"id":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-37","page_id":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#按错误类型处理","content":"点击“重新加载选项”，再检查应用运行环境和管理服务","locale":"zh-CN"},"1869":{"id":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-38","page_id":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#按错误类型处理","content":"根目录危险、重叠或经过符号链接","locale":"zh-CN"},"1870":{"id":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-39","page_id":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#按错误类型处理","content":"选择新的专用实例根目录，并保留默认 Python/Core 子目录","locale":"zh-CN"},"1871":{"id":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-40","page_id":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#按错误类型处理","content":"Python 下载、解压或校验失败","locale":"zh-CN"},"1872":{"id":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-41","page_id":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#按错误类型处理","content":"检查网络、代理、镜像、磁盘空间和“设置 → 运行环境”","locale":"zh-CN"},"1873":{"id":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-42","page_id":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#按错误类型处理","content":"Git 或 Core 下载失败","locale":"zh-CN"},"1874":{"id":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-43","page_id":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#按错误类型处理","content":"检查 Git 状态、GitHub 镜像、目录权限和目标目录是否含冲突文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"1875":{"id":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-44","page_id":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#按错误类型处理"