,"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-new-installation","content":"全新安装会创建实例记录，准备独立 Python，并在 Core 目录中安装所选 WebUI。第一次使用时建议保留全部默认选项。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1955":{"id":"/docs/webui-new-installation-12","page_id":"/docs/webui-new-installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-new-installation#打开添加实例页面","content":"在首页点击“添加实例”，确认页面顶部的实例来源选择为“全新安装”。点击“返回主页”或“取消”可以退出，不会创建任何文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1956":{"id":"/docs/webui-new-installation-13","page_id":"/docs/webui-new-installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-new-installation#选择-webui-类型","content":"从左侧选择 Stable Diffusion WebUI、ComfyUI、InvokeAI、Fooocus、SD Trainer 或 Qwen TTS WebUI。右侧预览只用于帮助识别产品；真正的安装和管理规则由所选类型决定。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1957":{"id":"/docs/webui-new-installation-14","page_id":"/docs/webui-new-installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-new-installation#进入配置","content":"点击“下一步”。应用会同时加载当前可用的分支和 PyTorch 选项；加载失败时可使用“重新加载选项”，不需要重新选择 WebUI。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1958":{"id":"/docs/webui-new-installation-15","page_id":"/docs/webui-new-installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-new-installation#设置实例名称","content":"“实例名称”用于首页和实例管理中的显示，可以留空。留空时，应用会根据 WebUI 产品名生成带随机后缀的名称。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1959":{"id":"/docs/webui-new-installation-16","page_id":"/docs/webui-new-installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-new-installation#确认安装根目录","content":"推荐将“安装根目录”留空。应用会使用设置页显示的全局默认目录，并在其下创建以实例 ID 命名的专用目录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1960":{"id":"/docs/webui-new-installation-17","page_id":"/docs/webui-new-installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-new-installation#确认安装根目录","content":"如果手动选择目录，该目录本身就是最终实例根目录，不会再自动创建一层子目录。请使用新的专用目录，不要选择磁盘根目录、用户主目录或包含重要文件的现有目录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1961":{"id":"/docs/webui-new-installation-18","page_id":"/docs/webui-new-installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-new-installation#选择分支","content":"只有支持分支预设的 WebUI 才显示“分支”。普通用户选择“默认分支”；只有明确需要测试版或特定变体时才切换。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1962":{"id":"/docs/webui-new-installation-19","page_id":"/docs/webui-new-installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-new-installation#检查高级选项","content":"展开“高级选项”可以修改 Python/Core 子目录、Python 版本、PyTorch 构建以及预下载设置。默认值已经构成可用安装方案；不了解某一项时不要修改。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1963":{"id":"/docs/webui-new-installation-20","page_id":"/docs/webui-new-installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-new-installation#检查高级选项","content":"Python 必须位于实例根目录内部。新建 Core 目录也应位于实例根目录内；如果明确选择了一个经验证的现有外部 Core，安装器可以继续复用并更新它，但不能强制重建该外部目录。不确定现有 Core 在哪里时应使用扫描系统。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1964":{"id":"/docs/webui-new-installation-21","page_id":"/docs/webui-new-installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-new-installation#创建并安装","content":"点击“创建并安装”。应用先保存实例记录，再进入该实例的安装工作区，依次准备 Python 和 WebUI Core。不要在安装期间手动移动或删除目录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1965":{"id":"/docs/webui-new-installation-22","page_id":"/docs/webui-new-installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-new-installation#等待自动启动","content":"安装完成后，工作区会继续准备管理服务并自动启动 WebUI。启动地址捕获成功后即可使用；如果启动需要选择 PyTorch 或处理依赖冲突，工作区会显示对应决定项。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1966":{"id":"/docs/webui-new-installation-23","page_id":"/docs/webui-new-installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-new-installation#默认目录结构","content":"模型、扩展和输出目录由不同 WebUI 自己决定，因此不一定都位于相同位置。需要修改高级设置时，先阅读安装选项详解。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1967":{"id":"/docs/webui-new-installation-24","page_id":"/docs/webui-new-installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-new-installation#默认目录结构","content":"极少数情况下，实例记录已经创建，但安装任务未能启动。此时实例不会丢失：重新打开它，在工作区点击“开始安装”即可继续。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1968":{"id":"/docs/webui-new-installation-25","page_id":"/docs/webui-new-installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-new-installation#默认目录结构","content":"安装失败或进度长时间没有变化时，参阅安装进度与故障处理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1969":{"id":"/docs/webui-scan-system","page_id":"/docs/webui-scan-system","type":"page","content":"扫描现有 WebUI","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","WebUI 安装"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/webui-scan-system","locale":"zh-CN"},"1970":{"id":"/docs/webui-scan-system-0","page_id":"/docs/webui-scan-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-scan-system","content":"扫描本机或指定文件夹，自动识别并挂载已有 WebUI。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1971":{"id":"/docs/webui-scan-system-1","page_id":"/docs/webui-scan-system","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/webui-scan-system#两种扫描范围","content":"两种扫描范围","locale":"zh-CN"},"1972":{"id":"/docs/webui-scan-system-2","page_id":"/docs/webui-scan-system","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/webui-scan-system#扫描步骤","content":"扫描步骤","locale":"zh-CN"},"1973":{"id":"/docs/webui-scan-system-3","page_id":"/docs/webui-scan-system","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/webui-scan-system#选择扫描系统","content":"选择扫描系统","locale":"zh-CN"},"1974":{"id":"/docs/webui-scan-system-4","page_id":"/docs/webui-scan-system","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/webui-scan-system#阅读并确认扫描范围","content":"阅读并确认扫描范围","locale":"zh-CN"},"1975":{"id":"/docs/webui-scan-system-5","page_id":"/docs/webui-scan-system","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/webui-scan-system#返回首页等待","content":"返回首页等待","locale":"zh-CN"},"1976":{"id":"/docs/webui-scan-system-6","page_id":"/docs/webui-scan-system","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/webui-scan-system#查看完成汇总","content":"查看完成汇总","locale":"zh-CN"},"1977":{"id":"/docs/webui-scan-system-7","page_id":"/docs/webui-scan-system","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/webui-scan-system#处理待安装实例","content":"处理待安装实例","locale":"zh-CN"},"1978":{"id":"/docs/webui-scan-system-8","page_id":"/docs/webui-scan-system","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/webui-scan-system#汇总结果是什么意思","content":"汇总结果是什么意思","locale":"zh-CN"},"1979":{"id":"/docs/webui-scan-system-9","page_id":"/docs/webui-scan-system","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/webui-scan-system#为什么没有识别到","content":"为什么没有识别到","locale":"zh-CN"},"1980":{"id":"/docs/webui-scan-system-10","page_id":"/docs/webui-scan-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-scan-system","content":"扫描适合不知道实例路径，或者只有 WebUI Core、缺少可用独立 Python 的情况。扫描会根据目录中的标志文件识别 WebUI 类型，不需要预先选择类型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1981":{"id":"/docs/webui-scan-system-11","page_id":"/docs/webui-scan-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-scan-system#两种扫描范围","content":"在“添加实例”页面选择“扫描系统”。Windows 会扫描本机固定磁盘；Linux 和 macOS\n从系统根目录开始扫描当前文件系统。完整扫描可能读取大量目录并持续数分钟。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1982":{"id":"/docs/webui-scan-system-12","page_id":"/docs/webui-scan-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-scan-system#两种扫描范围","content":"将一个文件夹从文件管理器拖到 Hanafubuki 首页，只扫描该目录。WebUI\n位于外部磁盘、挂载目录或已知的大致位置时，这种方式更快，也更容易绕开全盘扫描范围限制。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1983":{"id":"/docs/webui-scan-system-13","page_id":"/docs/webui-scan-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-scan-system#选择扫描系统","content":"在首页点击“添加实例”，切换到“扫描系统”。这一模式没有 WebUI 类型列表和第二步配置表单。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1984":{"id":"/docs/webui-scan-system-14","page_id":"/docs/webui-scan-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-scan-system#阅读并确认扫描范围","content":"点击“扫描本机”后会出现确认窗口，说明预计耗时、自动添加行为和后台运行方式。确认后才开始全盘扫描。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1985":{"id":"/docs/webui-scan-system-15","page_id":"/docs/webui-scan-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-scan-system#返回首页等待","content":"页面会返回首页，扫描在后台继续。底部状态报告先显示已经读取的目录和发现数量，进入挂载阶段后显示已处理数量。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1986":{"id":"/docs/webui-scan-system-16","page_id":"/docs/webui-scan-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-scan-system#查看完成汇总","content":"完成报告会分别显示已添加、待安装、已存在和已跳过数量。扫描不会逐个弹出候选确认；符合条件的项目会自动出现在首页。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1987":{"id":"/docs/webui-scan-system-17","page_id":"/docs/webui-scan-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-scan-system#处理待安装实例","content":"仅发现 Core 而没有可用 Python 时，实例会显示“未安装”。打开该实例并点击“开始安装”，应用会在新的受管实例根目录中准备 Python，同时继续使用发现的外部 Core。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1988":{"id":"/docs/webui-scan-system-18","page_id":"/docs/webui-scan-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-scan-system#处理待安装实例","content":"扫描和挂载只读取现有文件并写入实例记录；对“待安装”实例执行安装时，完整安装器会以发现的 Core\n为目标，可能下载、更新或调整其中的文件。先备份自定义代码。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1989":{"id":"/docs/webui-scan-system-19"