被读取并保存为当前实例的受管恢复数据。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2047":{"id":"/docs/webui-snapshot-recovery-34","page_id":"/docs/webui-snapshot-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-snapshot-recovery#恢复并安装","content":"点击“恢复并安装”。应用会按快照记录的 Python 版本准备运行时，然后恢复 WebUI Core、软件包和扩展。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2048":{"id":"/docs/webui-snapshot-recovery-35","page_id":"/docs/webui-snapshot-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-snapshot-recovery#验证并补回用户数据","content":"完成后检查版本、扩展和组件路径，再确认 WebUI 能够启动。最后单独复制或重新配置未包含在快照中的模型、输出、工作流和自定义文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2049":{"id":"/docs/webui-snapshot-recovery-36","page_id":"/docs/webui-snapshot-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-snapshot-recovery#验证并补回用户数据","content":"恢复会清理快照中不存在的软件包和扩展，并强制重置目标 WebUI 与扩展 Git\n仓库。目标目录中的未提交代码修改可能丢失，因此应优先使用空目录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2050":{"id":"/docs/webui-snapshot-recovery-37","page_id":"/docs/webui-snapshot-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-snapshot-recovery#快照包含与不包含的内容","content":"通常记录","locale":"zh-CN"},"2051":{"id":"/docs/webui-snapshot-recovery-38","page_id":"/docs/webui-snapshot-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-snapshot-recovery#快照包含与不包含的内容","content":"不会作为完整文件副本保存","locale":"zh-CN"},"2052":{"id":"/docs/webui-snapshot-recovery-39","page_id":"/docs/webui-snapshot-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-snapshot-recovery#快照包含与不包含的内容","content":"Python 版本和软件包","locale":"zh-CN"},"2053":{"id":"/docs/webui-snapshot-recovery-40","page_id":"/docs/webui-snapshot-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-snapshot-recovery#快照包含与不包含的内容","content":"Python 安装目录本身","locale":"zh-CN"},"2054":{"id":"/docs/webui-snapshot-recovery-41","page_id":"/docs/webui-snapshot-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-snapshot-recovery#快照包含与不包含的内容","content":"WebUI 类型与 Core 提交","locale":"zh-CN"},"2055":{"id":"/docs/webui-snapshot-recovery-42","page_id":"/docs/webui-snapshot-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-snapshot-recovery#快照包