nd export application diagnostic bundles.\" />","locale":"en"},"3486":{"id":"/en/docs/settings-29","page_id":"/en/docs/settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/settings#finding-settings-by-section","content":"<Card title=\"About and Updates\" href=\"/docs/settings-about-updates\" description=\"View the version and check for application updates.\" />","locale":"en"},"3487":{"id":"/en/docs/settings-30","page_id":"/en/docs/settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/settings#finding-settings-by-section","content":"When unsure whether a setting needs to change, keep the default. During troubleshooting, change only one relevant setting at a time and decide whether to retain it after retrying.","locale":"en"},"3488":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","type":"page","content":"Application and Runtime Environment","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki Documentation","Troubleshooting"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","locale":"en"},"3489":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-0","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","content":"Troubleshoot Hanafubuki startup, application Python, Micromamba, Git, and update issues.","locale":"en"},"3490":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-1","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#determine-whether-the-issue-is-at-the-application-level","content":"Determine whether the issue is at the application level","locale":"en"},"3491":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-2","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#runtime-preparation-failure","content":"Runtime preparation failure","locale":"en"},"3492":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-3","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","type":"heading