age_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#determine-whether-the-issue-is-at-the-application-level","content":"Symptoms that usually indicate an application-level issue:","locale":"en"},"3500":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-11","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#determine-whether-the-issue-is-at-the-application-level","content":"The application remains stuck at runtime preparation after opening.","locale":"en"},"3501":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-12","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#determine-whether-the-issue-is-at-the-application-level","content":"Home reports that application Python, Micromamba, or Git preparation failed.","locale":"en"},"3502":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-13","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#determine-whether-the-issue-is-at-the-application-level","content":"Installation and management features are unavailable for every instance at the same time.","locale":"en"},"3503":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-14","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#determine-whether-the-issue-is-at-the-application-level","content":"Settings or the instance list cannot be read before any specific WebUI task has started.","locale":"en"},"3504":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-15","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#determine-whether-the-issue-is-at-the-application-level","content":"Downloading or installing an application update, or restarting afterward, fails.","locale":"en"},"3505":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-16","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#determine-whether-the-issue-is-at-the-application-level","content":"If only one instance reports `ModuleNotFoundError`, CUDA, or extension errors when it starts, investigate the instance environment rather than application Python.","locale":"en"},"3506":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-17","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#runtime-preparation-failure","content":"Open **Settings → Runtime**, then record the failed component, preparation stage, and complete\nerror.","locale":"en"},"3507":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-18","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#runtime-preparation-failure","content":"Confirm that there is enough disk space, the managed runtime directory is writable, and no other\nHanafubuki process is using it.","locale":"en"},"3508":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-19","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#runtime-preparation-failure","content":"If a download or verification fails, check the network, proxy, mirrors, and system time.","locale":"en"},"3509":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-20","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#runtime-preparation-failure","content":"If Micromamba is not ready, resolve that first. Git waiting for Micromamba does not mean Git\nitself is damaged.","locale":"en"},"3510":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-21","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#runtime-preparation-failure","content":"When the page offers a retry, retry only the failed component and wait until it becomes ready or\nreports a definite failure.","locale":"en"},"3511":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-22","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#runtime-preparation-failure","content":"Do not copy Python, Micromamba, Conda, or Launcher Code from another installation package over the managed directories. The application verifies its own component set, and manual replacement can cause additional integrity errors.","locale":"en"},"3512":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-23","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#no-change-after-switching-application-python-or-git","content":"The application Python version and Git source take effect on the next launch:","locale":"en"},"3513":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-24","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#no-change-after-switching-application-python-or-git","content":"Wait for any running installation, management, and Agent tasks to finish.","locale":"en"},"3514":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-25","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#no-change-after-switching-application-python-or-git","content":"Save the new version or source.","locale":"en"},"3515":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-26","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#no-change-after-switching-application-python-or-git","content":"Close all Hanafubuki windows normally.","locale":"en"},"3516":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-27","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#no-change-after-switching-application-python-or-git","content":"Restart the application, return to the runtime page, and verify the actual path and version.","locale":"en"},"3517":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-28","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#no-change-after-switching-application-python-or-git","content":"Changing these settings neither reinstalls an instance's Python nor repairs dependencies for a WebUI extension.","locale":"en"},"3518":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-29","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#windows-smartscreen-blocks-the-app","content":"The current Windows installer and portable package are unsigned. If the first launch of the installer, standalone build, or Launcher displays **Windows protected your PC** and says that Microsoft Defender SmartScreen prevented an unrecognized app from starting, confirm that the file came from this site, select **More info**, and then select **Run anyway**.","locale":"en"},"3519":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-30","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#windows-smartscreen-blocks-the-app","content":"The **Run anyway** button appears only after you expand **More info**. Do this only for a file downloaded from this site whose name and platform you have verified. Delete files from third-party reposts or unknown sources and download them again.","locale":"en"},"3520":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-31","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#macos-says-the-app-is-damaged","content":"The current macOS installer and portable package are unsigned. If the first launch says `“Hanafubuki” is damaged and can't be opened` or `“Hanafubuki Launcher” is damaged and can't be opened`, do not move it to the Trash. After confirming that the file came from this site, follow the macOS steps in Install Hanafubuki to run `xattr -dr com.apple.quarantine` on the corresponding `.app`, then open it again.","locale":"en"},"3521":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-32","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#macos-says-the-app-is-damaged","content":"Remove quarantine only from an app downloaded from this site whose name and platform you have verified. Delete files from third-party reposts or unknown sources and download them again.","locale":"en"},"3522":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-33","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#application-interface-or-window-issues","content":"If the application is still operable, first record which page has the problem and restart normally. If the issue occurs only in the embedded WebUI, try opening the captured address in an external browser from **Instance information**. This distinguishes a WebUI page issue from an application-window rendering issue.","locale":"en"},"3523":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-34","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#application-interface-or-window-issues","content":"If the window does not open, remains blank, or the application exits immediately:","locale":"en"},"3524":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-35","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#application-interface-or-window-issues","content":"Record the operating system, Hanafubuki version, and time of the incident.","locale":"en"},"3525":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-36","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#application-interface-or-window-issues","content":"Check the application logs and operating-system crash records.","locale":"en"},"3526":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-37","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#application-interface-or-window-issues","content":"Do not delete the application data directory first. It contains instance records, settings, and diagnostic material.","locale":"en"},"3527":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-38","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#application-interface-or-window-issues","content":"Use an application diagnostic bundle to report the issue to Hanafubuki maintainers, not to a WebUI extension author.","locale":"en"},"3528":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-39","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#update-failure","content":"Stage","locale":"en"},"3529":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-40","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#update-failure","content":"Check first","locale":"en"},"3530":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-41","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#update-failure","content":"Cannot check for updates","locale":"en"},"3531":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-42","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#update-failure","content":"Network, proxy, system time, and update-source reachability","locale":"en"},"3532":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-43","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#update-failure","content":"Download fails","locale":"en"},"3533":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-44","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#update-failure","content":"Task output, disk space, temporary directory, and security software","locale":"en"},"3534":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-45","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#update-failure","content":"Installer will not open","locale":"en"},"3535":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-46","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#update-failure","content":"Correct platform and architecture, file integrity, and system security prompts","locale":"en"},"3536":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-47","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#update-failure","content":"Still on the old version after restart","locale":"en"},"3537":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-48","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#update-failure","content":"Whether installation actually completed and whether an old copy from another location was launched","locale":"en"},"3538":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-49","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#update-failure","content":"Do not address an update failure by deleting instance directories. The application installation location and instance roots are separate scopes.","locale":"en"},"3539":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-50","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#if-recovery-still-fails","content":"Generate an application diagnostic bundle and include the startup failure stage, a screenshot of the runtime page, application logs, and recent changes. If the application cannot open the settings page at all, preserve the existing application data and avoid cleanup beyond reinstalling over the application until the maintainers confirm which files they need.","locale":"en"},"3540":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-51","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#if-recovery-still-fails","content":"<Card title=\"Runtime settings\" href=\"/docs/settings-runtime\" description=\"View the exact status of application Python, Micromamba, and Git.\" />","locale":"en"},"3541":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-52","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#if-recovery-still-fails","content":"<Card title=\"Application logs\" href=\"/docs/settings-logs\" description=\"Configure log level and persistence.\" />","locale":"en"},"3542":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-53","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#if-recovery-still-fails","content":"<Card title=\"Application diagnostics\" href=\"/docs/settings-diagnostics\" description=\"Collect an application-level diagnostic bundle.\" />","locale":"en"},"3543":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-54","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#if-recovery-still-fails","content":"<Card title=\"About and updates\" href=\"/docs/settings-about-updates\" description=\"Check the version and application updates.\" />","locale":"en"},"3544":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","type":"page","content":"Installation and Network","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki Documentation","Troubleshooting"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","locale":"en"},"3545":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-0","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","content":"Troubleshoot WebUI installation, downloads, proxies, mirrors, disk, and path issues.","locale":"en"},"3546":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-1","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#locate-the-failing-stage-first","content":"Locate the failing stage first","locale":"en"},"3547":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-2","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#network-proxy-and-mirrors","content":"Network, proxy, and mirrors","locale":"en"},"3548":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-3","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#paths-permissions-and-disk-space","content":"Paths, permissions, and disk space","locale":"en"},"3549":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-4","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#dependency-and-pytorch-installation-failures","content":"Dependency and PyTorch installation failures","locale":"en"},"3550":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-5","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#cancel-clean-up-and-retry","content":"Cancel, clean up, and retry","locale":"en"},"3551":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-6","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","content":"Installation prepares the instance Python, Core, dependencies, and optional resources in sequence. The progress percentage is based on stages, not downloaded bytes. If a stage takes a long time, first check whether the log is still producing output.","locale":"en"},"3552":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-7","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#locate-the-failing-stage-first","content":"Expand the log in the installation workspace and record the current stage and the last normal\noutput.","locale":"en"},"3553":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-8","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#locate-the-failing-stage-first","content":"Start reading at the first `error`, exception, or non-zero exit instead of looking only at the\nfinal **Installation failed** message.","locale":"en"},"3554":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-9","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#locate-the-failing-stage-first","content":"Open the same installation activity in Task Center and copy the retained output. If you see a\ntruncation marker, save the evidence promptly.","locale":"en"},"3555":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-10","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#locate-the-failing-stage-first","content":"Change only one relevant setting for the error category below, then retry the same installation\noperation.","locale":"en"},"3556":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-11","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#network-proxy-and-mirrors","content":"Symptom","locale":"en"},"3557":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-12","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#network-proxy-and-mirrors","content":"Check first","locale":"en"},"3558":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-13","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#network-proxy-and-mirrors","content":"Connection timeout, reset, or DNS failure","locale":"en"},"3559":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-14","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#network-proxy-and-mirrors","content":"Current network, proxy mode, proxy port, and firewall","locale":"en"},"3560":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-15","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#network-proxy-and-mirrors","content":"SSL or certificate error","locale":"en"},"3561":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-16","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#network-proxy-and-mirrors","content":"System time, HTTPS inspection software, proxy method, and target certificate","locale":"en"},"3562":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-17","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#network-proxy-and-mirrors","content":"Only GitHub, Hugging Face, or PyPI fails","locale":"en"},"3563":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-18","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#network-proxy-and-mirrors","content":"Availability of the corresponding mirror or target site","locale":"en"},"3564":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-19","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#network-proxy-and-mirrors","content":"File checksum or size mismatch","locale":"en"},"3565":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-20","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#network-proxy-and-mirrors","content":"Mirror cache or interrupted download; switch back to the official source and download again","locale":"en"},"3566":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-21","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#network-proxy-and-mirrors","content":"HTTP 401 or 403","locale":"en"},"3567":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-22","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#network-proxy-and-mirrors","content":"Whether the address requires authentication, token permissions, rate limits, or regional policies","locale":"en"},"3568":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-23","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#network-proxy-and-mirrors","content":"A proxy determines *how to connect*; a mirror determines *which source to connect to*. First compare proxy and direct connections, then adjust the relevant mirror. Changing several settings at once makes the result impossible to interpret.","locale":"en"},"3569":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-24","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#network-proxy-and-mirrors","content":"Installation child processes that have already started retain their old environment after proxy settings change. Let the old task reach a failed, canceled, or completed terminal state before creating another task.","locale":"en"},"3570":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-25","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#paths-permissions-and-disk-space","content":"Use a separate, writable instance root that does not overlap another instance.","locale":"en"},"3571":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-26","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#paths-permissions-and-disk-space","content":"If the path does not exist, overlaps a dangerous location, passes through a symbolic link, or contains conflicting files, choose a new directory as instructed by the interface.","locale":"en"},"3572":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-27","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#paths-permissions-and-disk-space","content":"Check both the system drive and the drive containing the instance. Python package installation and extraction may also use temporary space.","locale":"en"},"3573":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-28","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#paths-permissions-and-disk-space","content":"For access-denied errors, check whether the file is in use by WebUI, a terminal, an editor, security software, or another application process.","locale":"en"},"3574":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-29","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#paths-permissions-and-disk-space","content":"Do not disable integrity checks or manually merge files from unknown sources merely to pass validation.","locale":"en"},"3575":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-30","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#dependency-and-pytorch-installation-failures","content":"`No module named`, compilation failures, and package version conflicts usually originate in the instance environment:","locale":"en"},"3576":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-31","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#dependency-and-pytorch-installation-failures","content":"Record the exact package name, required version, and earliest installation error.","locale":"en"},"3577":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-32","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#dependency-and-pytorch-installation-failures","content":"Confirm that the installation options match the current WebUI type and operating system.","locale":"en"},"3578":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-33","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#dependency-and-pytorch-installation-failures","content":"If PyTorch installation fails, restore **Automatic** or the type's default option and verify the GPU driver.","locale":"en"},"3579":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-34","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#dependency-and-pytorch-installation-failures","content":"If an extension dependency fails, first confirm that it belongs to an optional extension; do not immediately rebuild the entire Core.","locale":"en"},"3580":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-35","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#dependency-and-pytorch-installation-failures","content":"If manual intervention is truly necessary, use the instance terminal and create a snapshot first.","locale":"en"},"3581":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-36","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#cancel-clean-up-and-retry","content":"Cancellation is only a request. After selecting cancel, wait until the task reaches **Canceled** or a definite failure. Run cleanup only when the interface offers **Retry process cleanup**. Once cleanup completes, select **Retry installation**; do not create another instance at the same path at the same time.","locale":"en"},"3582":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-37","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#cancel-clean-up-and-retry","content":"If the instance record was saved but the task did not start, reopen that instance and select **Start installation**. You do not need to delete the record or recreate an instance with the same name.","locale":"en"},"3583":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-38","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#cancel-clean-up-and-retry","content":"After installation completes and a WebUI address is available, model, extension, node, and\ngeneration errors belong under Upstream WebUI issues, not in\nrepeated application-runtime reinstalls.","locale":"en"},"3584":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-39","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#cancel-clean-up-and-retry","content":"<Card title=\"Installation progress and troubleshooting\" href=\"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting\" description=\"Understand installation stages, logs, and retry actions.\" />","locale":"en"},"3585":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-40","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#cancel-clean-up-and-retry","content":"<Card title=\"Network and proxy\" href=\"/docs/settings-network\" description=\"Test system proxy, manual proxy, and direct connection modes.\" />","locale":"en"},"3586":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-41","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#cancel-clean-up-and-retry","content":"<Card title=\"Mirrors\" href=\"/docs/settings-mirrors\" description=\"Check package, source-code, and model origins.\" />","locale":"en"},"3587":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-42","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#cancel-clean-up-and-retry","content":"<Card title=\"Paths and storage\" href=\"/docs/settings-paths\" description=\"Check caches, installation directories, and managed storage.\" />","locale":"en"},"3588":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","type":"page","content":"Instance Startup and Access","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki Documentation","Troubleshooting"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","locale":"en"},"3589":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-0","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","content":"Troubleshoot WebUI process exits, launch arguments, ports, addresses, and page access.","locale":"en"},"3590":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-1","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#read-the-startup-status","content":"Read the startup status","locale":"en"},"3591":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-2","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#exits-immediately-after-startup","content":"Exits immediately after startup","locale":"en"},"3592":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-3","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#launch-arguments-and-environment-variables","content":"Launch arguments and environment variables","locale":"en"},"3593":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-4","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#ports-and-addresses","content":"Ports and addresses","locale":"en"},"3594":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-5","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#an-address-exists-but-the-page-will-not-open","content":"An address exists, but the page will not open","locale":"en"},"3595":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-6","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#management-features-are-temporarily-unavailable","content":"Management features are temporarily unavailable","locale":"en"},"3596":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-7","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","content":"Startup issues span three distinct stages: whether the process was created, whether WebUI finished initializing, and whether the application captured a reachable address. Seeing **Starting** does not mean WebUI is ready.","locale":"en"},"3597":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-8","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#read-the-startup-status","content":"Open the instance workspace to view the startup takeover page, or check the live startup stage, warnings, captured address, and recent failures under **Instance information**.","locale":"en"},"3598":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-9","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#read-the-startup-status","content":"Symptom","locale":"en"},"3599":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-10","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#read-the-startup-status","content":"Meaning","locale":"en"},"3600":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-11","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#read-the-startup-status","content":"Startup task fails immediately","locale":"en"},"3601":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-12","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#read-the-startup-status","content":"Argument validation, Python, Core, dependencies, or process creation failed","locale":"en"},"3602":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-13","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#read-the-startup-status","content":"Logs continue but no address appears","locale":"en"},"3603":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-14","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#read-the-startup-status","content":"WebUI is still loading models or extensions, or it has not printed a recognizable listening address","locale":"en"},"3604":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-15","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#read-the-startup-status","content":"Process exits with a Python traceback","locale":"en"},"3605":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-16","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#read-the-startup-status","content":"Core, an extension, a dependency, or PyTorch failed during initialization","locale":"en"},"3606":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-17","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#read-the-startup-status","content":"An address was captured but the embedded page will not open","locale":"en"},"3607":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-18","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#read-the-startup-status","content":"Listening address, browser rendering, proxy, or WebView issue","locale":"en"},"3608":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-19","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#read-the-startup-status","content":"The page opens in an external browser","locale":"en"},"3609":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-20","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#read-the-startup-status","content":"WebUI itself is running; investigate embedded rendering rather than reinstalling the instance","locale":"en"},"3610":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-21","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#exits-immediately-after-startup","content":"Expand the startup log and find the first complete exception before the process exited.","locale":"en"},"3611":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-22","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#exits-immediately-after-startup","content":"Determine whether the traceback path belongs to WebUI Core, an extension, or a Python package.","locale":"en"},"3612":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-23","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#exits-immediately-after-startup","content":"Review recent changes to launch arguments, environment variables, Core version, extensions, and\nPyTorch.","locale":"en"},"3613":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-24","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#exits-immediately-after-startup","content":"If it still fails, collect an instance diagnostic bundle and retain the failed startup activity.","locale":"en"},"3614":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-25","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#exits-immediately-after-startup","content":"If the log clearly points to an extension, disable, update, or roll back that extension first. If Core and the extension interface are incompatible, check both versions together. Do not uninstall every Python package first; doing so destroys the environment needed for further diagnosis.","locale":"en"},"3615":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-26","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#launch-arguments-and-environment-variables","content":"Check the **Launch** page for raw-argument parsing errors, unknown arguments, and mutually exclusive options.","locale":"en"},"3616":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-27","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#launch-arguments-and-environment-variables","content":"Raw arguments contain only values passed to WebUI; do not include Python or the startup script.","locale":"en"},"3617":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-28","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#launch-arguments-and-environment-variables","content":"**Ignore this time** is suitable only for confirming that the current branch still accepts an argument. Do not use it to bypass the same warning indefinitely.","locale":"en"},"3618":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-29","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#launch-arguments-and-environment-variables","content":"Restart WebUI after changing arguments or environment variables. Refreshing the page does not change a running process.","locale":"en"},"3619":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-30","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#launch-arguments-and-environment-variables","content":"Do not use a custom `PATH`, `PYTHONPATH`, `MAMBA_*`, or `CONDA_*` value to override the managed environment.","locale":"en"},"3620":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-31","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#ports-and-addresses","content":"For a port conflict or connection failure:","locale":"en"},"3621":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-32","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#ports-and-addresses","content":"Confirm the actual listening address and port in the startup log; do not assume it is `7860`.","locale":"en"},"3622":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-33","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#ports-and-addresses","content":"Use Task Center and system tools to determine whether an old WebUI or another service occupies the port.","locale":"en"},"3623":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-34","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#ports-and-addresses","content":"If the old task belongs to Hanafubuki, finish stopping and cleaning up that task before restarting; do not kill the process directly and immediately restart it.","locale":"en"},"3624":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-35","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#ports-and-addresses","content":"To change the port, use the port option supported by the current WebUI in the instance launch arguments.","locale":"en"},"3625":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-36","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#ports-and-addresses","content":"After restarting, confirm that the log, captured address, and browser port agree.","locale":"en"},"3626":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-37","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#ports-and-addresses","content":"Listening on `127.0.0.1` normally permits access only from the local machine. Listening on every network interface or enabling remote connections expands the security boundary. Do not enable remote access unconditionally merely to troubleshoot a local page.","locale":"en"},"3627":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-38","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#an-address-exists-but-the-page-will-not-open","content":"Check these points in order:","locale":"en"},"3628":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-39","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#an-address-exists-but-the-page-will-not-open","content":"The WebUI process is still running and did not exit immediately after startup.","locale":"en"},"3629":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-40","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#an-address-exists-but-the-page-will-not-open","content":"The protocol, host, and port in the address match the log.","locale":"en"},"3630":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-41","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#an-address-exists-but-the-page-will-not-open","content":"Open the captured address in the system browser to distinguish the WebUI service from the embedded WebView.","locale":"en"},"3631":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-42","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#an-address-exists-but-the-page-will-not-open","content":"Browser proxy settings, translation extensions, cache, or security software are not modifying local page requests.","locale":"en"},"3632":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-43","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#an-address-exists-but-the-page-will-not-open","content":"WebUI is not configured for authentication, a subpath, or access from specific hosts only.","locale":"en"},"3633":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-44","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#an-address-exists-but-the-page-will-not-open","content":"If the page opens but generation, model, or node operations fail, startup succeeded. Continue with Upstream WebUI issues.","locale":"en"},"3634":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-45","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#management-features-are-temporarily-unavailable","content":"Instance management may be temporarily unavailable while WebUI is not ready, the management API is recovering, a maintenance operation holds the instance, or an old task has not been cleaned up. Check the management API and runtime state under **Instance information**, then wait for recovery or use the retry offered by the interface. The maintenance page remains available for inspecting and recovering instance lifecycle operations.","locale":"en"},"3635":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-46","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#management-features-are-temporarily-unavailable","content":"<Card title=\"Launch configuration\" href=\"/docs/instance-launch\" description=\"Check arguments, environment variables, and pre-launch validation.\" />","locale":"en"},"3636":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-47","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#management-features-are-temporarily-unavailable","content":"<Card title=\"PyTorch\" href=\"/docs/instance-pytorch\" description=\"Check the GPU platform and instance PyTorch.\" />","locale":"en"},"3637":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-48","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#management-features-are-temporarily-unavailable","content":"<Card title=\"Extensions\" href=\"/docs/instance-extensions\" description=\"Update, disable, or roll back a problematic extension.\" />","locale":"en"},"3638":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-49","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#management-features-are-temporarily-unavailable","content":"<Card title=\"Instance information\" href=\"/docs/instance-overview\" description=\"View live services, addresses, and failure history.\" />","locale":"en"},"3639":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting","type":"page","content":"Logs, Diagnostics, and Getting Help","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki Documentation","Troubleshooting"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting","locale":"en"},"3640":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting-0","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting","content":"Preserve complete errors, generate diagnostic bundles, and submit reproducible issue reports.","locale":"en"},"3641":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting-1","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting#preserve-the-original-information-first","content":"Preserve the original information first","locale":"en"},"3642":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting-2","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting#read-a-python-traceback","content":"Read a Python traceback","locale":"en"},"3643":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting-3","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting#choose-a-diagnostic-bundle","content":"Choose a diagnostic bundle","locale":"en"},"3644":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting-4","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting#help-request-template","content":"Help request template","locale":"en"},"3645":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting-5","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting#choose-the-right-support-channel","content":"Choose the right support channel","locale":"en"},"3646":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting-6","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting","content":"A high-quality issue report should let someone who cannot see your screen reconstruct what happened. A single sentence such as “It won't start” or a screenshot of only the final dialog is rarely enough to determine whether the issue comes from the application, an instance, or WebUI.","locale":"en"},"3647":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting-7","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting#preserve-the-original-information-first","content":"Collect the following as soon as the issue occurs:","locale":"en"},"3648":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting-8","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting#preserve-the-original-information-first","content":"The date and time of the operation.","locale":"en"},"3649":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting-9","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting#preserve-the-original-information-first","content":"Hanafubuki version, operating system, and hardware platform.","locale":"en"},"3650":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting-10","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting#preserve-the-original-information-first","content":"WebUI type, Core version, and instance name.","locale":"en"},"3651":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting-11","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting#preserve-the-original-information-first","content":"Versions, extensions, models, arguments, or environment variables changed before reproduction.","locale":"en"},"3652":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting-12","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting#preserve-the-original-information-first","content":"The failure state on the current page and complete activity output in Task Center.","locale":"en"},"3653":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting-13","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting#preserve-the-original-information-first","content":"The Python traceback, command exit code, and logs immediately before and after the error.","locale":"en"},"3654":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting-14","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting#preserve-the-original-information-first","content":"Long-retained task output may be truncated or evicted. When you see a truncation marker, copy the current log or generate a diagnostic bundle. Do not assume the same content will remain available later.","locale":"en"},"3655":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting-15","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting#read-a-python-traceback","content":"Follow the call path and determine whether each file belongs to Core, an extension, a custom\nnode, or a Python package.","locale":"en"},"3656":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting-16","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting#read-a-python-traceback","content":"Record the final exception type and description, such as `ImportError` or `RuntimeError`.","locale":"en"},"3657":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting-17","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting#read-a-python-traceback","content":"When searching, combine the exception description, WebUI name, extension name, and version.\nPreserve the complete traceback when asking for help.","locale":"en"},"3658":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting-18","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting#read-a-python-traceback","content":"The first red line is not necessarily the root cause. Startup may log warnings before the exception that actually terminates the process. Conversely, one extension may fail while WebUI still starts successfully.","locale":"en"},"3659":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting-19","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting#choose-a-diagnostic-bundle","content":"Type","locale":"en"},"3660":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting-20","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting#choose-a-diagnostic-bundle","content":"Use when","locale":"en"},"3661":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting-21","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting#choose-a-diagnostic-bundle","content":"Location","locale":"en"},"3662":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting-22","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting#choose-a-diagnostic-bundle","content":"Instance diagnostics","locale":"en"},"3663":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting-23","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting#choose-a-diagnostic-bundle","content":"One instance has installation, startup, extension, hotpatch, or environment problems","locale":"en"},"3664":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting-24","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting#choose-a-diagnostic-bundle","content":"**Instance Management → Maintenance → Diagnostics**","locale":"en"},"3665":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting-25","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting#choose-a-diagnostic-bundle","content":"Application diagnostics","locale":"en"},"3666":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting-26","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting#choose-a-diagnostic-bundle","content":"The application runtime, settings, platform, global tasks, or several instances fail together","locale":"en"},"3667":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting-27","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting#choose-a-diagnostic-bundle","content":"**Settings → Logs and Diagnostics**","locale":"en"},"3668":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting-28","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting#choose-a-diagnostic-bundle","content":"Instance diagnostics focus on the current instance. Application diagnostics can include all instances if configured. Do not collect every instance by default merely to obtain “more information”; choose the smallest scope that covers the issue.","locale":"en"},"3669":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting-29","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting#help-request-template","content":"Under **Actions already attempted**, state what changed and whether the error changed. Do not write only “I tried everything online.” If you deleted anything, reinstalled dependencies, or ran a Git reset, disclose that too; otherwise maintainers may draw the wrong conclusion from an environment that has already changed.","locale":"en"},"3670":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting-30","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting#choose-the-right-support-channel","content":"Hanafubuki cannot prepare the runtime, manage tasks, persist settings, or render a window: report it to Hanafubuki maintainers.","locale":"en"},"3671":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting-31","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting#choose-the-right-support-channel","content":"WebUI Core reports an error in an instance that has already started: report it to the corresponding WebUI project.","locale":"en"},"3672":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting-32","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting#choose-the-right-support-channel","content":"Only one extension or custom node fails: read its documentation first, then report it to the extension author.","locale":"en"},"3673":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting-33","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting#choose-the-right-support-channel","content":"A model or workflow has missing components or incompatible versions: contact the publisher and include the required dependency information.","locale":"en"},"3674":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting-34","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting#choose-the-right-support-channel","content":"Once you confirm the issue comes from Hanafubuki, search Hanafubuki GitHub\nIssues for an existing report. For a new issue, use\nthe template above and include reproducible steps, the complete error, and necessary logs. Never\nupload a diagnostic bundle containing credentials or private data publicly.","locale":"en"},"3675":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting-35","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting#choose-the-right-support-channel","content":"<Card title=\"Report a Hanafubuki issue\" href=\"https://github.com/licyk/Hanafubuki/issues\" description=\"Search existing issues or submit a new bug report.\" />","locale":"en"},"3676":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting-36","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting#choose-the-right-support-channel","content":"<Card title=\"Instance diagnostics\" href=\"/docs/instance-diagnostics\" description=\"Collect and export an instance diagnostic bundle.\" />","locale":"en"},"3677":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting-37","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting#choose-the-right-support-channel","content":"<Card title=\"Application diagnostics\" href=\"/docs/settings-diagnostics\" description=\"Configure the application-level diagnostic scope.\" />","locale":"en"},"3678":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting-38","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting#choose-the-right-support-channel","content":"<Card title=\"Log settings\" href=\"/docs/settings-logs\" description=\"Adjust log level, files, and retention.\" />","locale":"en"},"3679":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting-39","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-reporting#choose-the-right-support-channel","content":"<Card title=\"Upstream WebUI issues\" href=\"/docs/troubleshooting-webui\" description=\"Determine which project should receive an error report.\" />","locale":"en"},"3680":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","type":"page","content":"Task Contention and Cleanup","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki Documentation","Troubleshooting"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","locale":"en"},"3681":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-0","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","content":"Handle cancellation, pending cleanup, maintenance locks, lingering terminals, and duplicate tasks.","locale":"en"},"3682":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-1","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#understand-task-states","content":"Understand task states","locale":"en"},"3683":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-2","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#cancel-a-task-correctly","content":"Cancel a task correctly","locale":"en"},"3684":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-3","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#the-instance-reports-that-it-is-in-use","content":"The instance reports that it is in use","locale":"en"},"3685":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-4","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#background-terminals-and-long-running-commands","content":"Background terminals and long-running commands","locale":"en"},"3686":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-5","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#when-a-business-operation-can-be-retried","content":"When a business operation can be retried","locale":"en"},"3687":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-6","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","content":"Hanafubuki retains ownership of tasks and processes until it confirms that the process has ended and its resources have been released. Therefore, **Cancellation requested**, a command producing no new output, and a closed window do not mean that task cleanup has completed.","locale":"en"},"3688":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-7","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#understand-task-states","content":"State","locale":"en"},"3689":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-8","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#understand-task-states","content":"Meaning","locale":"en"},"3690":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-9","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#understand-task-states","content":"What to do","locale":"en"},"3691":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-10","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#understand-task-states","content":"Running","locale":"en"},"3692":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-11","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#understand-task-states","content":"A backend task or child process is still working","locale":"en"},"3693":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-12","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#understand-task-states","content":"Inspect output, wait, or request cancellation","locale":"en"},"3694":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-13","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#understand-task-states","content":"Canceling/Stopping","locale":"en"},"3695":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-14","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#understand-task-states","content":"A request was sent, but a terminal state is not confirmed","locale":"en"},"3696":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-15","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#understand-task-states","content":"Wait; do not create a replacement task","locale":"en"},"3697":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-16","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#understand-task-states","content":"Failed","locale":"en"},"3698":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-17","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#understand-task-states","content":"The business operation failed; its process may or may not be cleaned up","locale":"en"},"3699":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-18","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#understand-task-states","content":"Expand the error and cleanup status","locale":"en"},"3700":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-19","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#understand-task-states","content":"Awaiting cleanup","locale":"en"},"3701":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-20","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#understand-task-states","content":"Termination, absence, or metadata release could not be confirmed","locale":"en"},"3702":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-21","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#understand-task-states","content":"Use the cleanup retry provided by the original task","locale":"en"},"3703":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-22","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#understand-task-states","content":"Canceled/Completed","locale":"en"},"3704":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-23","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#understand-task-states","content":"The task reached a terminal state","locale":"en"},"3705":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-24","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#understand-task-states","content":"Start the next operation afterward","locale":"en"},"3706":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-25","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#understand-task-states","content":"Task Center lists running activities, activities requiring attention, failures, and recently completed activities. When a bottom-right status item on the current page and Task Center refer to the same backend task, do not cancel it separately in both places.","locale":"en"},"3707":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-26","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#cancel-a-task-correctly","content":"Open the log and confirm whether the cancellation request arrived and the child process began\nexiting.","locale":"en"},"3708":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-27","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#cancel-a-task-correctly","content":"Wait for the interface to show canceled, failed, or completed. Do not close the application as a\nsubstitute for cancellation.","locale":"en"},"3709":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-28","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#cancel-a-task-correctly","content":"When **Retry process cleanup** appears, use it to continue the same cleanup obligation.","locale":"en"},"3710":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-29","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#cancel-a-task-correctly","content":"Only reinstall, start, migrate, or delete after Task Center no longer shows a running or pending\nstate.","locale":"en"},"3711":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-30","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#cancel-a-task-correctly","content":"Force-ending a process from the system task manager may temporarily prevent Hanafubuki from confirming resource state. If force is unavoidable, save the logs first, then return to the original task and retry cleanup. Do not immediately delete the task record or instance directory.","locale":"en"},"3712":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-31","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#the-instance-reports-that-it-is-in-use","content":"Installation, startup, management, terminal, and maintenance operations on one instance must be coordinated. If an in-use message or maintenance lock appears:","locale":"en"},"3713":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-32","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#the-instance-reports-that-it-is-in-use","content":"Filter Task Center for running activities belonging to that instance.","locale":"en"},"3714":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-33","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#the-instance-reports-that-it-is-in-use","content":"Open **Instance information** and inspect startup and management state.","locale":"en"},"3715":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-34","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#the-instance-reports-that-it-is-in-use","content":"Check whether an instance terminal is still running or failed to clean up.","locale":"en"},"3716":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-35","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#the-instance-reports-that-it-is-in-use","content":"If migration, reinstallation, or deletion was interrupted, return to **Maintenance** and continue the same recovery operation.","locale":"en"},"3717":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-36","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#the-instance-reports-that-it-is-in-use","content":"Do not create another instance at the same path or manually move a directory that is being recovered.","locale":"en"},"3718":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-37","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#the-instance-reports-that-it-is-in-use","content":"Different instances can operate concurrently. If every instance is blocked, investigate the application runtime or shared runtime instead of attributing the issue to a lock on one instance.","locale":"en"},"3719":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-38","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#background-terminals-and-long-running-commands","content":"An instance terminal may remain available after you leave the page; return to recover its output.","locale":"en"},"3720":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-39","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#background-terminals-and-long-running-commands","content":"Agent background terminals use `/ps` for inspection and `/stop` for cleanup. This is distinct from stopping the current Agent response.","locale":"en"},"3721":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-40","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#background-terminals-and-long-running-commands","content":"Development servers and file watchers may produce no new output while still occupying ports and files.","locale":"en"},"3722":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-41","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#background-terminals-and-long-running-commands","content":"If a terminal reports **Cleanup failed**, retry closing the same session instead of repeatedly creating new terminals.","locale":"en"},"3723":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-42","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#when-a-business-operation-can-be-retried","content":"Retry only when all of the following are true:","locale":"en"},"3724":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-43","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#when-a-business-operation-can-be-retried","content":"The original task reached a completed, failed, or canceled terminal state.","locale":"en"},"3725":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-44","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#when-a-business-operation-can-be-retried","content":"No **Awaiting cleanup** or **Recovery required** notice remains.","locale":"en"},"3726":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-45","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#when-a-business-operation-can-be-retried","content":"Related processes and terminals are confirmed stopped.","locale":"en"},"3727":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-46","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#when-a-business-operation-can-be-retried","content":"The instance maintenance lock has been released.","locale":"en"},"3728":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-47","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#when-a-business-operation-can-be-retried","content":"The network, permission, path, or configuration cause of the first failure has changed.","locale":"en"},"3729":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-48","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#when-a-business-operation-can-be-retried","content":"Submitting the same input repeatedly without addressing the cause usually produces the same error and adds cleanup work.","locale":"en"},"3730":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-49","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#when-a-business-operation-can-be-retried","content":"<Card title=\"Installation troubleshooting\" href=\"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting\" description=\"Handle installation cancellation, cleanup, and retries.\" />","locale":"en"},"3731":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-50","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#when-a-business-operation-can-be-retried","content":"<Card title=\"Instance maintenance\" href=\"/docs/instance-maintenance\" description=\"Recover migration, reinstallation, and deletion operations.\" />","locale":"en"},"3732":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-51","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#when-a-business-operation-can-be-retried","content":"<Card title=\"Instance terminal\" href=\"/docs/instance-terminal\" description=\"Close or recover instance terminal sessions.\" />","locale":"en"},"3733":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-52","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#when-a-business-operation-can-be-retried","content":"<Card title=\"Agent tools and terminals\" href=\"/docs/agent-tools-terminals\" description=\"Manage Agent background commands.\" />","locale":"en"},"3734":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","type":"page","content":"Upstream WebUI Issues","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki Documentation","Troubleshooting"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","locale":"en"},"3735":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-0","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","content":"Identify model, extension, node, generation, and WebUI interface errors and find the appropriate issue tracker.","locale":"en"},"3736":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-1","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#preserve-the-core-error-first","content":"Preserve the core error first","locale":"en"},"3737":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-2","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#narrow-the-issue-by-symptom","content":"Narrow the issue by symptom","locale":"en"},"3738":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-3","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#use-hanafubuki-for-minimal-diagnosis","content":"Use Hanafubuki for minimal diagnosis","locale":"en"},"3739":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-4","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#sd-note-knowledge-base","content":"SD Note knowledge base","locale":"en"},"3740":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-5","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#who-should-receive-the-report","content":"Who should receive the report","locale":"en"},"3741":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-6","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","content":"Once WebUI has a reachable address, errors that occur while generating images, loading models, running workflows, using extensions, or operating the WebUI page usually come from WebUI Core, an extension, a model, or instance dependencies. They are outside Hanafubuki's interface and task system.","locale":"en"},"3742":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-7","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#preserve-the-core-error-first","content":"A Python traceback begins with `Traceback (most recent call last):` and lists the call path. The final unindented exception type and description are often the best search terms, for example:","locale":"en"},"3743":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-8","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#preserve-the-core-error-first","content":"Do not copy only that line. When asking for help, include the complete traceback, the extension or node name preceding the error, the current model, and the operation steps. Different components can trigger the same exception.","locale":"en"},"3744":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-9","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#narrow-the-issue-by-symptom","content":"Symptom","locale":"en"},"3745":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-10","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#narrow-the-issue-by-symptom","content":"Check first","locale":"en"},"3746":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-11","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#narrow-the-issue-by-symptom","content":"CUDA, Torch, or GPU unavailable","locale":"en"},"3747":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-12","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#narrow-the-issue-by-symptom","content":"GPU driver, instance PyTorch, and current platform combination","locale":"en"},"3748":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-13","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#narrow-the-issue-by-symptom","content":"Out of RAM or VRAM, NaN output, or black images","locale":"en"},"3749":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-14","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#narrow-the-issue-by-symptom","content":"Resolution, batch size, precision, VAE, VRAM strategy, and model compatibility","locale":"en"},"3750":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-15","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#narrow-the-issue-by-symptom","content":"LoRA, ControlNet, VAE, or text-encoder error","locale":"en"},"3751":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-16","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#narrow-the-issue-by-symptom","content":"Whether the model family matches its required components","locale":"en"},"3752":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-17","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#narrow-the-issue-by-symptom","content":"`ImportError`, `No module named`, or extension load failure","locale":"en"},"3753":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-18","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#narrow-the-issue-by-symptom","content":"Extension, dependency, and version corresponding to the error path","locale":"en"},"3754":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-19","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#narrow-the-issue-by-symptom","content":"Missing or red ComfyUI nodes","locale":"en"},"3755":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-20","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#narrow-the-issue-by-symptom","content":"Whether custom nodes are installed and imported successfully, plus inputs and upstream-node parameters","locale":"en"},"3756":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-21","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#narrow-the-issue-by-symptom","content":"Compressed WebUI layout, broken buttons, or models cannot be switched","locale":"en"},"3757":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-22","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#narrow-the-issue-by-symptom","content":"Browser translation, cache, extension frontend scripts, and WebUI version","locale":"en"},"3758":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-23","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#narrow-the-issue-by-symptom","content":"Generate button does nothing while the process remains active","locale":"en"},"3759":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-24","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#narrow-the-issue-by-symptom","content":"Browser console, WebUI terminal log, and queue state","locale":"en"},"3760":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-25","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#use-hanafubuki-for-minimal-diagnosis","content":"Create an environment snapshot and record the current Core, extensions, PyTorch, and model\nstate.","locale":"en"},"3761":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-26","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#use-hanafubuki-for-minimal-diagnosis","content":"Determine whether the error occurs only with a particular model, workflow, node, or extension.","locale":"en"},"3762":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-27","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#use-hanafubuki-for-minimal-diagnosis","content":"Inspect the traceback path. Disable or update the extension directly named there first; do not\nuninstall every extension at once.","locale":"en"},"3763":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-28","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#use-hanafubuki-for-minimal-diagnosis","content":"Use the **Versions**, **Extensions**, **PyTorch**, and **Models** pages for managed operations,\nreproducing the same scenario after each change.","locale":"en"},"3764":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-29","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#use-hanafubuki-for-minimal-diagnosis","content":"When package-inspection commands are necessary, run them in the instance terminal. Do not modify\nthe instance environment from the generic application terminal.","locale":"en"},"3765":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-30","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#sd-note-knowledge-base","content":"SD Note collects many common SD WebUI and ComfyUI errors and explains how to extract errors from the console. Once you confirm that the issue is upstream in WebUI, choose the relevant WebUI type:","locale":"en"},"3766":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-31","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#sd-note-knowledge-base","content":"<Card title=\"SD Note help overview\" href=\"https://sdnote.netlify.app/help/\" description=\"Learn how to find errors, search, and prepare support information.\" />","locale":"en"},"3767":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-32","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#sd-note-knowledge-base","content":"<Card title=\"Common SD WebUI issues\" href=\"https://sdnote.netlify.app/help/sd_webui/\" description=\"Look up SD WebUI, Forge, model, and extension errors.\" />","locale":"en"},"3768":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-33","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#sd-note-knowledge-base","content":"<Card title=\"Common ComfyUI issues\" href=\"https://sdnote.netlify.app/help/comfyui/\" description=\"Look up node, workflow, dependency, and custom-node errors.\" />","locale":"en"},"3769":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-34","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#sd-note-knowledge-base","content":"Some SD Note instructions target the Huishi Launcher. The root cause and upstream remedy may still\nbe relevant, but version, extension, PyTorch, terminal, proxy, and environment operations must be\nperformed on the corresponding Hanafubuki pages. Do not copy another launcher's managed\ndirectories or directly run its launcher-specific repair commands.","locale":"en"},"3770":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-35","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#sd-note-knowledge-base","content":"If SD Note does not cover the issue, search official repository issues using the exception type, final-line description, WebUI name, and extension name. Prefer guidance from Core or extension authors, and check which versions and operating systems a solution applies to.","locale":"en"},"3771":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-36","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#who-should-receive-the-report","content":"Scope","locale":"en"},"3772":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-37","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#who-should-receive-the-report","content":"Recommended recipient","locale":"en"},"3773":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-38","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#who-should-receive-the-report","content":"Hanafubuki cannot install, start, or manage an instance","locale":"en"},"3774":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-39","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#who-should-receive-the-report","content":"Hanafubuki maintainers","locale":"en"},"3775":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-40","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#who-should-receive-the-report","content":"WebUI Core reproduces in a standalone environment","locale":"en"},"3776":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-41","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#who-should-receive-the-report","content":"The corresponding official WebUI repository","locale":"en"},"3777":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-42","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#who-should-receive-the-report","content":"The issue appears only after enabling one extension or node","locale":"en"},"3778":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-43","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#who-should-receive-the-report","content":"Extension or node author","locale":"en"},"3779":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-44","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#who-should-receive-the-report","content":"The issue occurs only with one model or workflow","locale":"en"},"3780":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-45","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#who-should-receive-the-report","content":"Model or workflow publisher, after checking dependency requirements","locale":"en"},"3781":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-46","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#who-should-receive-the-report","content":"Mention that WebUI was launched with Hanafubuki, but do not provide only a Hanafubuki screenshot. Upstream maintainers usually need the WebUI version, complete traceback, and minimal reproduction steps.","locale":"en"},"3782":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-47","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#who-should-receive-the-report","content":"<Card title=\"Versions\" href=\"/docs/instance-versions\" description=\"Inspect and adjust Core, extension, and PyTorch versions.\" />","locale":"en"},"3783":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-48","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#who-should-receive-the-report","content":"<Card title=\"Extensio