th\nthe preview lists and your independent backups."],[3109,"“Current”: the variant that actually matches the Core repository now;"],[2920,"“Delete” removes both the Registry record and the associated file and cannot be undone."],[2777,"“Ignore Once” is appropriate when you have confirmed that a branch-specific argument is still\nvalid. If the launch still fails, return to this page and correct the arguments instead of\nrepeatedly ignoring the same warning."],[2918,"“Import Local Model,” or drag and drop, passes a local file to the InvokeAI registration workflow."],[2917,"“Install from URL” asks InvokeAI to download and register the model."],[2935,"“Instance Information” is the starting point for diagnosing instance problems. The page refreshes automatically and reads instance identity, paths, environment, services, hotpatch runtime status, WebUI addresses, and error history from the backend."],[2720,"“Normalize” asks the backend to reconcile the draft with the current catalog, such as filling in, converting, or rejecting values that violate field constraints. It is not the same as applying the configuration to a running WebUI."],[906,"“PyTorch”页会检查实例 Python 中的 Torch 组件、检测到的设备类型，并列出当前 WebUI 支持的安装组合。不同 WebUI、操作系统和硬件看到的选项可能不同。"],[3110,"“Reinstallation”: the variant saved in the instance record and used for future reinstalls."],[2959,"“Show in File Manager” opens the instance root, not the Core or model directory."],[2919,"“Unregister” removes only the Registry record; the model file remains on disk."],[3133,"“Update Current Branch” fetches and updates the current branch. “Switch Branch” selects a local or remote branch. The commit list lets you locate and switch to a specific commit. Reload branches or commits first when you need the latest remote data."],[2958,"“View Launch Task” opens the phases and output of the current launch. “View Logs” in error history opens the exact task in which that error occurred."],[1462,"“仅本次忽略”只适合确认当前分支仍接受该参数，不应长期跳过同一警告。"],[1372,"“仍然运行”