ion to files, commands, or external services."],[3781,"Mention that WebUI was launched with Hanafubuki, but do not provide only a Hanafubuki screenshot. Upstream maintainers usually need the WebUI version, complete traceback, and minimal reproduction steps."],[2265,"Messages and Attachments"],[2108,"Messages and tool records remain visible in the interface. Compaction changes the context used by\nthe next model request. Repeated compaction gradually summarizes older content, so restate\nimportant constraints in a new message."],[2297,"Metadata is removed from images, and animated images use only a still frame. When the model policy is **Auto**, the application sends images according to known capabilities. If the model explicitly rejects images before producing any output, the application may remove them and retry once. Images cannot be sent when the model policy is **Disabled**."],[1295,"Micromamba"],[3436,"Micromamba"],[3452,"Micromamba failure: confirm that a second application process is not using the runtime and that the destination disk is writable."],[3355,"Micromamba mirror"],[1272,"Micromamba 可执行文件；"],[1310,"Micromamba 失败：确认没有第二个应用进程占用运行时，并检查目标磁盘是否可写。"],[1225,"Micromamba 镜像"],[2784,"Migrate an instance"],[2805,"Migrate instance"],[2997,"Migrate the instance"],[3394,"Migrating managed runtime storage"],[3422,"Migration does not merge runtime content into an existing directory. During migration, do not move\nthe source directory, create the destination in advance, or start a second Hanafubuki process."],[2828,"Migration does not scan for or rewrite absolute paths inside `.pth` files, scripts, environment variables, or other files. If a third-party component recorded the old location, correct it after migration using that component's own procedure."],[2822,"Migration moves the complete instance root; it does not merely update a path setting. The page requires an existing destination parent directory. The backend appends the current instance directory name and r